"community","skillMd":{"name":"heroui-react","description":"HeroUI v3 React component library (Tailwind CSS v4 + React Aria). Use when working with HeroUI components, installing HeroUI, customizing HeroUI themes, or accessing HeroUI component documentation. Keywords: HeroUI, Hero UI, heroui, @heroui/react, @heroui/styles.","version":"2.0.0","bodyPreview":"# HeroUI v3 React Development Guide\n\nHeroUI v3 is a component library built on **Tailwind CSS v4** and **React Aria Components**, providing accessible, customizable UI components for React applications.\n\n---\n\n## CRITICAL: v3 Only - Ignore v2 Knowledge\n\n**This guide is for HeroUI v3 ONLY.** Do NOT use any prior knowledge of HeroUI v2.\n\n### What Changed in v3\n\n| Feature       | v2 (DO NOT USE)                   | v3 (USE THIS)                               |\n| ------------- | ---------------------","body":"# HeroUI v3 React Development Guide\n\nHeroUI v3 is a component library built on **Tailwind CSS v4** and **React Aria Components**, providing accessible, customizable UI components for React applications.\n\n---\n\n## CRITICAL: v3 Only - Ignore v2 Knowledge\n\n**This guide is for HeroUI v3 ONLY.** Do NOT use any prior knowledge of HeroUI v2.\n\n### What Changed in v3\n\n| Feature       | v2 (DO NOT USE)                   | v3 (USE THIS)                               |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Provider      | `<HeroUIProvider>` required       | **No Provider needed**                      |\n| Animations    | `framer-motion` package           | CSS-based, no extra deps                    |\n| Component API | Flat props: `<Card title=\"x\">`    | Compound: `<Card><Card.Header>`             |\n| Styling       | Tailwind v3 + `@heroui/theme`     | Tailwind v4 + `@heroui/styles@beta`         |\n| Packages      | `@heroui/system`, `@heroui/theme` | `@heroui/react@beta`, `@heroui/styles@beta` |\n\n### WRONG (v2 patterns)\n\n```tsx\n// DO NOT DO THIS - v2 pattern\nimport { HeroUIProvider } from \"@heroui/react\";\nimport { motion } from \"framer-motion\";\n\n<HeroUIProvider>\n\t<Card title=\"Product\" description=\"A great product\" />\n</HeroUIProvider>;\n```\n\n### CORRECT (v3 patterns)\n\n```tsx\n// DO THIS - v3 pattern (no provider, compound components)\nimport { Card } from \"@heroui/react@beta\";\n\n<Card>\n\t<Card.Header>\n\t\t<Card.Title>Product</Card.Title>\n\t\t<Card.Description>A great product</Card.Description>\n\t</Card.Header>\n</Card>;\n```\n\n**Always fetch v3 docs before implementing.** Do not assume v2 patterns work.\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- Semantic variants (`primary`, `secondary`, `tertiary`) over visual descriptions\n- Composition over configuration (compound components)\n- CSS variable-based theming with `oklch` color space\n- BEM naming convention for predictable styling\n\n---\n\n## Accessing Documentation & Component Information\n\n**For component details, examples, props, and implementation patterns, always fetch documentation:**\n\n### Using Scripts\n\n```bash\n# List all available components\nnode scripts/list_components.mjs\n\n# Get component documentation (MDX)\nnode scripts/get_component_docs.mjs Button\nnode scripts/get_component_docs.mjs Button Card TextField\n\n# Get component source code\nnode scripts/get_source.mjs Button\n\n# Get component CSS styles (BEM classes)\nnode scripts/get_styles.mjs Button\n\n# Get theme variables\nnode scripts/get_theme.mjs\n\n# Get non-component docs (guides, releases)\nnode scripts/get_docs.mjs /docs/react/getting-started/theming\n```\n\n### Direct MDX URLs\n\nComponent docs: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/components/{component-name}.mdx`\n\nExamples:\n\n- Button: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/components/button.mdx`\n- Modal: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/components/modal.mdx`\n- Form: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/components/form.mdx`\n\nGetting started guides: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/getting-started/{topic}.mdx`\n\n**Important:** Always fetch component docs before implementing. The MDX docs include complete examples, props, anatomy, and API references.\n\n---\n\n## Installation Essentials\n\n**CRITICAL**: HeroUI v3 is currently in BETA. Always use `@beta` tag when installing packages.\n\n### Quick Install\n\n```bash\nnpm i @heroui/styles@beta @heroui/react@beta tailwind-variants\n```\n\n### Framework Setup (Next.js App Router - Recommended)\n\n1. **Install dependencies:**\n\n```bash\nnpm i @heroui/styles@beta @heroui/react@beta tailwind-variants tailwindcss @tailwindcss/postcss postcss\n```\n\n2. **Create/update `app/globals.css`:**\n\n```css\n/* Tailwind CSS v4 - Must be first */\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n/* HeroUI v3 styles - Must be after Tailwind */\n@import \"@heroui/styles\";\n```\n\n3. **Import in `app/layout.tsx`:**\n\n```tsx\nimport \"./globals.css\";\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n\tchildren,\n}: {\n\tchildren: React.ReactNode;\n}) {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n\t\t\t<body>\n\t\t\t\t{/* No Provider needed in HeroUI v3! */}\n\t\t\t\t{children}\n\t\t\t</body>\n\t\t</html>\n\t);\n}\n```\n\n4. **Configure PostCSS (`postcss.config.mjs`):**\n\n```js\nexport default {\n\tplugins: {\n\t\t\"@tailwindcss/postcss\": {},\n\t},\n};\n```\n\n### Critical Setup Requirements\n\n1. **Tailwind CSS v4 is MANDATORY** - HeroUI v3 will NOT work with Tailwind CSS v3\n2. **No Provider Required** - Unlike HeroUI v2, v3 components work directly without a Provider\n3. **Use Compound Components** - Components use compound structure (e.g., `Card.Header`, `Card.Content`)\n4. **Use onPress, not onClick** - For better accessibility, use `onPress` event handlers\n5. **Import Order Matters** - Always import Tailwind CSS before HeroUI styles\n\n---\n\n## Component Patterns\n\nHeroUI v3 uses **compound component patterns**. Each component has subcomponents accessed via dot notation.\n\n**Example - Card:**\n\n```tsx\n<Card>\n\t<Card.Header>\n\t\t<Card.Title>Title</Card.Title>\n\t\t<Card.Description>Description</Card.Description>\n\t</Card.Header>\n\t<Card.Content>{/* Content */}</Card.Content>\n\t<Card.Footer>{/* Actions */}</Card.Footer>\n</Card>\n```\n\n**Key Points:**\n\n- Always use compound structure - don''t flatten to props\n- Subcomponents are accessed via dot notation (e.g., `Card.Header`)\n- Each subcomponent may have its own props\n- **Fetch component docs for complete anatomy and examples**\n\n---\n\n## Semantic Variants\n\nHeroUI uses semantic naming to communicate functional intent:\n\n| Variant     | Purpose                           | Usage          |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------- | -------------- |\n| `primary`   | Main action to move forward       | 1 per context  |\n| `secondary` | Alternative actions               | Multiple       |\n| `tertiary`  | Dismissive actions (cancel, skip) | Sparingly      |\n| `danger`    | Destructive actions               | When needed    |\n| `ghost`     | Low-emphasis actions              | Minimal weight |\n| `outline`   | Secondary actions                 | Bordered style |\n\n**Don''t use raw colors** - semantic variants adapt to themes and accessibility.\n\n---\n\n## Theming\n\nHeroUI v3 uses CSS variables with `oklch` color space:\n\n```css\n:root {\n\t--accent: oklch(0.6204 0.195 253.83);\n\t--accent-foreground: var(--snow);\n\t--background: oklch(0.9702 0 0);\n\t--foreground: var(--eclipse);\n}\n```\n\n**Get current theme variables:**\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/get_theme.mjs\n```\n\n**Color naming:**\n\n- Without suffix = background (e.g., `--accent`)\n- With `-foreground` = text color (e.g., `--accent-foreground`)\n\n**Theme switching:**\n\n```html\n<html class=\"dark\" data-theme=\"dark\"></html>\n```\n\nFor detailed theming, fetch: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/getting-started/theming.mdx`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:09:04.333Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing accessible and customizable React UI components built on Tailwind CSS v4 and React Aria Components.","zh":"非常适合需要可访问和可定制的React UI组件的前端代理，尤其是那些建立在Tailwind CSS v4和React Aria Components之上的。","ja":"React UIコンポーネントをアクセスし、カスタマイズできるフロントエンドエージェントに最適で、特にTailwind CSS v4とReact Aria Componentsを使用する場合。","ko":"액세스 가능한 리액트 UI 컴포넌트가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 Tailwind CSS v4와 React Aria Components를 기반으로 하는 경우에 최적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario de React accesibles y personalizables construidos en Tailwind CSS v4 y React Aria Components.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur React accessibles et personnalisables construits sur Tailwind CSS v4 et React Aria Components.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die zugängliche und anpassbare React-Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten benötigen, die auf Tailwind CSS v4 und React Aria Components aufbauen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de componentes de UI do React acessíveis e personalizáveis construídos com Tailwind CSS v4 e Componentes do React Aria.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы доступные и настраиваемые компоненты React UI, построенные на Tailwind CSS v4 и компонентах React Aria.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والتفصيل المخصصة التي تم إنشاؤها على Tailwind CSS v4 ومكونات React Aria."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create beautiful, fast, and modern React applications with HeroUI v3, leveraging its comprehensive library of accessible UI components and seamless integration with Tailwind CSS v4 for styling and React Aria Components for accessibility.","zh":"赋予代理创建美观、快速、现代化的React应用程序的能力，利用HeroUI v3的全面UI组件库，并通过Tailwind CSS v4实现样式和React Aria Components的无缝集成。","ja":"HeroUI v3を使用して、美しい、高速な、モダンなReactアプリケーションを作成するエージェントの能力を高め、包括的なUIコンポーネントライブラリとTailwind CSS v4、React Aria Componentsとのシームレスな統合を提供する。","ko":"HeroUI v3를 사용하여 아름답고, 빠르고, 현대적인 리액트 애플리케이션을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화하며, 포괄적인 UI 컴포넌트 라이브러리와 Tailwind CSS v4 및 React Aria Components와의 무결한 통합을 제공한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones React hermosas, rápidas y modernas con HeroUI v3, aprovechando su biblioteca integral de componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y la integración sin problemas con Tailwind CSS v4 para el estilo y React Aria Components para la accesibilidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications React belles, rapides et modernes avec HeroUI v3, en exploitant sa bibliothèque complète de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et l''intégration transparente avec Tailwind CSS v4 pour le style et React Aria Components pour l''accessibilité.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mit HeroUI v3 schöne, schnelle und moderne React-Anwendungen zu erstellen, indem es auf seine umfassende Bibliothek zugänglicher Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten und die nahtlose Integration mit Tailwind CSS v4 für das Styling und React Aria Components für die Zugänglichkeit zurückgreift.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar aplicativos React bonitos, rápidos e modernos com o HeroUI v3, aproveitando sua biblioteca abrangente de componentes de UI acessíveis e integração perfeita com o Tailwind CSS v4 para estilização e componentes do React Aria para acessibilidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать красивые, быстрые и современные приложения React с HeroUI v3, используя его всестороннюю библиотеку доступных компонентов UI и бесшовную интеграцию с Tailwind CSS v4 для стилизации и компонентов React Aria для обеспечения доступности.","ar":"تمكين العميل من إنشاء تطبيقات React جميلة وسريعة وحديثة مع HeroUI v3، مستفيدا من مكتبته الشاملة لمكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والدمج السلس مع Tailwind CSS v4 لأغراض التنسيق ومكونات React Aria للوصول."},"useCases":{"en":["Building responsive and accessible React dashboards","Customizing UI components for brand consistency","Developing modern web applications with HeroUI v3''s pre-built components"],"zh":["构建响应式和可访问的React仪表板","为品牌一致性自定义UI组件","使用HeroUI v3的预构建组件开发现代Web应用程序"],"ja":["レスポンシブでアクセス可能なReactダッシュボードの構築","ブランド一致性のためにUIコンポーネントをカスタマイズする","HeroUI v3の事前構築コンポーネントを使用してモダンなWebアプリケーションを開発する"],"ko":["반응형 및 액세스 가능한 리액트 대시보드를 구축하는 것","브랜드 일관성을 위해 UI 컴포넌트를 사용자 지정하는 것","HeroUI v3의 사전 구축 컴포넌트를 사용하여 현대적인 웹 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Construir paneles de React responsivos y accesibles","Personalizar componentes de interfaz de usuario para la coherencia de la marca","Desarrollar aplicaciones web modernas con los componentes preconstruidos de HeroUI v3"],"fr":["Créer des tableaux de bord React responsifs et accessibles","Personnaliser les composants d''interface utilisateur pour la cohérence de la marque","Développer des applications web modernes avec les composants préconstruits de HeroUI v3"],"de":["Erstellen von responsiven und zugänglichen React-Dashboards","Anpassen von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für Markenkontinuität","Entwicklung von modernen Webanwendungen mit den vorgefertigten Komponenten von HeroUI v3"],"pt":["Construção de painéis do React responsivos e acessíveis","Personalização de componentes de UI para consistência da marca","Desenvolvimento de aplicações web modernas com componentes pré-construídos do HeroUI v3"],"ru":["Создание отзывчивых и доступных панелей управления React","Настройка компонентов UI для поддержания единства бренда","Разработка современных веб-приложений с помощью предварительно созданных компонентов HeroUI v3"],"ar":["بناء لوحات تحكم React المستجيبة والقابلة للوصول","تخصيص مكونات واجهة المستخدم لتوحيد العلامة التجارية","تطوير تطبيقات الويب الحديثة باستخدام المكونات المسبقة من HeroUI v3"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React environment","Specific to HeroUI v3, ignoring prior versions"],"zh":["需要React环境","特定于HeroUI v3，忽略之前的版本"],"ja":["React環境が必要","HeroUI v3に特有で、以前のバージョンは無視する"],"ko":["리액트 환경이 필요함","HeroUI v3에 특정되어 있으며, 이전 버전은 무시함"],"es":["Requiere entorno de React","Específico de HeroUI v3, ignorando versiones anteriores"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React","Spécifique à HeroUI v3, en ignorant les versions antérieures"],"de":["Benötigt React-Umgebung","Spezifisch für HeroUI v3, wobei vorherige Versionen ignoriert werden"],"pt":["Exige ambiente do React","Específico para o HeroUI v3, ignorando versões anteriores"],"ru":["Требует среды React","Специфичен для HeroUI v3, игнорируя предыдущие версии"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React","محدد لبرنامج HeroUI v3، مع تجاهل الإصدارات السابقة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"677bc9af34543cfa9f111125f8cadfdbdd5d2a958d75aa01605fccf5b6946e92","qualityScore":36}');
