1つのウォレット、402倍のマイクロペイメントに対応","ko":"Clawrouter는 스마트 LLM 라우팅을 구현하는 에이전트로, 30개 이상의 모델, 하나의 지갑, 402배의 마이크로 결제를 지원","es":"Clawrouter es un router de LLM inteligente que reduce costos de inferencia en un 78% con 30+ modelos y micropagos x402","fr":"Clawrouter est un routeur LLM intelligent qui réduit les coûts d''inférence de 78% avec 30+ modèles et des micropaiements x402","de":"Clawrouter ist ein intelligenter LLM-Router, der die Inferenzkosten um 78% reduziert, mit 30+ Modellen und x402 Mikrozahlungen","pt":"O clawrouter é um roteador de LLM inteligente que economiza 78% em custos de inferência.","ru":"clawrouter - это умный маршрутизатор LLM, который экономит 78% на затраты инференции.","ar":"clawrouter - أداة ل 路 تير","en":"Smart LLM router — save 78% on inference costs. 30+ models, one wallet, x402 micropayments."},"definition":{"en":"Smart LLM router — save 78% on inference costs. 30+ models, one wallet, x402 micropayments."},"features":{"zh":["支持30+模型","一个钱包，402倍微支付","节省78%的推理成本","智能LLM路由","高性能推理"],"ja":["30以上のモデルに対応","1つのウォレット、402倍のマイクロペイメント","78%の推論コストを節約","スマートLLMルーティング","高性能推論"],"ko":["30개 이상의 모델 지원","하나의 지갑, 402배의 마이크로 결제","78%의 추론 비용 절감","스마트 LLM 라우팅","고성능 추론"],"es":["Reducción del 78% en costos de inferencia","30+ modelos de lenguaje disponibles","Un solo wallet para todos los modelos","x402 micropagos para una mayor flexibilidad","Integración sencilla con aplicaciones existentes"],"fr":["Réduction de 78% des coûts d''inférence","30+ modèles de langage disponibles","Un seul portefeuille pour tous les modèles","x402 micropaiements pour une plus grande flexibilité","Intégration simple avec les applications existantes"],"de":["Reduzierung der Inferenzkosten um 78%","30+ Sprachmodelle verfügbar","Ein einziges Wallet für alle Modelle","x402 Mikrozahlungen für eine größere Flexibilität","Einfache Integration mit bestehenden Anwendungen"],"pt":["Economia de 78% em custos de inferência","Suporte a mais de 30 modelos de LLM","Um só carteira para todos os modelos","Micropayments de até x402"],"ru":["Экономия 78% на затраты инференции","Поддержка более 30 моделей LLM","Один кошелек для всех моделей","Микроплатежи до x402"],"ar":["clawrouter - أداة ل 路 تير","دعم أكثر من 30 نموذج LLM","محفظة واحدة لجميع النماذج","ميكروبايمنتات حتى x402"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能路由器","LLM推理成本优化","Clawrouter安装","Clawrouter设置指南","Clawrouter替代品","Clawrouter vs 其他AI工具","如何使用Clawrouter","什么是Clawrouter"],"ja":["AIエージェント","LLMの推論コスト最適化","Clawrouterのインストール","Clawrouterの設定ガイド","Clawrouterの代替品","Clawrouter vs その他のAIツール","Clawrouterの使い方","Clawrouterとは"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","LLM의 추론 비용 최적화","Clawrouter 설치","Clawrouter 설정 가이드","Clawrouter 대체품","Clawrouter vs 다른 AI 도구","Clawrouter 사용법","Clawrouter란"],"es":["cómo usar clawrouter","qué es un router de LLM","alternativas a clawrouter","clawrouter vs otros routers de LLM","instalación de clawrouter","guía de configuración de clawrouter","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","modelos de lenguaje para aplicaciones"],"fr":["comment utiliser clawrouter","qu''est-ce qu''un routeur LLM","alternatives à clawrouter","clawrouter vs autres routeurs LLM","installation de clawrouter","guide de configuration de clawrouter","outils d''IA pour développeurs","modèles de langage pour applications"],"de":["wie man clawrouter verwendet","was ist ein LLM-Router","Alternativen zu clawrouter","clawrouter vs andere LLM-Router","Installation von clawrouter","Einrichtungsanleitung für clawrouter","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Sprachmodelle für Anwendungen"],"pt":["clawrouter","roteador de LLM","economia de custos de inferência","como usar clawrouter","clawrouter vs outros roteadores de LLM","instalar clawrouter"],"ru":["clawrouter","маршрутизатор LLM","экономия затрат инференции","как использовать clawrouter","clawrouter vs другие маршрутизаторы LLM","установка clawrouter"],"ar":["clawrouter","أداة ل 路 تير","تخفيض التكاليف","كيفية استخدام clawrouter","clawrouter vs أدوات ل 路 تير","تثبيت clawrouter"]}},"owner":"BlockRunAI","repo":"ClawRouter","repoPath":"BlockRunAI/ClawRouter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.885Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clawrouter","description":"Smart LLM router — save 67% on inference costs. Routes every request to the cheapest capable model across 41 models from OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, DeepSeek, and xAI.","bodyPreview":"# ClawRouter\n\nSmart LLM router that saves 67% on inference costs by routing each request to the cheapest model that can handle it. 41 models across 5 providers, all through one wallet.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nopenclaw plugins install @blockrun/clawrouter\n```\n\n## Setup\n\n```bash\n# Enable smart routing (auto-picks cheapest model per request)\nopenclaw models set blockrun/auto\n\n# Or pin a specific model\nopenclaw models set openai/gpt-4o\n```\n\n## How Routing Works\n\nClawRouter classifies each request into","body":"# ClawRouter\n\nSmart LLM router that saves 67% on inference costs by routing each request to the cheapest model that can handle it. 41 models across 5 providers, all through one wallet.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nopenclaw plugins install @blockrun/clawrouter\n```\n\n## Setup\n\n```bash\n# Enable smart routing (auto-picks cheapest model per request)\nopenclaw models set blockrun/auto\n\n# Or pin a specific model\nopenclaw models set openai/gpt-4o\n```\n\n## How Routing Works\n\nClawRouter classifies each request into one of four tiers:\n\n- **SIMPLE** (40% of traffic) — factual lookups, greetings, translations → Gemini Flash ($0.60/M, 99% savings)\n- **MEDIUM** (30%) — summaries, explanations, data extraction → DeepSeek Chat ($0.42/M, 99% savings)\n- **COMPLEX** (20%) — code generation, multi-step analysis → Claude Opus ($75/M, best quality)\n- **REASONING** (10%) — proofs, formal logic, multi-step math → o3 ($8/M, 89% savings)\n\nRules handle ~80% of requests in <1ms. Only ambiguous queries hit the LLM classifier (~$0.00003 per classification).\n\n## Available Models\n\n41 models including: gpt-5.2, gpt-4o, gpt-4o-mini, o3, o1, claude-opus-4.6, claude-sonnet-4.6, claude-haiku-4.5, gemini-3.1-pro, gemini-2.5-pro, gemini-2.5-flash, gemini-2.5-flash-lite, deepseek-chat, deepseek-reasoner, grok-3, grok-3-mini.\n\n## Example Output\n\n```\n[ClawRouter] google/gemini-2.5-flash (SIMPLE, rules, confidence=0.92)\n             Cost: $0.0025 | Baseline: $0.308 | Saved: 99.2%\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:09:05.174Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cost-Optimized AI Agents needing smart LLM routing capabilities to minimize inference costs.","zh":"非常适合需要智能 LLM 路由功能以最小化推理成本的成本优化 AI 代理。","ja":"コスト最適化された AI エージェントが推論コストを最小限に抑えるためのスマートな LLM ルーティング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"추론 비용을 최소화하기 위한 스마트한 LLM 라우팅 기능이 필요한 비용 최적화 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA con optimización de costos que necesitan capacidades de enrutamiento de LLM inteligentes para minimizar los costos de inferencia.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA à optimisation de coûts nécessitant des capacités de routage LLM intelligentes pour minimiser les coûts d''inférence.","de":"Perfekt für kostengesteuerte KI-Agents, die intelligente LLM-Weiterleitungs-Funktionen benötigen, um Inferenzkosten zu minimieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Otimizados de Custo que precisam de capacidades de roteamento LLM inteligentes para minimizar os custos de inferência.","ru":"Идеально подходит для оптимизированных по стоимости агентов ИИ, которым необходимы умные возможности маршрутизации LLM для минимизации затрат на вывод.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المثاليين التكلفة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات التوجيه LLM الذكية لتقليل تكاليف الاستدلال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to route requests to the cheapest model that can handle it, supporting 30+ models and micropayments, all through one wallet, utilizing providers like OpenAI and Blockrun.","zh":"赋予代理路由请求到可以处理它的最便宜的模型的能力，支持 30 多个模型和微支付，所有这些都通过一个钱包实现，利用像 OpenAI 和 Blockrun 这样的提供商。","ja":"エージェントに、リクエストをそれを処理できる最も安いモデルにルーティングする能力を与え、30 を超えるモデルやマイクロペイメントをサポートし、すべてを 1 つのウォレットを通じて実現する。OpenAI や Blockrun などのプロバイダーを利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 요청을 처리할 수 있는 가장 저렴한 모델로 요청을 라우팅할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 30개 이상의 모델 및 미시 결제를 지원하며, 모두 단일 지갑을 통해 구현되며, OpenAI 및 Blockrun과 같은 공급자를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a enrutrar solicitudes al modelo más barato que pueda manejarlas, soportando más de 30 modelos y micropagos, todo a través de una sola billetera, utilizando proveedores como OpenAI y Blockrun.","fr":"Permet aux agents de router les requêtes vers le modèle le moins cher capable de les gérer, en prenant en charge plus de 30 modèles et des micropaiements, le tout via un seul portefeuille, en utilisant des fournisseurs tels que OpenAI et Blockrun.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Anfragen an das günstigste Modell zu weiterleiten, das es verarbeiten kann, und unterstützt dabei über 30 Modelle und Mikrozahlungen, alles über eine einzige Brieftasche, wobei Anbieter wie OpenAI und Blockrun verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a encaminhar solicitações para o modelo mais barato que possa lidar com ele, suportando 30+ modelos e micropagamentos, todos por meio de uma carteira, utilizando provedores como OpenAI e Blockrun.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью маршрутизировать запросы к самому дешевому модели, который может с ним справиться, поддерживая более 30 моделей и микроплатежи, все через один кошелек, используя провайдеров, таких как OpenAI и Blockrun.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من توجيه الطلبات إلى أخفض نموذج يمكنه التعامل معها، ودعم أكثر من 30 نموذجًا ودفعات الدفع الصغيرة، وجميعها من خلال محفظة واحدة، باستخدام مزودين مثل OpenAI و Blockrun."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating model selection for cost optimization","Routing requests to cheapest available models across 5 providers","Handling micropayments for over 400 requests"],"zh":["为成本优化自动选择模型","跨 5 个提供商路由请求到最便宜的可用模型","处理超过 400 个请求的微支付"],"ja":["コスト最適化のためのモデル自動選択","5 つのプロバイダーを跨いで最も安い利用可能なモデルへのリクエストのルーティング","400 を超えるリクエストのマイクロペイメントの処理"],"ko":["비용 최적화를 위한 모델 자동 선택","5개 공급자跨으로 가장 저렴한 사용 가능한 모델로 요청 라우팅","400개 이상의 요청에 대한 미시 결제 처리"],"es":["Automatización de la selección de modelos para la optimización de costos","Enrutamiento de solicitudes a los modelos más baratos disponibles en 5 proveedores","Gestión de micropagos para más de 400 solicitudes"],"fr":["Automatisation de la sélection de modèles pour l''optimisation des coûts","Acheminement des requêtes vers les modèles les moins chers disponibles auprès de 5 fournisseurs","Gestion des micropaiements pour plus de 400 requêtes"],"de":["Automatisierung der Modellauswahl für die Kostenoptimierung","Weiterleiten von Anfragen an die günstigsten verfügbaren Modelle bei 5 Anbietern","Verwaltung von Mikrozahlungen für über 400 Anfragen"],"pt":["Automatizar a seleção de modelo para otimização de custo","Encaminhar solicitações para os modelos mais baratos disponíveis em 5 provedores","Lidar com micropagamentos para mais de 400 solicitações"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выбор модели для оптимизации затрат","Маршрутизировать запросы к самым дешевым доступным моделям у 5 провайдеров","Обрабатывать микроплатежи для более 400 запросов"],"ar":["توفير أتمتة اختيار النموذج لتحسين التكلفة","توجيه الطلبات إلى أخفض النماذج المتاحة عبر 5 مزودين","التعامل مع الدفعات الصغيرة للدفع لأكثر من 400 طلب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation of @blockrun/clawrouter plugin","Dependent on OpenClaw for setup and model management"],"zh":["需要安装 @blockrun/clawrouter 插件","依赖于 OpenClaw 进行设置和模型管理"],"ja":["@blockrun/clawrouter プラグインのインストールが必要","OpenClaw への依存が必要であるため設定とモデル管理"],"ko":["@blockrun/clawrouter 플러그인을 설치해야 함","설정 및 모델 관리를 위해 OpenClaw에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del plugin @blockrun/clawrouter","Dependiente de OpenClaw para la configuración y la gestión de modelos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du plugin @blockrun/clawrouter","Dépend de OpenClaw pour la configuration et la gestion des modèles"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des @blockrun/clawrouter-Plugins","Abhängig von OpenClaw für die Einrichtung und Modellverwaltung"],"pt":["Exige a instalação do plugin @blockrun/clawrouter","Depende do OpenClaw para configuração e gerenciamento de modelo"],"ru":["Требует установки плагина @blockrun/clawrouter","Зависит от OpenClaw для настройки и управления моделями"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت البرنامج المساعد @blockrun/clawrouter","يعتمد على OpenClaw لإعدادات وإدارة النماذج"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ac56e6c5625f557bdd0026928414a05da981708b1827343f15142e3db241a2a5","qualityScore":36}');
