ko":["Next.js 프론트엔드 프레임워크","FastAPI 백엔드 프레임워크","Flutter 모바일 애플리케이션 개발","Terraform 인프라스트럭처 즉 코드","Mise 프로젝트 관리"],"es":["Plantilla de monorepo lista para producción","Integración con Next.js y FastAPI","Compatibilidad con Flutter y Terraform","Incluye mise para la gestión de estado","Ideal para proyectos de fullstack"],"fr":["Modèle de monorepo prêt pour la production","Intégration avec Next.js et FastAPI","Compatibilité avec Flutter et Terraform","Inclut mise pour la gestion d''état","Idéal pour les projets fullstack"],"de":["Produktionsbereite Monorepo-Vorlage","Integration mit Next.js und FastAPI","Kompatibilität mit Flutter und Terraform","Inklusive mise für Statusverwaltung","Ideal für Fullstack-Projekte"],"pt":["Integração com Next.js","Suporte a FastAPI","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis com Flutter","Gerenciamento de infraestrutura com Terraform","Otimização de desempenho com mise"],"ru":["Интеграция с Next.js","Поддержка FastAPI","Разработка мобильных приложений на Flutter","Управление инфраструктурой с помощью Terraform","Оптимизация производительности с mise"],"ar":["التكامل مع Next.js","دعم FastAPI","تطوير تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول مع Flutter","إدارة البنية التحتية مع Terraform","تحسين الأداء مع mise"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Paid Ads开发","全栈模板","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","Mise","如何使用Paid Ads模板","Paid Ads模板安装","Paid Ads开发教程"],"ja":["Paid Ads開発","フルスタックテンプレート","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","Mise","Paid Adsテンプレートの使用方法","Paid Adsテンプレートのインストール","Paid Ads開発ガイド"],"ko":["Paid Ads 개발","풀스택 템플릿","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","Mise","Paid Ads 템플릿 사용법","Paid Ads 템플릿 설치","Paid Ads 개발 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI Agent","plantilla monorepo","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","desarrollo fullstack","cómo usar AI Agent","alternativas a AI Agent"],"fr":["outils d''Agent IA","modèle de monorepo","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","développement fullstack","comment utiliser Agent IA","alternatives à Agent IA"],"de":["AI-Agent-Tools","Monorepo-Vorlage","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","Fullstack-Entwicklung","wie man AI-Agent verwendet","Alternativen zu AI-Agent"],"pt":["como usar Next.js","o que é FastAPI","guia de instalação do Flutter","configuração do Terraform","otimização de desempenho com mise","alternativas ao Next.js","Next.js vs React"],"ru":["как использовать Next.js","что такое FastAPI","руководство по установке Flutter","настройка Terraform","оптимизация производительности с mise","альтернативы Next.js","Next.js vs React"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Next.js","ما هي FastAPI","دليل تثبيت Flutter","تكوين Terraform","تحسين الأداء مع mise","بديل Next.js","Next.js مقابل React"]}},"owner":"first-fluke","repo":"fullstack-starter","repoPath":"first-fluke/fullstack-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.922Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paid-ads","description":"When the user wants help with paid advertising campaigns on Google Ads, Meta (Facebook/Instagram), LinkedIn, Twitter/X, or other ad platforms. Also use when the user mentions PPC, paid media, ad copy, ad creative, ROAS, CPA, ad campaign, retargeting, or audience targeting. This skill covers campaign strategy, ad creation, audience targeting, and optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Paid Ads\n\nYou are an expert performance marketer with direct access to ad platform accounts. Your goal is to help create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns that drive efficient customer acquisition.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):","body":"# Paid Ads\n\nYou are an expert performance marketer with direct access to ad platform accounts. Your goal is to help create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns that drive efficient customer acquisition.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Campaign Goals\n- What''s the primary objective? (Awareness, traffic, leads, sales, app installs)\n- What''s the target CPA or ROAS?\n- What''s the monthly/weekly budget?\n- Any constraints? (Brand guidelines, compliance, geographic)\n\n### 2. Product & Offer\n- What are you promoting? (Product, free trial, lead magnet, demo)\n- What''s the landing page URL?\n- What makes this offer compelling?\n\n### 3. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer?\n- What problem does your product solve for them?\n- What are they searching for or interested in?\n- Do you have existing customer data for lookalikes?\n\n### 4. Current State\n- Have you run ads before? What worked/didn''t?\n- Do you have existing pixel/conversion data?\n- What''s your current funnel conversion rate?\n\n---\n\n## Platform Selection Guide\n\n| Platform | Best For | Use When |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| **Google Ads** | High-intent search traffic | People actively search for your solution |\n| **Meta** | Demand generation, visual products | Creating demand, strong creative assets |\n| **LinkedIn** | B2B, decision-makers | Job title/company targeting matters, higher price points |\n| **Twitter/X** | Tech audiences, thought leadership | Audience is active on X, timely content |\n| **TikTok** | Younger demographics, viral creative | Audience skews 18-34, video capacity |\n\n---\n\n## Campaign Structure Best Practices\n\n### Account Organization\n\n```\nAccount\n├── Campaign 1: [Objective] - [Audience/Product]\n│   ├── Ad Set 1: [Targeting variation]\n│   │   ├── Ad 1: [Creative variation A]\n│   │   ├── Ad 2: [Creative variation B]\n│   │   └── Ad 3: [Creative variation C]\n│   └── Ad Set 2: [Targeting variation]\n└── Campaign 2...\n```\n\n### Naming Conventions\n\n```\n[Platform]_[Objective]_[Audience]_[Offer]_[Date]\n\nExamples:\nMETA_Conv_Lookalike-Customers_FreeTrial_2024Q1\nGOOG_Search_Brand_Demo_Ongoing\nLI_LeadGen_CMOs-SaaS_Whitepaper_Mar24\n```\n\n### Budget Allocation\n\n**Testing phase (first 2-4 weeks):**\n- 70% to proven/safe campaigns\n- 30% to testing new audiences/creative\n\n**Scaling phase:**\n- Consolidate budget into winning combinations\n- Increase budgets 20-30% at a time\n- Wait 3-5 days between increases for algorithm learning\n\n---\n\n## Ad Copy Frameworks\n\n### Key Formulas\n\n**Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS):**\n> [Problem] → [Agitate the pain] → [Introduce solution] → [CTA]\n\n**Before-After-Bridge (BAB):**\n> [Current painful state] → [Desired future state] → [Your product as bridge]\n\n**Social Proof Lead:**\n> [Impressive stat or testimonial] → [What you do] → [CTA]\n\n**For detailed templates and headline formulas**: See [references/ad-copy-templates.md](references/ad-copy-templates.md)\n\n---\n\n## Audience Targeting Overview\n\n### Platform Strengths\n\n| Platform | Key Targeting | Best Signals |\n|----------|---------------|--------------|\n| Google | Keywords, search intent | What they''re searching |\n| Meta | Interests, behaviors, lookalikes | Engagement patterns |\n| LinkedIn | Job titles, companies, industries | Professional identity |\n\n### Key Concepts\n\n- **Lookalikes**: Base on best customers (by LTV), not all customers\n- **Retargeting**: Segment by funnel stage (visitors vs. cart abandoners)\n- **Exclusions**: Always exclude existing customers and recent converters\n\n**For detailed targeting strategies by platform**: See [references/audience-targeting.md](references/audience-targeting.md)\n\n---\n\n## Creative Best Practices\n\n### Image Ads\n- Clear product screenshots showing UI\n- Before/after comparisons\n- Stats and numbers as focal point\n- Human faces (real, not stock)\n- Bold, readable text overlay (keep under 20%)\n\n### Video Ads Structure (15-30 sec)\n1. Hook (0-3 sec): Pattern interrupt, question, or bold statement\n2. Problem (3-8 sec): Relatable pain point\n3. Solution (8-20 sec): Show product/benefit\n4. CTA (20-30 sec): Clear next step\n\n**Production tips:**\n- Captions always (85% watch without sound)\n- Vertical for Stories/Reels, square for feed\n- Native feel outperforms polished\n- First 3 seconds determine if they watch\n\n### Creative Testing Hierarchy\n1. Concept/angle (biggest impact)\n2. Hook/headline\n3. Visual style\n4. Body copy\n5. CTA\n\n---\n\n## Campaign Optimization\n\n### Key Metrics by Objective\n\n| Objective | Primary Metrics |\n|-----------|-----------------|\n| Awareness | CPM, Reach, Video view rate |\n| Consideration | CTR, CPC, Time on site |\n| Conversion | CPA, ROAS, Conversion rate |\n\n### Optimization Levers\n\n**If CPA is too high:**\n1. Check landing page (is the problem post-click?)\n2. Tighten audience targeting\n3. Test new creative angles\n4. Improve ad relevance/quality score\n5. Adjust bid strategy\n\n**If CTR is low:**\n- Creative isn''t resonating → test new hooks/angles\n- Audience mismatch → refine targeting\n- Ad fatigue → refresh creative\n\n**If CPM is high:**\n- Audience too narrow → expand targeting\n- High competition → try different placements\n- Low relevance score → improve creative fit\n\n### Bid Strategy Progression\n1. Start with manual or cost caps\n2. Gather conversion data (50+ conversions)\n3. Switch to automated with targets based on historical data\n4. Monitor and adjust targets based on results\n\n---\n\n## Retargeting Strategies\n\n### Funnel-Based Approach\n\n| Funnel Stage | Audience | Message | Goal |\n|--------------|----------|---------|------|\n| Top | Blog readers, video viewers | Educational, social proof | Move to consideration |\n| Middle | Pricing/feature page visitors | Case studies, demos | Move to decision |\n| Bottom | Cart abandoners, trial users | Urgency, objection handling | Convert |\n\n### Retargeting Windows\n\n| Stage | Window | Frequency Cap |\n|-------|--------|---------------|\n| Hot (cart/trial) | 1-7 days | Higher OK |\n| Warm (key pages) | 7-30 days | 3-5x/week |\n| Cold (any visit) | 30-90 days | 1-2x/week |\n\n### Exclusions to Set Up\n- Existing customers (unless upsell)\n- Recent converters (7-14 day window)\n- Bounced visitors (<10 sec)\n- Irrelevant pages (careers, support)\n\n---\n\n## Reporting & Analysis\n\n### Weekly Review\n- Spend vs. budget pacing\n- CPA/ROAS vs. targets\n- Top and bottom performing ads\n- Audience performance breakdown\n- Frequency check (fatigue risk)\n- Landing page conversion rate\n\n### Attribution Considerations\n- Platform attribution is inflated\n- Use UTM parameters consistently\n- Compare platform data to GA4\n- Look at blended CAC, not just platform CPA\n\n---\n\n## Platform Setup\n\nBefore launching campaigns, ensure proper tracking and account setup.\n\n**For complete setup checklists by platform**: See [references/platform-setup-checklists.md](references/platform-setup-checklists.md)\n\n### Universal Pre-Launch Checklist\n- [ ] Conversion tracking tested with real conversion\n- [ ] Landing page loads fast (<3 sec)\n- [ ] Landing page mobile-friendly\n- [ ] UTM parameters working\n- [ ] Budget set correctly\n- [ ] Targeting matches intended audience\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n### Strategy\n- Launching without conversion tracking\n- Too many campaigns (fragmenting budget)\n- Not giving algorithms enough learning time\n- Optimizing for wrong metric\n\n### Targeting\n- Audiences too narrow or too broad\n- Not excluding existing customers\n- Overlapping audiences competing\n\n### Creative\n- Only one ad per ad set\n- Not refreshing creative (fatigue)\n- Mismatch between ad and landing page\n\n### Budget\n- Spreading too thin across campaigns\n- Making big budget changes (disrupts learning)\n- Stopping campaigns during learning phase\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What platform(s) are you currently running or want to start with?\n2. What''s your monthly ad budget?\n3. What does a successful conversion look like (and what''s it worth)?\n4. Do you have existing creative assets or need to create them?\n5. What landing page will ads point to?\n6. Do you have pixel/conversion tracking set up?\n\n---\n\n## Tool Integrations\n\nFor implementation, see the [tools registry](../../tools/REGISTRY.md). Key advertising platforms:\n\n| Platform | Best For | MCP | Guide |\n|----------|----------|:---:|-------|\n| **Google Ads** | Search intent, high-intent traffic | ✓ | [google-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/google-ads.md) |\n| **Meta Ads** | Demand gen, visual products, B2C | - | [meta-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/meta-ads.md) |\n| **LinkedIn Ads** | B2B, job title targeting | - | [linkedin-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/linkedin-ads.md) |\n| **TikTok Ads** | Younger demographics, video | - | [tiktok-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/tiktok-ads.md) |\n\nFor tracking, see also: [ga4.md](../../tools/integrations/ga4.md), [segment.md](../../tools/integrations/segment.md)\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copywriting**: For landing page copy that converts ad traffic\n- **analytics-tracking**: For proper conversion tracking setup\n- **ab-test-setup**: For landing page testing to improve ROAS\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing post-click conversion rates\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:24.373Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced paid advertising campaign optimization and customer acquisition strategies.","zh":"非常适合需要高级付费广告活动优化和客户获取策略的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度な有料広告キャンペーンの最適化と顧客の取得戦略を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 유료 광고 캠페인 최적화 및 고객 확보 전략이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan una optimización avanzada de campañas publicitarias pagas y estrategias de adquisición de clientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents marketing qui ont besoin d''une optimisation avancée des campagnes publicitaires payantes et de stratégies d''acquisition de clients.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Optimierung von Paid-Advertising-Kampagnen und Kundenakquise-Strategien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que precisam de otimização avançada de campanhas publicitárias pagas e estratégias de aquisição de clientes.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходима продвинутая оптимизация платных рекламных кампаний и стратегии привлечения клиентов.","ar":"مثالي لعمال التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين متقدم لحملات الإعلانات المدفوعة واستراتيجيات الحصول على العملاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns using Next.js, FastAPI, and Terraform, driving efficient customer acquisition through data-driven decision making and access to ad platform accounts.","zh":"通过Next.js、FastAPI和Terraform赋予代理创建、优化和扩大有料广告活动的能力，通过数据驱动的决策和访问广告平台账户来实现高效的客户获取。","ja":"Next.js、FastAPI、Terraformを使用して、エージェントが有料広告キャンペーンを作成、最適化、拡大できるようにし、データドリブンの意思決定と広告プラットフォームアカウントへのアクセスを通じて効率的な顧客の取得を実現します。","ko":"Next.js, FastAPI 및 Terraform를 사용하여 에이전트가 유료 광고 캠페인을 생성, 최적화 및 확장할 수 있도록 하여 데이터 驱动 의 의사결정과 광고 플랫폼 계정에 대한 액세스를 통해 효율적인 고객 확보를 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, optimizar y ampliar campañas publicitarias pagas utilizando Next.js, FastAPI y Terraform, lo que impulsa la adquisición eficiente de clientes a través de la toma de decisiones basada en datos y el acceso a cuentas de plataformas de publicidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, d''optimiser et de faire évoluer des campagnes publicitaires payantes en utilisant Next.js, FastAPI et Terraform, ce qui impulse l''acquisition efficace de clients grâce à la prise de décision basée sur les données et l''accès aux comptes de plateformes de publicité.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, bezahlte Werbekampagnen mithilfe von Next.js, FastAPI und Terraform zu erstellen, zu optimieren und zu skalieren, wodurch eine effiziente Kundenakquise durch datengetriebene Entscheidungsfindung und Zugriff auf Werbeplattform-Konten ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, otimizar e dimensionar campanhas publicitárias pagas usando Next.js, FastAPI e Terraform, impulsionando a aquisição eficiente de clientes por meio de tomada de decisões baseada em dados e acesso a contas de plataformas de anúncios.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, оптимизировать и масштабировать платные рекламные кампании с помощью Next.js, FastAPI и Terraform, обеспечивая эффективное привлечение клиентов посредством принятия решений на основе данных и доступа к учетным записям рекламных платформ.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء حملات إعلانية مدفوعة وتحسينها وتوسيعها باستخدام Next.js و FastAPI و Terraform، مما يدفع الحصول الفعال على العملاء من خلال اتخاذ قرارات مدفوعة بالبيانات ووصول إلى حسابات منصات الإعلانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating targeted ad campaigns","Optimizing ad spend for maximum ROI","Scaling customer acquisition through data analysis"],"zh":["创建定向广告活动","优化广告支出以实现最大化ROI","通过数据分析扩大客户获取规模"],"ja":["ターゲットを絞った広告キャンペーンの作成","広告支出の最適化による最大のROIの実現","データ分析を通じた顧客の取得の拡大"],"ko":["대상 고객을 위한 광고 캠페인 생성","광고 비용 최적화로 최대 ROI 달성","데이터 분석을 통한 고객 확보 확대"],"es":["Creación de campañas publicitarias dirigidas","Optimización del gasto publicitario para un máximo de ROI","Escalado de la adquisición de clientes a través del análisis de datos"],"fr":["Création de campagnes publicitaires ciblées","Optimisation des dépenses publicitaires pour un ROI maximum","Évolution de l''acquisition de clients grâce à l''analyse de données"],"de":["Erstellung von gezielten Werbekampagnen","Optimierung der Werbeausgaben für ein maximales ROI","Skalierung der Kundenakquise durch Datenanalyse"],"pt":["Criação de campanhas publicitárias direcionadas","Otimização do gasto publicitário para máximo ROI","Dimensionamento da aquisição de clientes por meio da análise de dados"],"ru":["Создание целевых рекламных кампаний","Оптимизация рекламных расходов для максимального ROI","Масштабирование привлечения клиентов через анализ данных"],"ar":["إنشاء حملات إعلانية مستهدفة","تحسين إنفاق الإعلانات للحصول على أعلى عائد على الاستثمار","توسيع الحصول على العملاء من خلال تحليل البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to ad platform accounts","Dependent on product marketing context for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要访问广告平台账户","依赖于产品营销环境以实现最佳性能"],"ja":["広告プラットフォームアカウントへのアクセスが必要","最適なパフォーマンスを実現するために製品マーケティングの文脈に依存する"],"ko":["광고 플랫폼 계정에 대한 액세스가 필요","최적의 성능을 달성하기 위해 제품 마케팅 환경에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a cuentas de plataformas de publicidad","Depende del contexto de marketing de productos para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux comptes de plateformes de publicité","Dépend du contexte de marketing de produits pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf Werbeplattform-Konten","Hängt vom Produktmarketing-Kontext für optimale Leistung ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso a contas de plataformas de anúncios","Dependente do contexto de marketing de produtos para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует доступа к учетным записям рекламных платформ","Зависит от контекста маркетинга продукта для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى حسابات منصات الإعلانات","يعتمد على سياق تسويق المنتج لأداء مثالي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"29d1f50e17b59b04556191bf82a77e51f72ce34d3034525f017d4835109ed35a","qualityScore":36}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jeninh/ampskills-dotfile/invoking-subagents', 'community', 'jeninh', 'ampskills-dotfile', 'jeninh/ampskills-dotfile', 'invoking-subagents', 0, 0, 36, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.925Z', '2026-03-02T02:27:26.867Z', 'c7b1f4ba8fdb376e73c1f55572be9cf64a0d5993ecb4491ee6d2fdf9a4d579b1', '{"id":"jeninh/ampskills-dotfile/invoking-subagents","name":"invoking-subagents","description":{"zh":"调用子代理技能是AI工具中的一个重要功能，允许开发者扩展其功能","ja":"サブエージェントの呼び出しスキルは、AIエージェントの重要な機能であり、開発者が機能を拡張できるようにします","ko":"하위 에이전트 호출 기능은 AI 도구의 중요한 기능으로 개발자가 기능을 확장할 수 있게 해줍니다","es":"La habilidad de invocación de subagentes de IA permite a los desarrolladores mejorar sus flujos de trabajo de desarrollo","fr":"La compétence d''invocation de sous-agents d''IA permet aux développeurs d''améliorer leurs flux de travail de développement","de":"Die Fähigkeit zum Aufruf von Subagenten von IA ermöglicht es Entwicklern, ihre Entwicklungsworkflows zu verbessern","pt":"A habilidade de invocação de subagentes permite que os desenvolvedores criem fluxos de trabalho mais eficientes","ru":"Навык вызова подагентов позволяет разработчикам создавать более эффективные рабочие процессы","ar":"ميزة استدعاء الوكلاء الفرعيين تمكن المطورين من إنشاء سير عمل أكثر كفاءة","en":"credit to Amolith - https://git.secluded.site/agent-skills/blob/main/skills/formatting-commits/SKILL.md"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：调用子代理","ja":"AIエージェント：サブエージェントの呼び出し","ko":"AI 도구: 하위 에이전트 호출","es":"Herramientas de Invocación de Subagentes de IA","fr":"Outils d''Invocation de Sous-Agents d''IA","de":"AI-Subagenten-Aufruf-Tools","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Invocação de Subagentes","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Вызов Подагентов","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: استدعاء الوكلاء الفرعيين","en":"invoking-subagents"},"description":{"zh":"调用子代理技能是AI工具中的一个重要功能，允许开发者扩展其功能","ja":"サブエージェントの呼び出しスキルは、AIエージェントの重要な機能であり、開発者が機能を拡張できるようにします","ko":"하위 에이전트 호출 기능은 AI 도구의 중요한 기능으로 개발자가 기능을 확장할 수 있게 해줍니다","es":"La habilidad de invocación de subagentes de IA permite a los desarrolladores mejorar sus flujos de trabajo de desarrollo","fr":"La compétence d''invocation de sous-agents d''IA permet aux développeurs d''améliorer leurs flux de travail de développement","de":"Die Fähigkeit zum Aufruf von Subagenten von IA ermöglicht es Entwicklern, ihre Entwicklungsworkflows zu verbessern","pt":"A habilidade de invocação de subagentes permite que os desenvolvedores criem fluxos de trabalho mais eficientes","ru":"Навык вызова подагентов позволяет разработчикам создавать более эффективные рабочие процессы","ar":"ميزة استدعاء الوكلاء الفرعيين تمكن المطورين من إنشاء سير عمل أكثر كفاءة","en":"credit to Amolith - https://git.secluded.site/agent-skills/blob/main/skills/formatting-commits/SKILL.md"},"definition":{"en":"credit to Amolith - https://git.secluded.site/agent-skills/blob/main/skills/formatting-commits/SKILL.md"},"features":{"zh":["支持多个子代理的调用","提供灵活的任务执行机制","提高AI工具的扩展性和可定制性","支持多种编程语言和框架","提供详细的日志记录和调试功能"],"ja":["複数のサブエージェントの呼び出しをサポート","柔軟なタスク実行メカニズムを提供","AIエージェントの拡張性とカスタマイズ性を高める","複数のプログラミング言語とフレームワークをサポート","詳細なログ記録とデバッグ機能を提供"],"ko":["다수의 하위 에이전트 호출을 지원","유연한 작업 실행 메커니즘을 제공","AI 도구의 확장성과 맞춤성을 높임","다수의 프로그래밍 언어와 프레임워크를 지원","詳細한 로그 기록과 디버깅 기능을 제공"],"es":["Invocación de subagentes de IA","Mejora de los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Automatización de tareas","Flexibilidad y personalización"],"fr":["Invocation de sous-agents d''IA","Amélioration des flux de travail de développement","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Automatisation de tâches","Flexibilité et personnalisation"],"de":["Aufruf von Subagenten von IA","Verbesserung der Entwicklungsworkflows","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Flexibilität und Anpassung"],"pt":["Criação de fluxos de trabalho automatizados","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Melhoria da eficiência do workflow","Suporte a múltiplos subagentes","Facilidade de uso e configuração"],"ru":["Создание автоматизированных рабочих процессов","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Улучшение эффективности рабочего процесса","Поддержка нескольких подагентов","Легкость использования и настройки"],"ar":["إنشاء سير عمل آلي","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تحسين كفاءة سير العمل","دعم الوكلاء الفرعيين المتعددين","سهولة الاستخدام والتهيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","调用子代理","AI开发","子代理调用","AI工具扩展","如何使用AI工具","AI工具安装","AI工具设置指南","AI工具与其他工具的比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント","サブエージェントの呼び出し","AI開発","サブエージェントの呼び出し方法","AIエージェントの拡張","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド","AIエージェントと他のツールの比較"],"ko":["AI 도구","하위 에이전트 호출","AI 개발","하위 에이전트 호출 방법","AI 도구 확장","AI 도구 사용법","AI 도구 설치","AI 도구 설정 가이드","AI 도구와 다른 도구의 비교"],"es":["cómo usar subagentes de IA","qué es la invocación de subagentes de IA","herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","invocación de subagentes de IA vs otros métodos","instalación de subagentes de IA","guía de configuración de subagentes de IA","mejores prácticas para la invocación de subagentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser des sous-agents d''IA","quoi est l''invocation de sous-agents d''IA","outils d''IA pour développeurs","invocation de sous-agents d''IA vs autres méthodes","installation de sous-agents d''IA","guide de configuration de sous-agents d''IA","meilleures pratiques pour l''invocation de sous-agents d''IA"],"de":["wie man Subagenten von IA verwendet","was ist der Aufruf von Subagenten von IA","IA-Tools für Entwickler","Aufruf von Subagenten von IA vs andere Methoden","Installation von Subagenten von IA","Konfigurationsleitfaden für Subagenten von IA","beste Praktiken für den Aufruf von Subagenten von IA"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","invocação de subagentes","fluxos de trabalho automatizados","desenvolvimento de software","otimização de workflow","guias de instalação","configuração de subagentes","alternativas de ferramentas de ia","comparação de ferramentas de ia"],"ru":["ии агенты","вызов подагентов","автоматизированные рабочие процессы","разработка программного обеспечения","оптимизация рабочего процесса","руководства по установке","настройка подагентов","альтернативы ии агентов","сравнение ии агентов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","استدعاء الوكلاء الفرعيين","سير عمل آلي","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين كفاءة سير العمل","دليل التثبيت","تهيئة الوكلاء الفرعيين","بديل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مقارنة أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"jeninh","repo":"ampskills-dotfile","repoPath":"jeninh/ampskills-dotfile","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.925Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"invoking-subagents","description":"Spawns subagents with configurable tool access that return just the answers without flooding your context. Use for summarizing extensive git history, comparing across multiple repositories in parallel, or processing large diffs/logs.","bodyPreview":"Invoke with `synu claude --flags -p ''prompt''`.\n\n**Important:** Subagents are scoped to their cwd, just like you. To work in another repository, `cd` there first.\n\nUse a precise and thorough prompt. Aggressively restrict which tools it can interact with; if it doesn''t need Edit, don''t give it Edit. If it needs to read files, Glob, Grep, and Read are probably sufficient. Task can be helpful. Notebook, Slash, Write, Web, Edit, etc. should almost never be necessary. Execute them in the background. Y","body":"Invoke with `synu claude --flags -p ''prompt''`.\n\n**Important:** Subagents are scoped to their cwd, just like you. To work in another repository, `cd` there first.\n\nUse a precise and thorough prompt. Aggressively restrict which tools it can interact with; if it doesn''t need Edit, don''t give it Edit. If it needs to read files, Glob, Grep, and Read are probably sufficient. Task can be helpful. Notebook, Slash, Write, Web, Edit, etc. should almost never be necessary. Execute them in the background. You may invoke multiple when appropriate and in parallel if helpful. Once they''re running, you may either stop and wait for me to tell you they''re finished or continue with other work.\n\nExample exploring git history in another repo:\n\n```bash\ncd /path/to/other/repo && fish -c \"synu claude --disallowed-tools ''Bash(*) Explore Edit Read WebFetch WebSearch Glob Grep NotebookEdit NotebookRead SlashCommand Write'' --allowed-tools ''Bash(git log:*) Bash(git show:*)'' -p ''Using only git log and git show, summarise the major user-facing changes in HASH..HASH. Do not provide code snippets or technical details. Consider user-facing changes, like being able to set a port-out PIN or adding a new button or changing font sizes.''\"\n```\n\nRefer to [installing-synu.md](references/installing-synu.md) if it''s unavailable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:27:26.867Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents requiring multi-tasking capabilities through subagent invocation","zh":"适用于需要通过子代理调用实现多任务处理的高级 AI 代理","ja":"サブエージェントの呼び出しを通じてマルチタスク機能を必要とする高度な AI エージェントに最適","ko":"서브 에이전트 호출을 통해 멀티 태스킹 기능을 필요로 하는 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados que requieren capacidades de multitarea a través de la invocación de subagentes","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA avancés nécessitant des capacités de multitâche via l''invocation de sous-agents","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents, die Multitasking-Fähigkeiten durch die Aufrufung von Subagenten erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados que exigem capacidades de multitarefa por meio de invocação de subagentes","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых агентов ИИ, требующих функций многозадачности посредством вызова субагентов","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذي يتطلب القدرات متعددة المهام من خلال استدعاء وكلاء فرعيين"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute tasks in the background, utilizing tools like Glob, Grep, and Read, while aggressively restricting interactions to necessary tools and protocols, ensuring secure and efficient task management via precise prompts and scoped subagents","zh":"赋予代理在后台执行任务的能力，利用诸如 Glob、Grep 和 Read 等工具，同时通过精确的提示和作用域子代理来限制工具和协议的交互，确保安全高效的任务管理","ja":"エージェントがバックグラウンドでタスクを実行する機能を提供し、Glob、Grep、Read などのツールを使用し、正確なプロンプトとスコープ付きサブエージェントを通じてツールやプロトコルとのやり取りを制限し、セキュアかつ効率的なタスク管理を実現","ko":"에이전트가 백그라운드에서 태스크를 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며 Glob, Grep, Read와 같은 도구를 사용하여 정교한 프롬프트와 범위 지정된 서브 에이전트를 통해 도구와 프로토콜의 상호 작용을 제한하여 보안이 높고 효율적인 태스크 관리를 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar tareas en segundo plano, utilizando herramientas como Glob, Grep y Read, mientras restringe agresivamente las interacciones a herramientas y protocolos necesarios, garantizando una gestión de tareas segura y eficiente a través de instrucciones precisas y subagentes con alcance","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tâches en arrière-plan, en utilisant des outils tels que Glob, Grep et Read, tout en restreignant agressivement les interactions aux outils et protocoles nécessaires, garantissant ainsi une gestion de tâches sécurisée et efficace via des invites précises et des sous-agents à portée","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Tasks im Hintergrund auszuführen, indem Tools wie Glob, Grep und Read verwendet werden, während die Interaktionen auf notwendige Tools und Protokolle aggressiv eingeschränkt werden, um eine sichere und effiziente Aufgabenverwaltung durch präzise Befehle und Subagenten mit Bereich zu gewährleisten","pt":"Habilita agentes a executar tarefas em segundo plano, utilizando ferramentas como Glob, Grep e Read, enquanto restringe agressivamente as interações para ferramentas e protocolos necessários, garantindo gerenciamento de tarefas seguro e eficiente por meio de prompts precisos e subagentes com escopo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять задачи в фоновом режиме, используя инструменты, такие как Glob, Grep и Read, при этом агрессивно ограничивая взаимодействия до необходимых инструментов и протоколов, обеспечивая безопасное и эффективное управление задачами посредством точных подсказок и субагентов с ограниченным объемом","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل المهام في الخلفية، باستخدام أدوات مثل Glob و Grep و Read، مع تقييد التفاعلات بشكل جريء إلى الأدوات والبروتوكولات الضرورية، مما يضمن إدارة المهام الآمنة والفعالة من خلال علامات دقيقة ووكلاء محددين النطاق"},"useCases":{"en":["Invoking subagents for background task execution","Restricting tool interactions for secure task management","Executing tasks in specific repositories using scoped subagents"],"zh":["调用子代理以在后台执行任务","限制工具交互以实现安全的任务管理","使用作用域子代理在特定存储库中执行任务"],"ja":["サブエージェントを呼び出してバックグラウンドでタスクを実行","ツールのやり取りを制限してセキュアなタスク管理を実現","スコープ付きサブエージェントを使用して特定のリポジトリでタスクを実行"],"ko":["서브 에이전트를 호출하여 백그라운드에서 태스크를 실행","도구 상호 작용을 제한하여 보안 태스크 관리를 구현","범위 지정된 서브 에이전트를 사용하여 특정 리포지토리에서 태스크를 실행"],"es":["Invocar subagentes para la ejecución de tareas en segundo plano","Restringir las interacciones de herramientas para una gestión de tareas segura","Ejecutar tareas en repositorios específicos utilizando subagentes con alcance"],"fr":["Appeler des sous-agents pour l''exécution de tâches en arrière-plan","Restreindre les interactions d''outils pour une gestion de tâches sécurisée","Exécuter des tâches dans des référentiels spécifiques en utilisant des sous-agents à portée"],"de":["Aufrufen von Subagenten zur Ausführung von Tasks im Hintergrund","Einschränken der Tool-Interaktionen für eine sichere Aufgabenverwaltung","Ausführen von Tasks in bestimmten Repositorys unter Verwendung von Subagenten mit Bereich"],"pt":["Invocar subagentes para execução de tarefas em segundo plano","Restringir interações de ferramentas para gerenciamento de tarefas seguro","Executar tarefas em repositórios específicos usando subagentes com escopo"],"ru":["Вызов субагентов для выполнения задач в фоновом режиме","Ограничение взаимодействия инструментов для безопасного управления задачами","Выполнение задач в конкретных репозиториях с помощью субагентов с ограниченным объемом"],"ar":["استدعاء وكلاء فرعيين لتشغيل المهام في الخلفية","تقييد التفاعل مع الأدوات لإدارة المهام الآمنة","تشغيل المهام في مستودعات محددة باستخدام وكلاء فرعيين محددين النطاق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Subagents are scoped to their current working directory (cwd)","Requires precise and thorough prompts for effective task management","Limited to tools explicitly granted access, such as Glob, Grep, and Read"],"zh":["子代理的作用域仅限于其当前工作目录 (cwd)","需要精确和详尽的提示以实现有效的任务管理","仅限于明确授予访问权限的工具，例如 Glob、Grep 和 Read"],"ja":["サブエージェントのスコープは現在の作業ディレクトリ (cwd) に制限される","効果的なタスク管理のためには正確で徹底的なプロンプトが必要","明示的にアクセス権が付与されたツール (Glob、Grep、Read など) だけに限定される"],"ko":["서브 에이전트의 범위는 현재 작업 디렉토리 (cwd)로 제한","효과적인 태스크 관리를 위해 정교한 프롬프트가 필요","명시적으로 액세스 권한이 부여된 도구 (Glob, Grep, Read 등)만으로 제한"],"es":["Los subagentes están limitados a su directorio de trabajo actual (cwd)","Requiere instrucciones precisas y exhaustivas para una gestión de tareas eficaz","Limitado a herramientas que tienen acceso explícito, como Glob, Grep y Read"],"fr":["Les sous-agents sont limités à leur répertoire de travail actuel (cwd)","Nécessite des invites précises et exhaustives pour une gestion de tâches efficace","Limité à des outils ayant un accès explicite, tels que Glob, Grep et Read"],"de":["Subagenten sind auf ihr aktuelles Arbeitsverzeichnis (cwd) beschränkt","Benötigt präzise und umfassende Befehle für eine effektive Aufgabenverwaltung","Begrenzt auf Tools, die expliziten Zugriff haben, wie z.B. Glob, Grep und Read"],"pt":["Subagentes estão limitados ao seu diretório de trabalho atual (cwd)","Exige prompts precisos e completos para gerenciamento de tarefas eficaz","Limitado a ferramentas que têm acesso explícito concedido, como Glob, Grep e Read"],"ru":["Субагенты ограничены текущим рабочим каталогом (cwd)","Требует точных и полных подсказок для эффективного управления задачами","Ограничен инструментами, которым явно предоставлен доступ, такими как Glob, Grep и Read"],"ar":["الوكلاء الفرعيون مقيدون بالدليل الجاري العمل به حاليًا (cwd)","يتطلب علامات دقيقة وكاملة لإدارة المهام الفعالة","محدود بالأدوات التي تم منحها الوصول بشكل صريح، مثل Glob و Grep و Read"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c7b1f4ba8fdb376e73c1f55572be9cf64a0d5993ecb4491ee6d2fdf9a4d579b1","qualityScore":36}');
