,"Seguridad y autenticación avanzadas"],"fr":["Interfaces de serveur MCP","Points de terminaison REST","Gestion de la conformité","Service API complet","Compatibilité avec plusieurs protocoles","Sécurité et authentification avancées"],"de":["MCP-Server-Schnittstellen","REST-Endpunkte","Konformitätsverwaltung","Umfassender API-Service","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Protokollen","Erweiterte Sicherheit und Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Interface de servidor MCP","Endpoints REST","Gerenciamento de conformidade","Serviço de API abrangente","Integração com Onasis Gateway"],"ru":["Интерфейс сервера MCP","Точки REST","Управление соответствием","Комплексная служба API","Интеграция с Onasis Gateway"],"ar":["واجهة خادم MCP","نقاط نهاية REST","إدارة الامتثال","خدمة API شاملة","التكامل مع Onasis Gateway"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Onasis Gateway","什么是AI智能代理","Onasis Gateway替代品","Onasis Gateway安装","Onasis Gateway设置指南","API服务仓库","MCP服务器接口","REST端点"],"ja":["Onasis Gatewayの使い方","AIエージェントとは","Onasis Gatewayの代替","Onasis Gatewayのインストール","Onasis Gatewayの設定ガイド","APIサービス倉庫","MCPサーバーインターフェース","RESTエンドポイント"],"ko":["Onasis Gateway 사용법","AI 에이전트란","Onasis Gateway 대체","Onasis Gateway 설치","Onasis Gateway 설정 가이드","API 서비스 저장소","MCP 서버 인터페이스","REST 엔드포인트"],"es":["cómo usar Onasis Gateway","qué es un Compliance Manager","Onasis Gateway alternativa","Onasis Gateway vs competidores","instalación de Onasis Gateway","guía de configuración de Onasis Gateway","herramientas de AI para la conformidad","servicios API para la conformidad","interfaces de servidor MCP","puntos de conexión REST"],"fr":["comment utiliser Onasis Gateway","qu''est-ce qu''un Compliance Manager","alternative à Onasis Gateway","Onasis Gateway vs concurrents","installation d''Onasis Gateway","guide de configuration d''Onasis Gateway","outils d''IA pour la conformité","services API pour la conformité","interfaces de serveur MCP","points de terminaison REST"],"de":["wie man Onasis Gateway verwendet","was ist ein Compliance Manager","Onasis Gateway Alternative","Onasis Gateway vs Wettbewerber","Installation von Onasis Gateway","Konfigurationshandbuch für Onasis Gateway","KI-Tools für die Konformität","API-Dienste für die Konformität","MCP-Server-Schnittstellen","REST-Endpunkte"],"pt":["como usar Onasis Gateway","o que é conformidade","Onasis Gateway alternativa","Onasis Gateway vs competitor","instalar Onasis Gateway","guia de configuração do Onasis Gateway","ferramentas de IA para conformidade","gerenciamento de conformidade com API"],"ru":["как использовать Onasis Gateway","что такое соответствие","ИИ Агенты для соответствия","Onasis Gateway альтернатива","Onasis Gateway vs конкурент","установить Onasis Gateway","руководство по настройке Onasis Gateway","служба API для соответствия","управление соответствием с помощью API"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Onasis Gateway","ما هو الامتثال","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للامتثال","Onasis Gateway بديل","Onasis Gateway مقابل المنافس","تثبيت Onasis Gateway","دليل إعداد Onasis Gateway","خدمة API للامتثال","إدارة الامتثال باستخدام API"]}},"owner":"thefixer3x","repo":"onasis-gateway","repoPath":"thefixer3x/onasis-gateway","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.933Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"compliance-manager","description":"Guardrails for edits to core/security/compliance-manager.js that preserve PCI/GDPR/PSD2/SOX/HIPAA controls (masking, encryption, SCA, consent checks, and audit logging). Use when changing compliance validators, security handling, or audit flows.","bodyPreview":"# Compliance Manager Guardian\n\n## Purpose & Scope\n\nApply this skill when modifying `core/security/compliance-manager.js`.\n\nThe Compliance Manager provides:\n- PCI-DSS data protection (card data masking, encryption)\n- GDPR compliance (pseudonymization, consent management, data minimization)\n- PSD2 compliance (Strong Customer Authentication)\n- SOX audit trail requirements\n- HIPAA health data protection\n- Multi-regulation validation framework\n- Secure audit logging\n\n## Non-Negotiables (Never Do)\n\n##","body":"# Compliance Manager Guardian\n\n## Purpose & Scope\n\nApply this skill when modifying `core/security/compliance-manager.js`.\n\nThe Compliance Manager provides:\n- PCI-DSS data protection (card data masking, encryption)\n- GDPR compliance (pseudonymization, consent management, data minimization)\n- PSD2 compliance (Strong Customer Authentication)\n- SOX audit trail requirements\n- HIPAA health data protection\n- Multi-regulation validation framework\n- Secure audit logging\n\n## Non-Negotiables (Never Do)\n\n### Compliance Validators\n- Never disable or bypass compliance validators.\n- Never weaken validation rules (for example, making required checks optional).\n- Never skip validation for \"trusted\" sources.\n- Never add bypass flags or debug modes that skip compliance.\n\n### PCI-DSS Rules\n- Never log these PCI fields (even in debug mode):\n  - `cvv`, `cvv2`, `cvc`, `cvc2`, `cid`, `cav2`\n  - `pin`, `pinBlock`\n  - `track1`, `track2`, `magneticStripe`\n- Never weaken card masking:\n  - Must show only first 6 and last 4 digits.\n  - Middle digits must be masked with `*`.\n- Never reduce encryption below AES-256-GCM.\n- Never store CVV/PIN after authorization.\n\n### GDPR Rules\n- Never process personal data without consent check.\n- Never skip pseudonymization for personal identifiers.\n- Never retain personal data beyond retention period.\n- Never disable data minimization for analytics.\n\n### PSD2 Rules\n- Never reduce SCA requirements below 2 factors.\n- Never bypass SCA for amounts over threshold.\n- Never skip transaction monitoring for high-value transactions.\n- Never disable cumulative amount tracking.\n\n### Audit Logging\n- Never skip audit logging for sensitive operations.\n- Never delete or modify existing audit entries.\n- Never log sensitive data in audit trails (mask first).\n- Never disable audit persistence.\n\n### Security Rollback\n- Never rollback security fixes without security team approval.\n- Never lower security levels in production.\n\n## Required Patterns (Must Follow)\n\n### Card Number Masking\n```javascript\n// Must mask showing only first 6 and last 4\nmaskCardNumber(cardNumber) {\n    const cleaned = cardNumber.replace(/\\D/g, '''');\n    const first6 = cleaned.substring(0, 6);\n    const last4 = cleaned.substring(cleaned.length - 4);\n    const masked = ''*''.repeat(cleaned.length - 10);\n    return `${first6}${masked}${last4}`;\n}\n// Example: 4111111111111111 -> 411111******1111\n```\n\n### Data Encryption\n```javascript\n// Must use AES-256-GCM\nencryptSensitiveData(data) {\n    const algorithm = ''aes-256-gcm'';  // Do not change\n    const key = process.env.ENCRYPTION_KEY;\n    if (!key) throw new Error(''ENCRYPTION_KEY is required'');\n\n    // 12-byte IV is recommended for GCM\n    const iv = crypto.randomBytes(12);\n\n    // Prefer @onasis/security-sdk for key handling if available\n    // If ENCRYPTION_KEY is a passphrase, derive a 32-byte key via scrypt.\n    const keyBuf = (key.length === 64 && /^[0-9a-f]+$/i.test(key))\n        ? Buffer.from(key, ''hex'')\n        : crypto.scryptSync(key, ''onasis-gateway'', 32);\n\n    const cipher = crypto.createCipheriv(''aes-256-gcm'', keyBuf, iv);\n    cipher.setAAD(Buffer.from(''compliance-encryption''));\n\n    const plaintext = typeof data === ''string'' ? data : JSON.stringify(data);\n    const ciphertext = Buffer.concat([cipher.update(plaintext, ''utf8''), cipher.final()]);\n    const authTag = cipher.getAuthTag();\n\n    return {\n        encrypted: ciphertext.toString(''base64''),\n        iv: iv.toString(''hex''),\n        authTag: authTag.toString(''hex''),\n        algorithm\n    };\n}\n```\n\n### Strong Customer Authentication\n```javascript\n// Must require 2+ factors\nvalidateSCA(data) {\n    const factors = [];\n\n    if (data.password || data.pin) factors.push(''knowledge'');\n    if (data.deviceId || data.token) factors.push(''possession'');\n    if (data.biometric || data.fingerprint) factors.push(''inherence'');\n\n    return factors.length >= 2;  // PSD2 requirement\n}\n```\n\n### Defense in Depth\n```javascript\n// Must apply all applicable protections\nenforceDataHandling(serviceId, data, operation) {\n    let processedData = { ...data };\n\n    if (service?.compliance?.pci) {\n        processedData = this.applyPCIProtections(processedData, operation);\n    }\n    if (service?.compliance?.gdpr) {\n        processedData = this.applyGDPRProtections(processedData, operation);\n    }\n    if (service?.compliance?.psd2) {\n        processedData = this.applyPSD2Protections(processedData, operation);\n    }\n\n    return processedData;\n}\n```\n\n### Audit Entry Creation\n```javascript\n// Must create audit entry for all compliance events\nlogAuditEntry(action, details) {\n    const entry = {\n        timestamp: new Date(),\n        action,\n        details,\n        id: crypto.randomUUID()\n    };\n\n    this.auditLog.push(entry);\n    this.emit(''audit:logged'', entry);\n    this.persistAuditEntry(entry);  // Must persist\n}\n```\n\n## Prohibited Fields Registry\n\n| Field | Regulation | Storage | Logging | Transmission |\n|-------|------------|---------|---------|--------------|\n| cvv, cvv2, cvc, cvc2 | PCI-DSS 3.2 | Never | Never | HTTPS only |\n| pin, pinBlock | PCI-DSS 3.4 | Never | Never | Encrypted |\n| track1, track2 | PCI-DSS 3.2 | Never | Never | Never |\n| magneticStripe | PCI-DSS 3.2 | Never | Never | Never |\n| Full card number | PCI-DSS 3.4 | Encrypted | Masked | Encrypted |\n\n## Integration Points\n\n| Component | Integration Method |\n|-----------|-------------------|\n| Base Client | Data passed through `enforceDataHandling()` |\n| Metrics Collector | `compliance_violations_total` metric |\n| API Routes | Middleware for request validation |\n| Database | Audit entries persisted to `audit.compliance_log` |\n\n## Compliance Validation Checklist\n\nBefore deploying changes:\n- [ ] Card data properly masked (first 6, last 4 only).\n- [ ] CVV/PIN never logged or stored.\n- [ ] Encryption uses AES-256-GCM.\n- [ ] SCA requires 2+ factors.\n- [ ] Audit entries created for all operations.\n- [ ] GDPR consent check in place.\n- [ ] Data minimization applied for analytics.\n- [ ] No PII in metric labels.\n- [ ] Audit log persisted to secure storage.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:32:30.529Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Regulatory Compliance Agents requiring advanced data protection and encryption capabilities, particularly those handling PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX, and HIPAA compliance","zh":"适用于需要高级数据保护和加密功能的监管合规代理，特别是那些处理PCI-DSS、GDPR、PSD2、SOX和HIPAA合规的代理","ja":"PCI-DSS、GDPR、PSD2、SOX、HIPAAのコンプライアンスを扱う、高度なデータ保護と暗号化機能を必要とする規制コンプライアンスエージェントに適しています","ko":"PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX, HIPAA 규정 준수를 처리하는 고급 데이터 보호 및 암호화 기능이 필요한 규제 준수 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de Cumplimiento Normativo que requieren capacidades avanzadas de protección y cifrado de datos, particularmente aquellos que manejan el cumplimiento de PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX y HIPAA","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de conformité réglementaire nécessitant des capacités de protection et de chiffrement de données avancées, en particulier ceux qui gèrent la conformité PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX et HIPAA","de":"Ideal für Regulatory Compliance Agents, die erweiterte Daten- und Verschlüsselungsfunktionen erfordern, insbesondere solche, die die Einhaltung von PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX und HIPAA gewährleisten","pt":"Ideal para agentes de conformidade regulatória que exigem capacidades avançadas de proteção de dados e criptografia, particularmente aqueles que lidam com conformidade PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX e HIPAA","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по соблюдению нормативных требований, требующих расширенных возможностей по защите данных и шифрованию, особенно для тех, кто занимается соблюдением требований PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX и HIPAA","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتعلقين بالامتثال التنظيمي الذين يتطلبون إمكانيات حماية البيانات والتشفير المتقدمة، خاصة أولئك الذين يتعاملون مع الامتثال لPCI-DSS وGDPR وPSD2 وSOX وHIPAA"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce multi-regulation validation frameworks, ensuring secure audit logging, pseudonymization, consent management, and data minimization, all while leveraging REST endpoints and MCP server interfaces for seamless integration","zh":"赋予代理实施多法规验证框架的能力，确保安全的审计日志记录、伪匿化、同意管理和数据最小化，同时利用REST端点和MCP服务器接口实现无缝集成","ja":"エージェントに複数の規制フレームワークを実施する能力を与え、セキュアな監査ログ記録、仮名化、同意管理、およびデータ最小化を保証し、RESTエンドポイントとMCPサーバーインターフェイスを利用してシームレスな統合を実現します","ko":"에이전트가 다중 규제 검증 프레임워크를 시행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 보안 감사 로깅, 가명화, 동의 관리 및 데이터 최소화를 보장하며, REST 엔드포인트 및 MCP 서버 인터페이스를 사용하여 무중단 통합을 제공합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar marcos de validación de multi-regulación, garantizando un registro de auditoría seguro, pseudonimización, gestión de consentimiento y minimización de datos, todo mientras aprovecha los puntos de conexión REST y las interfaces del servidor MCP para una integración sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des cadres de validation de multi-réglementation, garantissant un enregistrement d''audit sécurisé, une pseudonymisation, une gestion des consentements et une minimisation des données, tout en exploitant les points de terminaison REST et les interfaces de serveur MCP pour une intégration sans problème","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Multi-Regulierungs-Validierungsframeworks durchzusetzen, wodurch ein sicherer Audit-Log, Pseudonymisierung, Zustimmungsmanagement und Datenminimierung gewährleistet werden, während die REST-Endpunkte und die MCP-Server-Schnittstellen für eine nahtlose Integration genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar estruturas de validação de regulamentação múltipla, garantindo registro de auditoria seguro, pseudonimização, gerenciamento de consentimento e minimização de dados, tudo isso aproveitando os endpoints REST e interfaces do servidor MCP para integração sem interrupções","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать рамки валидации нескольких регламентов, гарантируя безопасный аудитный журнал, псевдонимизацию, управление согласием и минимизацию данных, все это при использовании точек REST и интерфейсов сервера MCP для бесшовной интеграции","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تفويضاً لتطبيق إطارات التحقق من الامتثال المتعددة، مما يضمن تسجيل تدقيق آمن وتشويه الأسماء وتحديد Consent وضبط البيانات، كل ذلك باستخدام نقاط النهاية REST وواجهات الخادم MCP من أجل التكامل دون انقطاع"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing PCI-DSS data protection through card data masking and encryption","Ensuring GDPR compliance via pseudonymization and consent management","Automating SOX audit trail requirements for financial transparency","Validating HIPAA health data protection protocols for sensitive information","Enforcing Strong Customer Authentication for PSD2 compliance"],"zh":["通过卡片数据屏蔽和加密实现PCI-DSS数据保护","通过伪匿化和同意管理确保GDPR合规","自动化SOX审计跟踪要求以实现财务透明度","验证HIPAA健康数据保护协议以保护敏感信息","强制执行PSD2合规的强客户身份验证"],"ja":["カードデータのマスキングと暗号化を通じてPCI-DSSのデータ保護を実現する","仮名化と同意管理を通じてGDPRのコンプライアンスを確保する","SOXの監査トレイル要件を自動化して財務の透明性を実現する","HIPAAの健康データ保護プロトコルを検証して機密情報を保護する","PSD2のコンプライアンスのための強力な顧客認証を強制する"],"ko":["카드 데이터 마스킹 및 암호화를 통해 PCI-DSS 데이터 보호를 구현합니다","가명화 및 동의 관리를 통해 GDPR 규정 준수를 보장합니다","SOX 감사 추적 요구 사항을 자동화하여 재무 투명성을 달성합니다","HIPAA 건강 데이터 보호 프로토콜을 검증하여 기밀 정보를 보호합니다","PSD2 규정 준수를 위한 강력한 고객 인증을 시행합니다"],"es":["Implementar la protección de datos de PCI-DSS a través del enmascaramiento y cifrado de datos de tarjetas","Garantizar el cumplimiento de GDPR a través de la pseudonimización y la gestión de consentimiento","Automatizar los requisitos de auditoría de SOX para la transparencia financiera","Validar los protocolos de protección de datos de salud de HIPAA para información sensible","Aplicar la Autenticación de Cliente Fuerte para el cumplimiento de PSD2"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la protection des données PCI-DSS grâce au masquage et au chiffrement des données de cartes","Garantir la conformité GDPR grâce à la pseudonymisation et à la gestion des consentements","Automatiser les exigences d''audit SOX pour la transparence financière","Valider les protocoles de protection des données de santé HIPAA pour les informations sensibles","Mettre en œuvre l''Authentification Client Forte pour la conformité PSD2"],"de":["Die Implementierung des PCI-DSS-Datenschutzes durch Kartendaten-Maskierung und -Verschlüsselung","Die Gewährleistung der GDPR-Konformität durch Pseudonymisierung und Zustimmungsmanagement","Die Automatisierung der SOX-Audit-Anforderungen für die finanzielle Transparenz","Die Validierung der HIPAA-Gesundheitsdatenschutzprotokolle für sensible Informationen","Die Durchsetzung der starken Kundenauthentifizierung für die PSD2-Konformität"],"pt":["Implementação da proteção de dados PCI-DSS por meio do mascaramento e criptografia de dados de cartão","Garantia da conformidade com o GDPR por meio da pseudonimização e do gerenciamento de consentimento","Automação dos requisitos de rastreamento de auditoria do SOX para transparência financeira","Validação dos protocolos de proteção de dados de saúde HIPAA para informações sensíveis","Aplicação da Autenticação de Cliente Forte para conformidade com o PSD2"],"ru":["Реализация защиты данных PCI-DSS путем маскирования и шифрования данных карт","Обеспечение соответствия требованиям GDPR путем псевдонимизации и управления согласием","Автоматизация требований к аудиторскому следу SOX для финансовой прозрачности","Проверка протоколов защиты данных о здоровье HIPAA для конфиденциальной информации","Применение Сильной Аутентификации Клиента для соответствия требованиям PSD2"],"ar":["تنفيذ حماية بيانات PCI-DSS من خلال إخفاء وتشفير بيانات البطاقة","ضمان الامتثال لGDPR من خلال تشويه الأسماء وإدارة الموافقة","أتمتة متطلبات سجل تدقيق SOX للشفافية المالية","التحقق من بروتوكولات حماية بيانات الصحة HIPAA للمعلومات الحساسة","تطبيق مصادقة الزبون القوية للامتثال لPSD2"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Onasis Gateway API access","Dependent on core/security/compliance-manager.js modifications","Limited to regulatory frameworks specified (PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX, HIPAA)"],"zh":["需要Onasis Gateway API访问","依赖于core/security/compliance-manager.js的修改","仅限于指定的监管框架（PCI-DSS、GDPR、PSD2、SOX、HIPAA）"],"ja":["Onasis Gateway APIへのアクセスが必要","core/security/compliance-manager.jsの変更に依存する","指定された規制フレームワーク（PCI-DSS、GDPR、PSD2、SOX、HIPAA）のみに限定される"],"ko":["Onasis Gateway API 액세스가 필요합니다","core/security/compliance-manager.js의 수정에 의존합니다","지정된 규제 프레임워크(PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX, HIPAA)로만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de Onasis Gateway","Dependiente de las modificaciones de core/security/compliance-manager.js","Limitado a los marcos regulatorios especificados (PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX, HIPAA)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à l''API Onasis Gateway","Dépend des modifications de core/security/compliance-manager.js","Limité aux cadres réglementaires spécifiés (PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX, HIPAA)"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf die Onasis Gateway-API","Abhängig von den Modifikationen von core/security/compliance-manager.js","Begrenzt auf die angegebenen Regulierungsrahmen (PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX, HIPAA)"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API do Onasis Gateway","Dependente de modificações no core/security/compliance-manager.js","Limitado a estruturas regulamentares especificadas (PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX, HIPAA)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API Onasis Gateway","Зависит от изменений в core/security/compliance-manager.js","Ограничен рамками нормативных требований, указанных в спецификации (PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX, HIPAA)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Onasis Gateway","يعتمد على التعديلات في core/security/compliance-manager.js","محدود بالإطارات التنظيمية المحددة (PCI-DSS وGDPR وPSD2 وSOX وHIPAA)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c9895cbf636899fc1a3cc513224b6fb85819cfbf2f41f121e91550b2530eee04","qualityScore":36}');
