ntwicklung","Erstellung von KI-gestützten Tools","Verbesserung der Effizienz","Alternativen zu specsafe-complete","Installation von specsafe-complete","Konfigurationsanleitung für specsafe-complete"],"pt":["como usar specsafe-complete","o que é desenvolvimento assistido por IA","alternativas para specsafe-complete","specsafe-complete vs outras ferramentas","instalar specsafe-complete","guia de configuração do specsafe-complete"],"ru":["как использовать specsafe-complete","что такое разработка с поддержкой ИИ","альтернативы specsafe-complete","specsafe-complete vs другие инструменты","установить specsafe-complete","руководство по настройке specsafe-complete"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام specsafe-complete","ما هو التنمية المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","بديلات لبرنامج specsafe-complete","specsafe-complete مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت specsafe-complete","دليل إعداد specsafe-complete"]}},"owner":"Agentic-Engineering-Agency","repo":"specsafe","repoPath":"Agentic-Engineering-Agency/specsafe","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.938Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"specsafe-complete","description":"Complete a SpecSafe specification. Moves spec from QA to COMPLETE stage.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Complete a SpecSafe specification (QA → COMPLETE stage).\n\n**When to use:**\n- QA validation passed with GO recommendation\n- Ready to mark as production-ready\n- Finalizing the spec\n\n**Input**: The spec ID (e.g., SPEC-20240204-001)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Validate QA passed**\n\n   Verify QA report shows GO recommendation.\n   Check that all critical issues are resolved.\n\n2. **Complete the spec**\n\n   ```bash\n   specsafe complete \"<spec-id>\"\n   ```\n\n   This:\n   - Moves spec to COMPLETE stage\n   - Moves spec f","body":"Complete a SpecSafe specification (QA → COMPLETE stage).\n\n**When to use:**\n- QA validation passed with GO recommendation\n- Ready to mark as production-ready\n- Finalizing the spec\n\n**Input**: The spec ID (e.g., SPEC-20240204-001)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Validate QA passed**\n\n   Verify QA report shows GO recommendation.\n   Check that all critical issues are resolved.\n\n2. **Complete the spec**\n\n   ```bash\n   specsafe complete \"<spec-id>\"\n   ```\n\n   This:\n   - Moves spec to COMPLETE stage\n   - Moves spec file to `specs/completed/`\n   - Archives QA report\n   - Updates PROJECT_STATE.md\n\n3. **Show completion summary**\n\n   Display:\n   - Spec completion confirmation\n   - Metrics (time to complete, coverage, etc.)\n   - Location of completed spec\n   - Next steps\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completion:\n- ✅ Completion confirmation\n- Spec moved to `specs/completed/`\n- PROJECT_STATE.md updated\n- Prompt: \"Ready to start a new spec? Run `specsafe new`\"\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Spec must be in QA stage\n- QA report must recommend GO\n- Do NOT complete if NO-GO\n- Confirm all requirements met"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:36:27.480Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Test-Driven Development Agents requiring automated spec validation and completion.","zh":"适用于需要自动化规格验证和完成的测试驱动开发代理。","ja":"自動化された仕様の検証と完了が必要なテスト駆動開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"자동화된 사양 검증 및 완성이 필요한 테스트 주도 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas que requieren una validación automática de especificaciones y finalización.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement piloté par les tests nécessitant une validation automatisée de spécifications et une complétion.","de":"Ideal für Test-Driven Development Agents, die eine automatisierte Spezifikationsvalidierung und -vervollständigung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes que exigem validação e conclusão automatizada de especificações.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, управляемой тестированием, требующих автоматизированной валидации и завершения спецификаций.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير القائم على الاختبار الذي يتطلب التحقق والاستكمال التلقائي للمواصفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to finalize SpecSafe specifications using QA validation and the `specsafe complete` command, ensuring production-ready specs with resolved critical issues and a GO recommendation from the QA report.","zh":"使代理能够使用QA验证和`specsafe complete`命令完成SpecSafe规范，确保生产就绪的规范，并解决关键问题并获得QA报告的GO推荐。","ja":"QAの検証と`specsafe complete`コマンドを使用してSpecSafeの仕様を完了し、生産に応じた仕様を確保し、重大な問題を解決し、QAレポートからGOの推奨を得ることができます。","ko":"QA 검증 및 `specsafe complete` 명령을 사용하여 SpecSafe 사양을 완료하여 생산 준비가 된 사양을 보장하고 중요 문제를 해결하며 QA 보고서에서 GO 추천을 얻을 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a finalizar las especificaciones de SpecSafe utilizando la validación de QA y el comando `specsafe complete`, garantizando especificaciones listas para producción con problemas críticos resueltos y una recomendación de GO del informe de QA.","fr":"Permet aux agents de finaliser les spécifications SpecSafe en utilisant la validation QA et la commande `specsafe complete`, garantissant des spécifications prêtes pour la production avec des problèmes critiques résolus et une recommandation de GO du rapport QA.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die SpecSafe-Spezifikationen unter Verwendung der QA-Validierung und des `specsafe complete`-Befehls abzuschließen, um produktionsbereite Spezifikationen mit gelösten kritischen Problemen und einer GO-Empfehlung des QA-Berichts sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a finalizar especificações SpecSafe usando validação de QA e o comando `specsafe complete`, garantindo especificações prontas para produção com questões críticas resolvidas e uma recomendação de GO do relatório de QA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью завершить спецификации SpecSafe с помощью валидации QA и команды `specsafe complete`, гарантируя готовность спецификаций к производству с решенными критическими проблемами и рекомендацией GO от отчета QA.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إتمام مواصفات SpecSafe باستخدام التحقق من صحة QA وأمر `specsafe complete` ، مما يضمن مواصفات جاهزة للإنتاج مع حل القضايا الحرجة وتوصية GO من تقرير QA."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating QA reports for GO recommendations","Completing SpecSafe specifications with critical issues resolved","Automating spec completion for production-ready stages"],"zh":["验证QA报告中的GO推荐","使用关键问题解决完成SpecSafe规范","自动完成生产就绪阶段的规范"],"ja":["GOの推奨を含むQAレポートの検証","重大な問題を解決してSpecSafeの仕様を完成する","生産に応じた段階の仕様の自動化"],"ko":["GO 추천을 포함한 QA 보고서의 검증","중요한 문제를 해결하여 SpecSafe 사양을 완료하는 것","제작 준비 단계의 사양 자동화"],"es":["Validar informes de QA para recomendaciones de GO","Completar especificaciones de SpecSafe con problemas críticos resueltos","Automatizar la finalización de especificaciones para etapas listas para producción"],"fr":["Valider les rapports QA pour des recommandations de GO","Compléter les spécifications SpecSafe avec des problèmes critiques résolus","Automatiser la complétion des spécifications pour les étapes prêtes pour la production"],"de":["QA-Berichte für GO-Empfehlungen überprüfen","SpecSafe-Spezifikationen mit gelösten kritischen Problemen vervollständigen","Automatisieren der Spezifikationsvervollständigung für produktionsbereite Stufen"],"pt":["Validar relatórios de QA para recomendações de GO","Concluir especificações SpecSafe com questões críticas resolvidas","Automatizar a conclusão de especificações para estágios prontos para produção"],"ru":["Проверка отчетов QA для рекомендаций GO","Завершение спецификаций SpecSafe с решенными критическими проблемами","Автоматизация завершения спецификаций для производственных стадий"],"ar":["التحقق من تقارير QA لتوصيات GO","إتمام مواصفات SpecSafe مع حل القضايا الحرجة","تأتمة استكمال المواصفات لأطوار جاهزة للإنتاج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SpecSafe specification ID","Needs QA report with GO recommendation","Dependent on `specsafe` command-line tool"],"zh":["需要SpecSafe规范ID","需要具有GO推荐的QA报告","依赖于`specsafe`命令行工具"],"ja":["SpecSafeの仕様IDが必要","GOの推奨を含むQAレポートが必要","`specsafe`コマンドラインツールに依存"],"ko":["SpecSafe 사양 ID가 필요합니다","GO 추천을 포함하는 QA 보고서가 필요합니다","`specsafe` 명령줄 툴에 종속"],"es":["Requiere ID de especificación de SpecSafe","Necesita un informe de QA con recomendación de GO","Dependiente de la herramienta de línea de comandos `specsafe`"],"fr":["Nécessite un ID de spécification SpecSafe","A besoin d''un rapport QA avec une recommandation de GO","Dépend de l''outil de ligne de commande `specsafe`"],"de":["Benötigt SpecSafe-Spezifikations-ID","Benötigt einen QA-Bericht mit GO-Empfehlung","Abhängig von der `specsafe`-Kommandozeilen-Tool"],"pt":["Exige ID de especificação SpecSafe","Necessita de relatório de QA com recomendação de GO","Depende da ferramenta de linha de comando `specsafe`"],"ru":["Требует ID спецификации SpecSafe","Требует отчета QA с рекомендацией GO","Зависит от командной строки `specsafe`"],"ar":["يتطلب معرف مواصفات SpecSafe","يحتاج إلى تقرير QA مع توصية GO","يعتمد على أداة سطر الأوامر `specsafe`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8ac32d13858208bb25a7383275f8dc402f0dea5a7bca808944601cbad20e4a8c","qualityScore":36}');
