on":{"zh":"Dart-CI是一个C++20物理引擎，用于机器人和动画，具有碰撞、约束和Python绑定功能","ja":"Dart-CIは、ロボティクスとアニメーションのためのC++20物理エンジンです。衝突、制約、Pythonバインディングを備えています","ko":"Dart-CI는 로봇 및 애니메이션을 위한 C++20 물리 엔진입니다. 충돌, 제약 및 Python 바인딩 기능을 제공합니다","es":"dart-ci es un motor físico C++20 para robótica y animación con colisiones, vinculaciones y bindings Python","fr":"dart-ci est un moteur physique C++20 pour la robotique et l''animation avec collisions, contraintes et liens Python","de":"dart-ci ist eine C++20-Physik-Engine für Robotik und Animation mit Kollisionen, Einschränkungen und Python-Bindings","pt":"O dart-ci é um motor de física C++20 para robótica e animação com recursos de colisão e restrições, e bindings Python","ru":"dart-ci - это движок физики C++20 для робототехники и анимации с функциями столкновения и ограничений, и биндингами Python","ar":"dart-ci هو محرك فيزياء سي++20 لروبوتات والرسوم المتحركة مع ميزات الاصطدام والقيود، وربط بايثون","en":"C++20 physics engine for robotics and animation with collision, constraints, and Python bindings"},"definition":{"en":"C++20 physics engine for robotics and animation with collision, constraints, and Python bindings"},"features":{"zh":["C++20物理引擎","机器人和动画支持","碰撞和约束功能","Python绑定","高性能和稳定性"],"ja":["C++20物理エンジン","ロボティクスとアニメーションのサポート","衝突と制約機能","Pythonバインディング","高性能と安定性"],"ko":["C++20 물리 엔진","로봇 및 애니메이션 지원","충돌 및 제약 기능","Python 바인딩","고성능과 안정성"],"es":["Motor físico C++20","Colisiones y vinculaciones","Bindings Python","Aplicaciones en robótica y animación","Compatibilidad con constraints"],"fr":["Moteur physique C++20","Collisions et contraintes","Liens Python","Applications en robotique et animation","Compatibilité avec les contraintes"],"de":["C++20-Physik-Engine","Kollisionen und Einschränkungen","Python-Bindings","Anwendungen in Robotik und Animation","Kompatibilität mit Constraints"],"pt":["Motor de física C++20","Recursos de colisão e restrições","Bindings Python","Simulação de robótica e animação","Otimizado para desempenho"],"ru":["Движок физики C++20","Функции столкновения и ограничений","Биндинги Python","Симуляция робототехники и анимации","Оптимизирован для производительности"],"ar":["محرك فيزياء سي++20","ميزات الاصطدام والقيود","ربط بايثون","محاكاة رोबوتات والرسوم المتحركة","مُحسّن للاداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Dart-CI","C++20物理引擎","机器人和动画","碰撞和约束","Python绑定","如何使用Dart-CI","Dart-CI教程","Dart-CI安装"],"ja":["Dart-CI","C++20物理エンジン","ロボティクスとアニメーション","衝突と制約","Pythonバインディング","Dart-CIの使い方","Dart-CIチュートリアル","Dart-CIのインストール"],"ko":["Dart-CI","C++20 물리 엔진","로봇 및 애니메이션","충돌 및 제약","Python 바인딩","Dart-CI 사용법","Dart-CI 튜토리얼","Dart-CI 설치"],"es":["cómo usar dart-ci","qué es un motor físico","alternativas a dart-ci","dart-ci vs otros motores físicos","instalación de dart-ci","guía de configuración de dart-ci","desarrollo de aplicaciones con dart-ci"],"fr":["comment utiliser dart-ci","qu''est-ce qu''un moteur physique","alternatives à dart-ci","dart-ci vs autres moteurs physiques","installation de dart-ci","guide de configuration de dart-ci","développement d''applications avec dart-ci"],"de":["wie man dart-ci verwendet","was ist eine Physik-Engine","Alternativen zu dart-ci","dart-ci vs andere Physik-Engines","Installation von dart-ci","Konfigurationsanleitung für dart-ci","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit dart-ci"],"pt":["como usar dart-ci","o que é dart-ci","dart-ci alternativa","dart-ci vs outros motores de física","instalar dart-ci","guia de configuração do dart-ci","desenvolvimento de robótica com dart-ci","simulação de animação com dart-ci"],"ru":["как использовать dart-ci","что такое dart-ci","dart-ci альтернатива","dart-ci vs другие движки физики","установить dart-ci","руководство по настройке dart-ci","разработка робототехники с dart-ci","симуляция анимации с dart-ci"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام dart-ci","ما هو dart-ci","بديل dart-ci","dart-ci مقابل محركات فيزياء أخرى","تثبيت dart-ci","دليل إعداد dart-ci","تطوير رोबوتات مع dart-ci","محاكاة الرسوم المتحركة مع dart-ci"]}},"owner":"dartsim","repo":"dart","repoPath":"dartsim/dart","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.952Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dart-ci","description":"DART CI/CD troubleshooting - GitHub Actions, cache debugging, platform-specific failures","bodyPreview":"<!-- AUTO-GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY -->\n<!-- Source: .claude/skills/dart-ci/SKILL.md -->\n<!-- Sync script: scripts/sync_ai_commands.py -->\n<!-- Run `pixi run sync-ai-commands` to update -->\n\n# DART CI/CD Troubleshooting\n\nLoad this skill when debugging CI failures or working with GitHub Actions.\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Monitor PR checks\ngh pr checks <PR_NUMBER>\ngh pr checks <PR_NUMBER> --watch --interval 30 --fail-fast\n\n# View run details\ngh run list --branch <BRANCH> -e pull_re","body":"<!-- AUTO-GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY -->\n<!-- Source: .claude/skills/dart-ci/SKILL.md -->\n<!-- Sync script: scripts/sync_ai_commands.py -->\n<!-- Run `pixi run sync-ai-commands` to update -->\n\n# DART CI/CD Troubleshooting\n\nLoad this skill when debugging CI failures or working with GitHub Actions.\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Monitor PR checks\ngh pr checks <PR_NUMBER>\ngh pr checks <PR_NUMBER> --watch --interval 30 --fail-fast\n\n# View run details\ngh run list --branch <BRANCH> -e pull_request -L 20\ngh run watch <RUN_ID> --interval 30\ngh run view <RUN_ID> --json status,conclusion,url\n\n# Debug failures\ngh run view <RUN_ID> --job <JOB_ID> --log-failed\ngh run view <RUN_ID> --json jobs --jq ''.jobs[] | {name, databaseId}''\n\n# Rerun failed jobs\ngh run rerun <RUN_ID> --failed\ngh run rerun <RUN_ID> --job <DATABASE_ID>\n```\n\n## Full Documentation\n\nFor complete CI/CD guide: `docs/onboarding/ci-cd.md`\n\n## Common Failure Modes\n\n| Failure Type         | Solution                                                 |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Formatting fails     | `pixi run lint` then push                                |\n| Codecov patch fails  | Add tests for uncovered lines                            |\n| FreeBSD RTTI fails   | Use type enums + `static_cast` instead of `dynamic_cast` |\n| macOS ARM64 SEGFAULT | Replace `alloca()`/VLAs with `std::vector<T>`            |\n| RTD build fails      | Use defensive `.get(key, default)` patterns              |\n| gz-physics fails     | Reproduce with `pixi run -e gazebo test-gz`              |\n\n## Workflow Architecture\n\n| Workflow            | Purpose                 | Platforms |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------- | --------- |\n| `ci_lint.yml`       | Formatting              | Ubuntu    |\n| `ci_ubuntu.yml`     | Build + test + coverage | Ubuntu    |\n| `ci_macos.yml`      | Build + test            | macOS     |\n| `ci_windows.yml`    | Build + test            | Windows   |\n| `ci_freebsd.yml`    | Build + test (VM)       | FreeBSD   |\n| `ci_gz_physics.yml` | Gazebo integration      | Ubuntu    |\n\n## Fast Iteration Loop\n\n1. Identify failing step from job logs\n2. Reproduce locally with same build toggles\n3. Fix the smallest failing test\n4. Push and monitor: `gh run watch <RUN_ID>`\n\n## Caching\n\n- sccache/ccache reduces build time 50-70%\n- Check cache hit rates in workflow logs\n- Force cache bust by changing cache key if needed\n\n## Expected CI Times\n\n| Platform | Cached    | Uncached  |\n| -------- | --------- | --------- |\n| Ubuntu   | 20-30 min | 45-60 min |\n| macOS    | 15-25 min | 30-45 min |\n| Windows  | 15-20 min | 25-35 min |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:44:34.909Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for DevOps Agents troubleshooting C++20 physics engine CI/CD pipelines with GitHub Actions.","zh":"适用于DevOps代理对C++20物理引擎CI/CD流水线进行故障排除，特别是使用GitHub Actions。","ja":"DevOpsエージェントがC++20物理エンジンのCI/CDパイプラインのトラブルシューティングを行う場合に不可欠で、特にGitHub Actionsを使用する場合に適しています。","ko":"DevOps 에이전트가 C++20 물리 엔진 CI/CD 파이프라인을 디버깅하는 경우에 필수적이며, 특히 GitHub Actions를 사용하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de DevOps que solucionan problemas en pipelines de CI/CD con motores de física C++20 utilizando GitHub Actions.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents DevOps dépannant les pipelines CI/CD de moteurs physique C++20 avec GitHub Actions.","de":"Essenziell für DevOps-Agenten, die Probleme in CI/CD-Pipelines mit C++20-Physik-Engines und GitHub Actions beheben.","pt":"Essencial para DevOps Agents de troubleshooting de C++20 physics engine CI/CD pipelines com GitHub Actions.","ru":"Необходим для DevOps Agents отладки C++20 physics engine CI/CD pipelines с GitHub Actions.","ar":"Essential for DevOps Agents troubleshooting C++20 physics engine CI/CD pipelines with GitHub Actions."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides real-time monitoring of GitHub Actions workflows and PR checks through gh CLI integration. Enables continuous oversight of CI failures for robotics and animation projects with Python bindings, offering watch mode monitoring and fail-fast capabilities.","zh":"提供实时监控GitHub Actions工作流和PR检查通过gh CLI集成。使得机器人和动画项目的CI故障实时监控和快速失败能力成为可能，特别是通过Python绑定提供的监视模式监控和快速失败能力。","ja":"GitHub ActionsのワークフローとPRチェックをgh CLI統合を通じてリアルタイムで監視します。ロボティクスやアニメーションプロジェクトのCI障害を継続的に監視することができ、Pythonバインディングを通じてウォッチモード監視やファストフォール能力を提供します。","ko":"GitHub Actions 워크플로우와 PR 확인을 gh CLI 통합을 통해 실시간으로 모니터링합니다. 로봇 및 애니메이션 프로젝트의 CI 실패를 지속적으로 모니터링할 수 있으며, Python 바인딩을 통해 감시 모드 모니터링 및 빠른 실패 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Proporciona monitorización en tiempo real de los flujos de trabajo de GitHub Actions y las comprobaciones de PR mediante la integración de la CLI de gh. Permite una supervisión continua de los fallos de CI para proyectos de robótica y animación con enlaces de Python, ofreciendo capacidades de monitorización en modo watch y de fail-fast.","fr":"Fournit une surveillance en temps réel des workflows GitHub Actions et des vérifications de PR via l''intégration CLI gh. Permet une supervision continue des échecs CI pour les projets de robotique et d''animation avec des liaisons Python, offrant une surveillance en mode watch et des capacités de fail-fast.","de":"Ermöglicht Echtzeit-Überwachung von GitHub Actions-Workflows und PR-Checks durch gh CLI-Integration. Ermöglicht kontinuierliche Überwachung von CI-Fehlern bei Robotik- und Animationsprojekten mit Python-Bindungen, bietet Watch-Mode-Überwachung und Fail-Fast-Fähigkeiten.","pt":"Provides real-time monitoring of GitHub Actions workflows and PR checks through gh CLI integration. Enables continuous oversight of CI failures for robotics and animation projects with Python bindings, offering watch mode monitoring and fail-fast capabilities.","ru":"Provides real-time monitoring of GitHub Actions workflows and PR checks through gh CLI integration. Enables continuous oversight of CI failures for robotics and animation projects with Python bindings, offering watch mode monitoring and fail-fast capabilities.","ar":"Provides real-time monitoring of GitHub Actions workflows and PR checks through gh CLI integration. Enables continuous oversight of CI failures for robotics and animation projects with Python bindings, offering watch mode monitoring and fail-fast capabilities."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring PR checks with gh pr checks command","Debugging CI failures in C++20 physics engine builds","Watching GitHub Actions runs with interval-based monitoring","Tracking Python binding integration tests"],"zh":["使用gh pr checks命令监控PR检查","调试C++20物理引擎构建中的CI故障","使用间隔监控监视GitHub Actions运行","跟踪Python绑定集成测试"],"ja":["gh pr checksコマンドを使用してPRチェックを監視する","C++20物理エンジンのビルドにおけるCI障害をデバッグする","間隔監視を使用してGitHub Actionsの実行を監視する","Pythonバインディングの統合テストを追跡する"],"ko":["gh pr checks 명령을 사용하여 PR 확인을 모니터링합니다","C++20 물리 엔진 빌드의 CI 실패를 디버깅합니다","간격 모니터링을 사용하여 GitHub Actions 실행을 모니터링합니다","Python 바인딩 통합 테스트를 추적합니다"],"es":["Supervisión de comprobaciones de PR con el comando gh pr checks","Depuración de fallos de CI en compilaciones de motores de física C++20","Supervisión de ejecuciones de GitHub Actions con monitorización basada en intervalos","Seguimiento de pruebas de integración de enlaces de Python"],"fr":["Surveillance des vérifications de PR avec la commande gh pr checks","Débogage des échecs CI dans les builds de moteurs physique C++20","Surveillance des exécutions GitHub Actions avec une surveillance basée sur des intervalles","Suivi des tests d''intégration de liaisons Python"],"de":["Überwachung von PR-Checks mit dem Befehl gh pr checks","Debugging von CI-Fehlern in C++20-Physik-Engine-Builds","Überwachung von GitHub Actions-Runs mit intervallbasierter Überwachung","Verfolgung von Python-Binding-Integrationstests"],"pt":["Monitoring PR checks with gh pr checks command","Debugging CI failures in C++20 physics engine builds","Watching GitHub Actions runs with interval-based monitoring","Tracking Python binding integration tests"],"ru":["Monitoring PR checks with gh pr checks command","Debugging CI failures in C++20 physics engine builds","Watching GitHub Actions runs with interval-based monitoring","Tracking Python binding integration tests"],"ar":["Monitoring PR checks with gh pr checks command","Debugging CI failures in C++20 physics engine builds","Watching GitHub Actions runs with interval-based monitoring","Tracking Python binding integration tests"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI (gh) installation","Dependent on GitHub Actions environment","Limited to pull request CI workflows"],"zh":["需要安装GitHub CLI（gh）","依赖于GitHub Actions环境","仅限于拉取请求CI工作流"],"ja":["GitHub CLI（gh）のインストールが必要","GitHub Actions環境に依存する","プルリクエストCIワークフローに限定される"],"ko":["GitHub CLI(gh) 설치가 필요합니다","GitHub Actions 환경에 의존합니다","풀 리퀘스트 CI 워크플로에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de GitHub CLI (gh)","Dependiente del entorno de GitHub Actions","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de CI de pull request"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de GitHub CLI (gh)","Dépendant de l''environnement GitHub Actions","Limité aux workflows CI de pull request"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von GitHub CLI (gh)","Abhängig von der GitHub Actions-Umgebung","Beschränkt auf Pull-Request-CI-Workflows"],"pt":["Requires GitHub CLI (gh) installation","Dependent on GitHub Actions environment","Limited to pull request CI workflows"],"ru":["Requires GitHub CLI (gh) installation","Dependent on GitHub Actions environment","Limited to pull request CI workflows"],"ar":["Requires GitHub CLI (gh) installation","Dependent on GitHub Actions environment","Limited to pull request CI workflows"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a2b9639f752dcf7cc0f5cb351e99f44b340d9a6598587a747d83d623a4eae562","qualityScore":36}');
