repo是一个强大的基础设施、模块、应用程序和部署管理平台","ja":"Podverse monorepoは強力なインフラストラクチャ、モジュール、アプリケーション、デプロイ管理プラットフォームです","ko":"Podverse monorepo는 강력한 인프라스트럭처, 모듈, 애플리케이션, 배포 관리 플랫폼입니다","es":"El monorepo de Podverse para infraestructura, módulos, aplicaciones y despliegues","fr":"Le monorepo de Podverse pour l''infrastructure, les modules, les applications et les déploiements","de":"Das Monorepo von Podverse für Infrastruktur, Module, Anwendungen und Deployments","pt":"O Podverse é um monorepo que abrange toda a infraestrutura, módulos, aplicações e implantações, oferecendo padrões de API para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Podverse - это монорепозиторий, который охватывает всю инфраструктуру, модули, приложения и развертывания, предлагая шаблоны API для разработчиков.","ar":"Podverse هو مونوريبو يغطي جميع البنية التحتية والوحدات والتطبيقات والتركيبات ، و يقدم نمطز API для المطورين.","en":"Podverse monorepo for all infrastructure, modules, applications, and deployments"},"definition":{"en":"Podverse monorepo for all infrastructure, modules, applications, and deployments"},"features":{"zh":["统一管理基础设施、模块、应用程序和部署","支持多种编程语言和框架","提供强大的API和CLI工具","支持自动化部署和测试","提供详细的日志和监控功能"],"ja":["インフラストラクチャ、モジュール、アプリケーション、デプロイを一元管理","複数のプログラミング言語とフレームワークをサポート","強力なAPIとCLIツールを提供","自動化デプロイとテストをサポート","詳細なログとモニタリング機能を提供"],"ko":["인프라스트럭처, 모듈, 애플리케이션, 배포를 통합 관리","여러 프로그래밍 언어와 프레임워크를 지원","강력한 API와 CLI 도구를 제공","자동화 배포와 테스트를 지원","詳細한 로그와 모니터링 기능을 제공"],"es":["Monorepo para infraestructura y aplicaciones","Módulos y despliegues personalizables","Patrones de API para desarrolladores","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Documentación detallada y soporte"],"fr":["Monorepo pour l''infrastructure et les applications","Modules et déploiements personnalisables","Modèles d''API pour les développeurs","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Documentation détaillée et support"],"de":["Monorepo für Infrastruktur und Anwendungen","Module und Deployments anpassbar","API-Muster für Entwickler","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Detaillierte Dokumentation und Support"],"pt":["Padrões de API para infraestrutura","Módulos e aplicações personalizáveis","Implantações automatizadas","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes","Documentação detalhada"],"ru":["Шаблоны API для инфраструктуры","Настраиваемые модули и приложения","Автоматизированные развертывания","Поддержка нескольких сред","Дetailed документация"],"ar":["نمطز API للبنية التحتية","وحدات وتطبيقات قابلة للتعديل","تركيبات آليّة","دعم لعدة بيئات","توثيق مفصل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Podverse API","什么是Podverse monorepo","Podverse API模式","Podverse monorepo安装","Podverse monorepo设置指南","Podverse API与其他工具的比较"],"ja":["Podverse APIの使い方","Podverse monorepoとは","Podverse APIパターン","Podverse monorepoのインストール","Podverse monorepoの設定ガイド","Podverse APIと他のツールの比較"],"ko":["Podverse API 사용법","Podverse monorepo란","Podverse API 패턴","Podverse monorepo 설치","Podverse monorepo 설정 가이드","Podverse API와 다른 도구의 비교"],"es":["patrones de API","herramientas de AI Agent","desarrollo de aplicaciones","infraestructura como código","cómo usar Podverse","alternativas a Podverse","instalación de Podverse","guía de configuración de Podverse"],"fr":["modèles d''API","outils d''agent IA","développement d''applications","infrastructure comme code","comment utiliser Podverse","alternatives à Podverse","installation de Podverse","guide de configuration de Podverse"],"de":["API-Muster","AI-Tools","Anwendungsentwicklung","Infrastruktur als Code","wie man Podverse verwendet","Alternativen zu Podverse","Installation von Podverse","Konfigurationsanleitung für Podverse"],"pt":["como usar podverse","o que é podverse","padrões de api para infraestrutura","alternativas para podverse","podverse vs docker","instalar podverse","guia de configuração do podverse"],"ru":["как использовать podverse","что такое podverse","шаблоны api для инфраструктуры","альтернативы для podverse","podverse vs docker","установить podverse","руководство по настройке podverse"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام podverse","ما هو podverse","نمطز api للبنية التحتية","بديل podverse","podverse مقابل docker","تثبيت podverse","دليل إعداد podverse"]}},"owner":"podverse","repo":"podverse","repoPath":"podverse/podverse","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.022Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"podverse-api-patterns","description":"Common patterns for the podverse-api Express application","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Podverse API Development Patterns\n\nThis skill provides quick reference for common patterns used in the podverse-api application.\n\n## Monorepo Context\n\n- **API app location**: `apps/api/`\n- **Helper packages** (from `packages/helpers*/`): `@podverse/helpers`, `@podverse/helpers-validation`, `@podverse/helpers-requests`, `@podverse/helpers-backend`, `@podverse/helpers-config`\n- **ORM entities**: `@podverse/orm` (from `packages/orm/`)\n- **Message queue**: `@podverse/mq` (from `packages/mq/`)\n- **","body":"# Podverse API Development Patterns\n\nThis skill provides quick reference for common patterns used in the podverse-api application.\n\n## Monorepo Context\n\n- **API app location**: `apps/api/`\n- **Helper packages** (from `packages/helpers*/`): `@podverse/helpers`, `@podverse/helpers-validation`, `@podverse/helpers-requests`, `@podverse/helpers-backend`, `@podverse/helpers-config`\n- **ORM entities**: `@podverse/orm` (from `packages/orm/`)\n- **Message queue**: `@podverse/mq` (from `packages/mq/`)\n- **Feed parsing**: `@podverse/parser` (from `packages/parser/`)\n\n## Key Dependencies\n\n| Package                       | Purpose                                    |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| Helper packages               | Types, DTOs, utilities, validation, config |\n| `@podverse/orm`               | Database entities and services             |\n| `@podverse/mq`                | Message queue operations                   |\n| `@podverse/parser`            | Feed parsing                               |\n| `@podverse/external-services` | Third-party service integrations           |\n| `@podverse/notifications`     | Push notifications                         |\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Route Definition\n\n```typescript\n// apps/api/src/routes/podcast.ts\nimport { Router } from ''express'';\nimport { PodcastController } from ''../controllers/podcast'';\nimport { asyncHandler } from ''../lib/asyncHandler'';\n\nconst router = Router();\n\nrouter.get(''/:id'', asyncHandler(PodcastController.getById));\nrouter.post(''/'', asyncHandler(PodcastController.create));\n\nexport default router;\n```\n\n### Controller Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// apps/api/src/controllers/podcast.ts\nimport { Request, Response } from ''express'';\nimport { PodcastService } from ''@podverse/orm'';\n\nexport const PodcastController = {\n  async getById(req: Request, res: Response): Promise<void> {\n    try {\n      const { id } = req.params;\n      const podcast = await PodcastService.getById(id);\n\n      if (!podcast) {\n        res.status(404).json({ error: ''Podcast not found'' });\n        return;\n      }\n\n      res.json(podcast);\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error(''Error getting podcast:'', error);\n      res.status(500).json({ error: ''Internal server error'' });\n      return;\n    }\n  },\n\n  async create(req: Request, res: Response): Promise<void> {\n    try {\n      const data = req.body;\n      const podcast = await PodcastService.create(data);\n      res.status(201).json(podcast);\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error(''Error creating podcast:'', error);\n      res.status(500).json({ error: ''Internal server error'' });\n      return;\n    }\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### TypeScript Express Patterns\n\n#### Route Handler Return Values\n\nExpress route handlers should be typed as `Promise<void>` (or `void` for sync). Since `res.json()` returns a `Response` object, avoid using `return` with response methods.\n\n**Correct patterns:**\n\n```typescript\n// Early exit with status (use return for control flow)\nif (!item) {\n  res.status(404).json({ error: ''Not found'' });\n  return; // Return void, not Response\n}\n\n// Success response (no return needed)\nres.json(data);\n```\n\n**Incorrect pattern:**\n\n```typescript\n// DON''T do this - returns Response instead of void\nreturn res.json(data);\nreturn res.status(404).json({ error: ''Not found'' });\n```\n\n#### Exception: Early Exit Convenience\n\nThe `return` keyword is acceptable for early exits when combined with response methods for single-line control flow:\n\n```typescript\nif (!user) {\n  res.status(401).json({ error: ''Unauthorized'' });\n  return;\n}\n```\n\n#### Catch Block Returns\n\nAlways return explicitly in catch blocks to satisfy TypeScript''s `noImplicitReturns`:\n\n```typescript\ntry {\n  // ... handler logic\n  res.json(result);\n} catch (error) {\n  handleError(res, error);\n  return; // Required even though handleError sends response\n}\n```\n\n**With conditional response:**\n\n```typescript\n} catch (error) {\n  console.error(''Error:'', error);\n  if (!res.headersSent) {\n    res.status(500).json({ error: ''Internal error'' });\n  }\n  return;  // Required for all code paths\n}\n```\n\n### Rate Limiting\n\n```typescript\n// apps/api/src/lib/rateLimiter.ts\nimport { rateLimitAuthEndpoint, rateLimitEndpoint } from ''@api/lib/rateLimiter'';\n\n// For authenticated endpoints (per-user rate limiting)\nrouter.get(\n  ''/download-data'',\n  rateLimitAuthEndpoint({ windowMs: 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000, max: 3 }),\n  asyncHandler(AccountController.downloadData)\n);\n\n// For public endpoints (IP-based rate limiting)\nrouter.post(\n  ''/create'',\n  rateLimitEndpoint({ windowMs: 10 * 60 * 1000, max: 3 }),\n  asyncHandler(AccountController.create)\n);\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n\n```typescript\n// Use asyncHandler to catch errors automatically\nimport { asyncHandler } from ''../lib/asyncHandler'';\n\nrouter.get(\n  ''/:id'',\n  asyncHandler(async (req, res) => {\n    // Errors here are caught and passed to error middleware\n    const result = await riskyOperation();\n    res.json(result);\n  })\n);\n```\n\n### Environment Validation\n\nSee `apps/api/src/lib/startup/validation.ts` for environment variable validation patterns.\n\n**Lighthouse alignment:** When validation changes here, update\n`tools/web-perf/lighthouse/.env.api.example` and `.env.api` so the Lighthouse runner\nstays in sync with API startup validation.\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\napps/api/\n├── src/\n│   ├── controllers/     # Request handlers\n│   ├── routes/          # Route definitions\n│   ├── middleware/      # Express middleware\n│   ├── lib/             # Utilities and helpers\n│   │   ├── startup/     # App initialization\n│   │   └── rateLimiter.ts\n│   └── index.ts         # Entry point\n├── package.json\n└── tsconfig.json\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **[Web Patterns](../web/SKILL.md)** - Client-side patterns\n- **[ORM Patterns](../orm/SKILL.md)** - Database patterns\n- **[Global Patterns](../global/SKILL.md)** - Monorepo conventions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:12:33.858Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for API Development Agents requiring efficient monorepo management and Podverse API integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高效管理 monorepo 并集成 Podverse API 的 API 开发智能体。","ja":"効率的な monorepo 管理と Podverse API 統合を必要とする API 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"효율적인 모노레포 관리와 Podverse API 통합이 필요한 API 개발 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de API que requieren una gestión de monorepo eficiente y la integración de la API de Podverse.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement d''API nécessitant une gestion de monorepo efficace et l''intégration de l''API Podverse.","de":"Ideal für API-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine effiziente Monorepo-Verwaltung und die Integration der Podverse-API erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de API que exigem gestão de monorepo eficiente e integração com a API do Podverse.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки API, требующих эффективного управления monorepo и интеграции с API Podverse.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير API الذي يتطلب إدارة مونوريبو فعالة وتكامل مع API Podverse."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Podverse API development patterns, utilizing helper packages like @podverse/helpers and @podverse/helpers-validation, and integrating with ORM entities from @podverse/orm and message queues via @podverse/mq, streamlining API app development within the monorepo context.","zh":"使智能体能够利用 Podverse API 开发模式，使用诸如 @podverse/helpers 和 @podverse/helpers-validation 之类的辅助包，并与来自 @podverse/orm 的 ORM 实体以及通过 @podverse/mq 的消息队列集成，从而在 monorepo 上下文中简化 API 应用程序开发。","ja":"エージェントが Podverse API 開発パターンを活用し、@podverse/helpers や @podverse/helpers-validation などのヘルパーパッケージを利用し、@podverse/orm からの ORM エンティティおよび @podverse/mq を介したメッセージキューと統合することで、monorepo コンテキスト内での API アプリ開発を効率化します。","ko":"에이전트가 Podverse API 개발 패턴을 활용하고, @podverse/helpers 및 @podverse/helpers-validation와 같은 헬퍼 패키지를 사용하며, @podverse/orm의 ORM 엔터티 및 @podverse/mq를 통한 메시지 큐와 통합하여 모노레포 컨텍스트 내에서 API 앱 개발을 간소화할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar los patrones de desarrollo de API de Podverse, utilizando paquetes de ayuda como @podverse/helpers y @podverse/helpers-validation, e integrándose con entidades ORM de @podverse/orm y colas de mensajes a través de @podverse/mq, simplificando el desarrollo de aplicaciones de API dentro del contexto de monorepo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter les modèles de développement d''API de Podverse, en utilisant des packages d''aide tels que @podverse/helpers et @podverse/helpers-validation, et en s''intégrant avec des entités ORM de @podverse/orm et des files d''attente de messages via @podverse/mq, rationalisant ainsi le développement d''applications d''API dans le contexte de monorepo.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Entwicklungsmuster der Podverse-API zu nutzen, indem sie Hilfspakete wie @podverse/helpers und @podverse/helpers-validation verwenden und sich mit ORM-Entitäten von @podverse/orm und Nachrichtenwarteschlangen über @podverse/mq integrieren, wodurch die API-App-Entwicklung im Monorepo-Kontext rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes usem padrões de desenvolvimento de API do Podverse, utilizando pacotes de ajuda como @podverse/helpers e @podverse/helpers-validation, e integrando com entidades ORM do @podverse/orm e filas de mensagens via @podverse/mq, simplificando o desenvolvimento de aplicativos de API dentro do contexto do monorepo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать шаблоны разработки API Podverse, используя пакеты-помощники, такие как @podverse/helpers и @podverse/helpers-validation, и интегрируя с сущностями ORM из @podverse/orm и очередями сообщений через @podverse/mq, оптимизируя разработку приложений API в контексте monorepo.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استخدام أنماط تطوير API Podverse، باستخدام حزم مساعدة مثل @podverse/helpers و @podverse/helpers-validation، وتكامل مع كيانات ORM من @podverse/orm وطوابير الرسائل عبر @podverse/mq، مبسطًا تطوير تطبيقات API داخل سياق مونوريبو."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing scalable API applications within the Podverse monorepo","Implementing validation and request handling using @podverse/helpers-validation and @podverse/helpers-requests","Integrating with message queues via @podverse/mq for asynchronous task management"],"zh":["在 Podverse monorepo 中开发可扩展的 API 应用程序","使用 @podverse/helpers-validation 和 @podverse/helpers-requests 实现验证和请求处理","通过 @podverse/mq 集成消息队列以实现异步任务管理"],"ja":["Podverse monorepo 内でのスケーラブルな API アプリケーションの開発","@podverse/helpers-validation および @podverse/helpers-requests を使用した検証とリクエスト処理の実装","非同期タスク管理のための @podverse/mq を介したメッセージキューとの統合"],"ko":["Podverse 모노레포 내에서 확장 가능한 API 애플리케이션 개발","@podverse/helpers-validation 및 @podverse/helpers-requests를 사용하여 검증 및 요청 처리 구현","비동기 작업 관리를 위해 @podverse/mq를 통한 메시지 큐 통합"],"es":["Desarrollar aplicaciones de API escalables dentro del monorepo de Podverse","Implementar la validación y el manejo de solicitudes utilizando @podverse/helpers-validation y @podverse/helpers-requests","Integrarse con colas de mensajes a través de @podverse/mq para la gestión de tareas asíncronas"],"fr":["Développer des applications d''API évolutives au sein du monorepo de Podverse","Mettre en œuvre la validation et la gestion des requêtes en utilisant @podverse/helpers-validation et @podverse/helpers-requests","S''intégrer avec des files d''attente de messages via @podverse/mq pour la gestion de tâches asynchrones"],"de":["Entwicklung von skalierbaren API-Anwendungen innerhalb des Podverse-Monorepo","Implementierung der Validierung und Anfragebehandlung unter Verwendung von @podverse/helpers-validation und @podverse/helpers-requests","Integration mit Nachrichtenwarteschlangen über @podverse/mq für die Verwaltung asynchroner Aufgaben"],"pt":["Desenvolver aplicações de API escaláveis dentro do monorepo do Podverse","Implementar validação e tratamento de solicitações usando @podverse/helpers-validation e @podverse/helpers-requests","Integrar com filas de mensagens via @podverse/mq para gerenciamento de tarefas assíncronas"],"ru":["Разрабатывать масштабируемые приложения API внутри monorepo Podverse","Реализовывать валидацию и обработку запросов с помощью @podverse/helpers-validation и @podverse/helpers-requests","Интегрироваться с очередями сообщений через @podverse/mq для управления асинхронными задачами"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات API قابلة للتطوير داخل مونوريبو Podverse","تنفيذ التحقق والتعامل مع الطلبات باستخدام @podverse/helpers-validation و @podverse/helpers-requests","التكامل مع طوابير الرسائل عبر @podverse/mq لإدارة المهام غير المتزامنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the Podverse monorepo infrastructure","Dependent on specific helper packages and ORM entities","Limited to Podverse API development context"],"zh":["需要访问 Podverse monorepo 基础设施","依赖于特定的辅助包和 ORM 实体","仅限于 Podverse API 开发上下文"],"ja":["Podverse monorepo インフラストラクチャへのアクセスが必要","特定のヘルパーパッケージと ORM エンティティに依存","Podverse API 開発コンテキストに限定される"],"ko":["Podverse 모노레포 인프라에 대한 접근 필요","특정 헬퍼 패키지 및 ORM 엔터티에 종속적","Podverse API 개발 컨텍스트로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la infraestructura del monorepo de Podverse","Depende de paquetes de ayuda y entidades ORM específicas","Limitado al contexto de desarrollo de la API de Podverse"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à l''infrastructure de monorepo de Podverse","Dépend de packages d''aide et d''entités ORM spécifiques","Limité au contexte de développement de l''API de Podverse"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Infrastruktur des Podverse-Monorepo","Hängt von bestimmten Hilfspaketen und ORM-Entitäten ab","Begrenzt auf den Kontext der Podverse-API-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Exige acesso à infraestrutura do monorepo do Podverse","Depende de pacotes de ajuda específicos e entidades ORM","Limitado ao contexto de desenvolvimento de API do Podverse"],"ru":["Требует доступа к инфраструктуре monorepo Podverse","Зависит от конкретных пакетов-помощников и сущностей ORM","Ограничен контекстом разработки API Podverse"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بنية تحتية مونوريبو Podverse","يعتمد على حزم مساعدة محددة وكيانات ORM","محدود سياق تطوير API Podverse"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b3227c56e5cabb65b34de5a39cba35b3cd58b99715e4e06f6a61cfa55cbc3ac7","qualityScore":36}');
