ion","développement de plateformes de participation avec React","intégration d''outils d''IA avec Node.js"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein Teilnahme-Übersetzer","Alternativen zu Teilnahme-Übersetzern","Teilnahme-Übersetzer vs Marketing-Tools","Installation von Teilnahme-Übersetzern","Konfigurationsanleitung für Teilnahme-Übersetzer","Entwicklung von Teilnahme-Plattformen mit React","Integration von KI-Tools mit Node.js"],"pt":["como usar Participation Translator","o que é Participation Translator","Participation Translator alternativa","Participation Translator vs outras ferramentas","instalar Participation Translator","guia de configuração do Participation Translator","ferramentas de IA para marketing","plataformas de participação"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент Participation Translator","что такое ИИ Агент Participation Translator","ИИ Агент Participation Translator альтернатива","ИИ Агент Participation Translator vs другие инструменты","установить ИИ Агент Participation Translator","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента Participation Translator","инструменты ИИ для маркетинга","платформы для участия"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مترجم المشاركة","ما هو مترجم المشاركة","بديل مترجم المشاركة","مترجم المشاركة مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت مترجم المشاركة","دليل إعداد مترجم المشاركة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتسويق","منصات المشاركة"]}},"owner":"Absolute-Space-GHCP","repo":"leo-participation-translator","repoPath":"Absolute-Space-GHCP/leo-participation-translator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.030Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"session-workflow","description":"Session management including startup, wrap-up, and handoff procedures. Use when starting a new session, ending a session, creating session logs, or preparing handoff documentation.","bodyPreview":"# Session Workflow Skill\n\n## Session Start Checklist\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Verify workspace\n- [ ] Step 2: Check git status\n- [ ] Step 3: Review TASKS.md priorities\n- [ ] Step 4: Check claude-mem status\n- [ ] Step 5: Validate API keys & services\n- [ ] Step 6: Verify dev server (if needed)\n```\n\n### Step 1: Verify Workspace\n\n```bash\n# Confirm correct workspace\npwd\n# Expected: /Users/charleymm/Projects/leo-participation-translator\n\n# Verify it''s the right project\nls CLAUDE.md PLAN.md TAS","body":"# Session Workflow Skill\n\n## Session Start Checklist\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Verify workspace\n- [ ] Step 2: Check git status\n- [ ] Step 3: Review TASKS.md priorities\n- [ ] Step 4: Check claude-mem status\n- [ ] Step 5: Validate API keys & services\n- [ ] Step 6: Verify dev server (if needed)\n```\n\n### Step 1: Verify Workspace\n\n```bash\n# Confirm correct workspace\npwd\n# Expected: /Users/charleymm/Projects/leo-participation-translator\n\n# Verify it''s the right project\nls CLAUDE.md PLAN.md TASKS.md\n```\n\n### Step 2: Check Git Status\n\n```bash\ngit status\ngit fetch origin main\ngit log HEAD..origin/main --oneline  # Check if behind\n```\n\n### Step 3: Review Priorities\n\nRead `TASKS.md` to identify current priorities and in-progress tasks.\n\n### Step 4: Check Claude-Mem\n\n```bash\ncurl -s http://127.0.0.1:37777/api/readiness\n# Expected: {\"status\":\"ready\",\"mcpReady\":true}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Validate API Keys & Services\n\nRun these checks to verify all external dependencies are healthy:\n\n```bash\n# --- GCP Authentication ---\ngcloud auth application-default print-access-token > /dev/null 2>&1 \\\n  && echo \"âœ… GCP auth valid\" || echo \"âŒ GCP auth expired â€” run: gcloud auth login --update-adc\"\n\n# --- Exa.ai API Key ---\nEXA_KEY=$(grep \"EXA_API_KEY\" app/.env.local | cut -d''='' -f2)\nEXA_STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" -X POST \"https://api.exa.ai/search\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -H \"x-api-key: $EXA_KEY\" \\\n  -d ''{\"query\":\"test\",\"numResults\":1}'')\n[ \"$EXA_STATUS\" = \"200\" ] && echo \"âœ… Exa.ai key valid\" || echo \"âŒ Exa.ai key INVALID ($EXA_STATUS) â€” rotate at dashboard.exa.ai\"\n\n# --- Tavily API Key ---\nTAVILY_KEY=$(grep \"TAVILY_API_KEY\" app/.env.local | cut -d''='' -f2)\nTAVILY_STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" -X POST \"https://api.tavily.com/search\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"api_key\\\":\\\"$TAVILY_KEY\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"test\\\",\\\"max_results\\\":1}\")\n[ \"$TAVILY_STATUS\" = \"200\" ] && echo \"âœ… Tavily key valid\" || echo \"âŒ Tavily key INVALID ($TAVILY_STATUS) â€” check app.tavily.com\"\n\n# --- Anthropic API Key ---\nANTHROPIC_KEY=$(grep \"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\" app/.env.local | cut -d''='' -f2)\nANTHROPIC_STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" \"https://api.anthropic.com/v1/models\" \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: $ANTHROPIC_KEY\" -H \"anthropic-version: 2023-06-01\")\n[ \"$ANTHROPIC_STATUS\" = \"200\" ] && echo \"âœ… Anthropic key valid\" || echo \"âŒ Anthropic key INVALID ($ANTHROPIC_STATUS)\"\n\n# --- Cloud Run (production) ---\nPROD_STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" \\\n  \"https://participation-translator-904747039219.us-central1.run.app/login\")\n[ \"$PROD_STATUS\" = \"200\" ] && echo \"âœ… Cloud Run healthy\" || echo \"âŒ Cloud Run issue ($PROD_STATUS)\"\n```\n\n### Step 6: Verify Dev Server (if needed)\n\n```bash\ncd app && npx next dev --port 3005\n# Verify: curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" http://localhost:3005/api/stats\n```\n\n---\n\n## Session End Checklist\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Update TASKS.md\n- [ ] Step 2: Create session log\n- [ ] Step 3: Commit changes\n- [ ] Step 4: Push to remote\n- [ ] Step 5: Create handoff\n```\n\n### Step 1: Update TASKS.md\n\nMark completed tasks, update progress percentages.\n\n### Step 2: Create Session Log\n\nCreate `sessions/SESSION_{DATE}_{VERSION}.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Session Summary: Participation Translator vX.X.X\n\n**Date:** YYYY-MM-DD\n**Duration:** X hours\n\n## What Was Done\n\n- [Key accomplishment 1]\n- [Key accomplishment 2]\n\n## Files Changed\n\n- `file1.ts` - Description\n- `file2.md` - Description\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. [Priority task 1]\n2. [Priority task 2]\n```\n\n### Step 3: Commit Changes\n\n```bash\ngit add -A\ngit commit -m \"feat(vX.X.X): brief description of changes\"\n```\n\n### Step 4: Push to Remote\n\n```bash\n# Archive remote first if it has diverged\ngit fetch origin main\ngit log HEAD..origin/main --oneline\n# If empty, safe to push\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n### Step 5: Create Handoff\n\nProvide handoff summary in conversation:\n\n```\n## Participation Translator Handoff\n\n**Session End**: {datetime}\n**Version**: {version}\n\n### What Was Done\n- [Key items]\n\n### Current State\n- Git: Clean/Dirty\n- Phase: 0/1/2/etc\n\n### Next Steps\n1. [Priority 1]\n2. [Priority 2]\n\n### Quick Commands\nnpm run dev\nnpm test\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference Commands\n\n| Task            | Command                                     |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Check workspace | `pwd`                                       |\n| Git status      | `git status`                                |\n| Run dev server  | `cd app && npx next dev --port 3005`        |\n| Run tests       | `npm test`                                  |\n| Build           | `cd app && npm run build`                   |\n| Type check      | `cd app && npx tsc --noEmit`                |\n| Deploy          | `cd app && gcloud run deploy participation-translator --source . --region us-central1 --project participation-translator --allow-unauthenticated` |\n| Production URL  | `https://participation-translator-904747039219.us-central1.run.app` |\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Charley Scholz, JLAI\nCo-authored: Claude Opus 4.6, Cursor (IDE)\nLast Updated: 2026-02-13\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:17:45.810Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring structured session management and workflow automation.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化会话管理和工作流自动化的开发Agent。","ja":"構造化されたセッション管理とワークフロー自動化を必要とする開発Agentに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 세션 관리 및 워크플로 자동화가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren una gestión de sesión estructurada y automatización de flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion de session structurée et une automatisation du workflow.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel wie strukturierte Sitzungsverwaltung und Workflow-Automatisierung.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem gerenciamento estruturado de sessão e automação de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Development Agents, требующих структурированного управления сеансами и автоматизации рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير التي تتطلب إدارة منظمة للجلسات وأتمتة سير العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically verify workspaces, manage git status, and review task priorities using tools like TASKS.md and claude-mem, while validating API keys and services for seamless development.","zh":"赋能Agent使用TASKS.md和claude-mem等工具系统地验证工作区、管理git状态并审查任务优先级，同时验证API密钥和服务以实现无缝开发。","ja":"TASKS.mdやclaude-memなどのツールを使用して、ワークスペースの検証、gitステータスの管理、タスク優先順位のレビューを体系的に行い、APIキーとサービスの検証を通じてシームレスな開発を実現するようにAgentを強化します。","ko":"TASKS.md 및 claude-mem과 같은 도구를 사용하여 작업 공간을 체계적으로 검증하고, git 상태를 관리하며, 작업 우선순위를 검토하는 동시에 API 키와 서비스를 검증하여 원활한 개발을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes verificar sistemáticamente los espacios de trabajo, gestionar el estado de git y revisar las prioridades de las tareas utilizando herramientas como TASKS.md y claude-mem, al tiempo que valida las claves de API y los servicios para un desarrollo sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier systématiquement les espaces de travail, de gérer l''état de git et de réviser les priorités des tâches en utilisant des outils comme TASKS.md et claude-mem, tout en validant les clés d''API et les services pour un développement sans heurts.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Arbeitsbereiche systematisch zu überprüfen, den Git-Status zu verwalten und Aufgabenprioritäten mit Tools wie TASKS.md und claude-mem zu überprüfen, während API-Schlüssel und Dienste für eine reibungslose Entwicklung validiert werden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a verificar sistematicamente workspaces, gerenciar o status do git e revisar as prioridades de tarefas usando ferramentas como TASKS.md e claude-mem, enquanto valida API keys e serviços para um desenvolvimento contínuo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам систематически проверять рабочие области (workspaces), управлять статусом git и анализировать приоритеты задач с помощью таких инструментов, как TASKS.md и claude-mem, а также проверять API keys и сервисы для бесперебойной разработки.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من التحقق بشكل منهجي من مساحات العمل، وإدارة حالة git، ومراجعة أولويات المهام باستخدام أدوات مثل TASKS.md وclaude-mem، مع التحقق من مفاتيح API والخدمات من أجل تطوير سلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing development environments with verified workspace and git status","Automating task priority reviews using TASKS.md","Validating API keys and services for secure integration","Debugging development server issues with systematic checks"],"zh":["使用经过验证的工作区和git状态初始化开发环境","使用TASKS.md自动化任务优先级审查","验证API密钥和服务以实现安全集成","通过系统性检查调试开发服务器问题"],"ja":["検証済みのワークスペースとgitステータスを使用した開発環境の初期化","TASKS.mdを使用したタスク優先順位レビューの自動化","安全な統合のためのAPIキーとサービスの検証","体系的なチェックによる開発サーバー問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["검증된 작업 공간 및 git 상태로 개발 환경 초기화","TASKS.md를 사용한 작업 우선순위 검토 자동화","안전한 통합을 위한 API 키 및 서비스 검증","체계적인 점검으로 개발 서버 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Inicializar entornos de desarrollo con un espacio de trabajo verificado y estado de git","Automatizar revisiones de prioridad de tareas con TASKS.md","Validar claves de API y servicios para una integración segura","Depurar problemas del servidor de desarrollo con controles sistemáticos"],"fr":["Initialiser des environnements de développement avec un espace de travail vérifié et un état de git","Automatiser les révisions de priorité de tâches avec TASKS.md","Valider les clés d''API et les services pour une intégration sécurisée","Déboguer les problèmes du serveur de développement avec des vérifications systématiques"],"de":["Entwicklungsumgebungen mit verifiziertem Arbeitsbereich und Git-Status initialisieren","Aufgabenprioritäten-Überprüfungen mit TASKS.md automatisieren","API-Schlüssel und Dienste für eine sichere Integration validieren","Entwicklungs-Server-Probleme mit systematischen Überprüfungen debuggen"],"pt":["Inicialização de ambientes de desenvolvimento com workspace e status do git verificados","Automatização de revisões de prioridade de tarefas usando TASKS.md","Validação de API keys e serviços para integração segura","Depuração de problemas do servidor de desenvolvimento com verificações sistemáticas"],"ru":["Инициализация сред разработки с проверенной рабочей областью (workspace) и статусом git","Автоматизация анализа приоритетов задач с использованием TASKS.md","Проверка API keys и сервисов для безопасной интеграции","Отладка проблем сервера разработки с помощью систематических проверок"],"ar":["تهيئة بيئات التطوير بمساحة عمل وحالة git تم التحقق منهما","أتمتة مراجعات أولوية المهام باستخدام TASKS.md","التحقق من مفاتيح API والخدمات للتكامل الآمن","تصحيح مشكلات خادم التطوير باستخدام فحوصات منهجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to git and claude-mem","Needs valid API keys for services","Limited to development environments with specific tooling like TASKS.md"],"zh":["需要访问git和claude-mem","需要有效的服务API密钥","仅限于具有TASKS.md等特定工具的开发环境"],"ja":["gitおよびclaude-memへのアクセスが必要","有効なサービスのAPIキーが必要","TASKS.mdなどの特定のツールを持つ開発環境に限定される"],"ko":["git 및 claude-mem에 대한 액세스 필요","서비스의 유효한 API 키 필요","TASKS.md와 같은 특정 도구를 갖춘 개발 환경으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a git y claude-mem","Necesita claves de API válidas para los servicios","Limitado a entornos de desarrollo con herramientas específicas como TASKS.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à git et claude-mem","Nécessite des clés d''API valides pour les services","Limité aux environnements de développement avec des outils spécifiques comme TASKS.md"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf git und claude-mem","Benötigt gültige API-Schlüssel für Dienste","Begrenzt auf Entwicklungsumgebungen mit spezifischen Tools wie TASKS.md"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao git e ao claude-mem","Necessita de API keys válidas para os serviços","Limitado a ambientes de desenvolvimento com ferramentas específicas como TASKS.md"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к git и claude-mem","Требуются действительные API keys для сервисов","Ограничено средами разработки со специфическими инструментами, такими как TASKS.md"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى git وclaude-mem","يحتاج إلى مفاتيح API صالحة للخدمات","يقتصر على بيئات التطوير التي تحتوي على أدوات محددة مثل TASKS.md"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6ae9acfaf7c7cde73ddee5bca124e3aabedad8018d5c9a5eebc8c5e354d8e32b","qualityScore":36}');
