ble","Prise en charge des projets d''applications web et mobile","Documentation détaillée et exemples de code"],"de":["Grundlegende Struktur für die Ausnahmehandhabung","Integration mit Node.js und Nestjs","Einfache und anpassbare Implementierung","Unterstützung für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungsprojekte","Detaillierte Dokumentation und Codebeispiele"],"pt":["Modelo de inicialização para projetos NestJS","Recursos de exception integrados","Fácil de usar e personalizar","Melhora a produtividade do desenvolvedor","Compatível com as últimas versões do NestJS"],"ru":["Шаблон запуска для проектов NestJS","Включает функции исключения","Легко использовать и настраивать","Улучшает производительность разработчика","Совместим с последними версиями NestJS"],"ar":["نموذج أولي لمشاريع NestJS","تتضمن ميزات الاستثناء","سهل الاستخدام والتخصيص","يحسن إنتاجية المطور","متوافق مع أحدث إصدارات NestJS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Nestjs异常模板","AI智能工具","快速创建项目","开发流程简化","Nestjs项目模板","AI工具使用","Nestjs开发","项目创建工具","开发环境配置"],"ja":["Nestjsプロジェクトスターター","AIエージェント","プロジェクトの迅速な作成","開発プロセスの簡素化","Nestjsプロジェクトテンプレート","AIツールの使用","Nestjs開発","プロジェクト作成ツール","開発環境の設定"],"ko":["Nestjs 프로젝트 스타터","AI 에이전트","프로젝트의 빠른 생성","개발 프로세スの 단순화","Nestjs 프로젝트 템플릿","AI 도구의 사용","Nestjs 개발","프로젝트 생성 도구","개발 환경의 설정"],"es":["herramientas de ai","plantilla de excepción de nestjs","node.js","nestjs","manejo de errores","implementación de excepciones","proyectos de aplicación web","proyectos de aplicación móvil"],"fr":["outils d''ia","modèle de démarrage de projet nestjs","node.js","nestjs","gestion des erreurs","mise en œuvre des exceptions","projets d''applications web","projets d''applications mobile"],"de":["ki-tools","nestjs-projekt-starter-vorlage","node.js","nestjs","fehlerbehandlung","implementierung von ausnahmen","web-anwendungsprojekte","mobile-anwendungsprojekte"],"pt":["criar projetos nestjs","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","nestjs exception","como usar nestjs","alternativas ao nestjs","nestjs vs express","instalar nestjs","guia de configuração do nestjs"],"ru":["создать проекты nestjs","инструменты ии для разработчиков","nestjs исключение","как использовать nestjs","альтернативы nestjs","nestjs vs express","установить nestjs","руководство по настройке nestjs"],"ar":["إنشاء مشاريع nestjs","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","استثناء nestjs","كيفية استخدام nestjs","بديلات nestjs","nestjs مقابل express","تثبيت nestjs","دليل إعداد nestjs"]}},"owner":"sharifli4","repo":"nestjs-infra-template","repoPath":"sharifli4/nestjs-infra-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.040Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-nestjs-exception","description":"Create standardized exceptions following the templates exception system. Use when the user asks to create an exception, error class, or custom error handling, or mentions exception, error, throw, or HTTP status codes.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Create NestJS Exception\n\nCreate standardized exceptions following this project''s patterns.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen creating an exception:\n\n1. **Check if a core exception exists first** - Can you reuse `NotFoundException`, `CustomBadRequestException`?\n2. **Determine location** - Feature-specific or core/reusable?\n3. **Follow naming** - `{Concept}{Action}Exception`\n4. **Use BaseExceptionDto** - Required for all exceptions\n5. **Pick ExceptionTypeEnum** - From available types\n6. **Add Swagger docs**","body":"# Create NestJS Exception\n\nCreate standardized exceptions following this project''s patterns.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen creating an exception:\n\n1. **Check if a core exception exists first** - Can you reuse `NotFoundException`, `CustomBadRequestException`?\n2. **Determine location** - Feature-specific or core/reusable?\n3. **Follow naming** - `{Concept}{Action}Exception`\n4. **Use BaseExceptionDto** - Required for all exceptions\n5. **Pick ExceptionTypeEnum** - From available types\n6. **Add Swagger docs** - Document in controller\n\n## Exception Template\n\n```typescript\n// Location:\n// - Feature-specific: src/features/{feature}/exceptions/{exception-name}.exception.ts\n// - Reusable: src/core/exceptions/http/{exception-name}.exception.ts\n\nimport { HttpException, HttpStatus } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { ExceptionTypeEnum, BaseExceptionDto } from ''@/core/exceptions'';\n\n/**\n * Thrown when [describe specific condition]\n * \n * @example\n * throw new {ExceptionName}(identifier);\n */\nexport class {ExceptionName} extends HttpException {\n  constructor(identifier: string | number) {\n    const baseExceptionDto = BaseExceptionDto.CreateBaseException(\n      [identifier.toString()],\n      HttpStatus.{STATUS_CODE},\n      ExceptionTypeEnum.{TYPE},\n      ''{Detailed error message}'',\n    );\n    super(baseExceptionDto, HttpStatus.{STATUS_CODE});\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Available Exception Types\n\n```typescript\nExceptionTypeEnum.BAD_REQUEST           // Invalid request data\nExceptionTypeEnum.NOT_FOUND             // Resource not found\nExceptionTypeEnum.VALIDATION            // DTO validation failures\nExceptionTypeEnum.UNAUTHORIZED          // No authentication\nExceptionTypeEnum.FORBIDDEN             // Insufficient permissions\nExceptionTypeEnum.CONFLICT              // Resource conflict\nExceptionTypeEnum.UNIQUE_VIOLATION      // DB unique constraint\nExceptionTypeEnum.UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY  // Cannot process valid request\nExceptionTypeEnum.INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR // Server-side errors\n```\n\n## Quick Patterns\n\n### Not Found\n```typescript\nexport class {Resource}NotFoundException extends HttpException {\n  constructor(id: string) {\n    const baseExceptionDto = BaseExceptionDto.CreateBaseException(\n      [id],\n      HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND,\n      ExceptionTypeEnum.NOT_FOUND,\n      `{Resource} with ID ${id} not found`,\n    );\n    super(baseExceptionDto, HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Validation with Multiple Fields\n```typescript\nexport class Invalid{Resource}DataException extends HttpException {\n  constructor(fields: string[], detail: string) {\n    const baseExceptionDto = BaseExceptionDto.CreateBaseException(\n      fields,\n      HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST,\n      ExceptionTypeEnum.VALIDATION,\n      detail,\n    );\n    super(baseExceptionDto, HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Business Logic\n```typescript\nexport class {BusinessRule}Exception extends HttpException {\n  constructor(detail: string) {\n    const baseExceptionDto = BaseExceptionDto.CreateBaseException(\n      [],\n      HttpStatus.UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY,\n      ExceptionTypeEnum.UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY,\n      detail,\n    );\n    super(baseExceptionDto, HttpStatus.UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Reuse Core Exceptions\n\n**Always check first:** Can you use an existing core exception?\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  CustomBadRequestException,\n  NotFoundException,\n  UnauthorizedException,\n  ForbiddenException,\n  DatabaseOperationException,\n} from ''@/core/exceptions'';\n\n// Generic not found\nthrow new NotFoundException(''User'', userId);\n\n// Generic validation\nthrow new CustomBadRequestException(\n  [''email''],\n  ExceptionTypeEnum.VALIDATION,\n  ''Invalid email format''\n);\n```\n\n**Create custom exceptions only when:**\n- Core exceptions don''t cover the use case\n- You need feature-specific error details\n- You want better type safety\n\n## Swagger Documentation\n\nAlways document in controllers:\n\n```typescript\nimport { ApiCustomExceptionResponse } from ''@/core/exceptions'';\n\n@Post()\n@ApiCustomExceptionResponse(400, ''Invalid data'')\n@ApiCustomExceptionResponse(409, ''Resource conflict'')\nasync create(@Body() dto: CreateDto) {\n  // Implementation\n}\n```\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore creating an exception:\n\n- [ ] Checked if core exceptions can be reused\n- [ ] Determined location (feature-specific or core)\n- [ ] Name follows `{Concept}{Action}Exception` format\n- [ ] Extends `HttpException`\n- [ ] Uses `BaseExceptionDto.CreateBaseException()`\n- [ ] Includes proper `ExceptionTypeEnum`\n- [ ] Has JSDoc with description and example\n- [ ] Target array specifies relevant fields\n- [ ] Documented with `@ApiCustomExceptionResponse`\n\n## Rules\n\n❌ **NEVER** use raw NestJS exceptions:\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG\nthrow new BadRequestException(''Error'');\nthrow new NotFoundException(''Not found'');\n```\n\n✅ **ALWAYS** use BaseExceptionDto system:\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT\nthrow new NotFoundException(''User'', userId);\n// Or create custom\nthrow new UserNotFoundException(userId);\n```\n\n⚠️ **PREFER** core exceptions when possible - don''t create unnecessary custom exceptions.\n\n## Full Documentation\n\nSee `.cursor/rules/exceptions.mdc` for complete rules and patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:22:38.016Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Agents specializing in NestJS framework, seeking to standardize exception handling and error management.","zh":"适合专门从事NestJS框架的全栈代理商，旨在标准化异常处理和错误管理。","ja":"NestJSフレームワークを専門とするフルスタックエージェントに適しています。例外ハンドリングとエラーマネージメントを標準化することを目的としています。","ko":"NestJS 프레임워크를 전문으로 하는 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 예외 처리와 오류 관리를 표준화하려는 목적으로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Full-Stack especializados en el framework NestJS, que buscan estandarizar el manejo de excepciones y errores.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full-Stack spécialisés dans le framework NestJS, cherchant à standardiser la gestion des exceptions et des erreurs.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die auf dem NestJS-Framework spezialisiert sind und die Ausnahmebehandlung und Fehlerverwaltung standardisieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack especializados no framework NestJS, que buscam padronizar o tratamento de exceções e gerenciamento de erros.","ru":"Идеально для Full-Stack агентов, специализирующихся на фреймворке NestJS, стремящихся стандартизировать обработку исключений и управление ошибками.","ar":"مثالية لعميل متكامل كامل专熊 في إطار NestJS ، يسعى إلى تحقيق معايير معالجة الاستثناءات وإدارة الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create standardized exceptions following NestJS project patterns, utilizing BaseExceptionDto and ExceptionTypeEnum, while ensuring Swagger documentation compliance for seamless API integration.","zh":"赋予代理商创建标准化异常的能力，遵循NestJS项目模式，利用BaseExceptionDto和ExceptionTypeEnum，同时确保Swagger文档符合性以实现无缝的API集成。","ja":"エージェントがNestJSプロジェクトパターンに従って標準化された例外を作成する能力を提供します。BaseExceptionDtoとExceptionTypeEnumを利用し、スムーズなAPI統合のためのSwaggerドキュメントの準拠性も確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 NestJS 프로젝트 패턴을 따라 표준화된 예외를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. BaseExceptionDto와 ExceptionTypeEnum을 활용하며, 원활한 API 통합을 위한 Swagger 문서의 준수성을 또한 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear excepciones estandarizadas siguiendo los patrones del proyecto NestJS, utilizando BaseExceptionDto y ExceptionTypeEnum, garantizando al mismo tiempo el cumplimiento de la documentación Swagger para una integración API sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des exceptions standardisées en suivant les modèles de projet NestJS, en utilisant BaseExceptionDto et ExceptionTypeEnum, tout en assurant le respect de la documentation Swagger pour une intégration API transparente.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, standardisierte Ausnahmen gemäß den NestJS-Projektmustern zu erstellen, indem BaseExceptionDto und ExceptionTypeEnum verwendet werden, während gleichzeitig die Swagger-Dokumentation für eine nahtlose API-Integration eingehalten wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem exceções padronizadas seguindo os padrões de projeto do NestJS, utilizando BaseExceptionDto e ExceptionTypeEnum, garantindo a conformidade da documentação do Swagger para integração de API transparente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать стандартизированные исключения, следующими шаблонам проекта NestJS, используя BaseExceptionDto и ExceptionTypeEnum, обеспечивая соответствие документации Swagger для бесшовной интеграции API.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من إنشاء استثناءات معيارية متابعة لنمط مشروع NestJS ، باستخدام BaseExceptionDto و ExceptionTypeEnum ، مع ضمان مطابقة توثيق Swagger لتكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الشفافة."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating feature-specific exceptions with reusable core exception patterns","Developing custom exceptions with standardized naming conventions","Implementing Swagger documentation for transparent error handling and API communication"],"zh":["使用可复用的核心异常模式创建特性特定的异常","使用标准化的命名约定开发自定义异常","实现Swagger文档以实现透明的错误处理和API通信"],"ja":["再利用可能なコア例外パターンを使用して機能固有の例外を作成する","標準化された命名規則を使用してカスタム例外を開発する","透明なエラーハンドリングとAPI通信のためのSwaggerドキュメントを実装する"],"ko":["재사용 가능한 핵심 예외 패턴을 사용하여 기능 특정 예외를 생성합니다","표준화된命名 규칙을 사용하여 사용자 지정 예외를 개발합니다","투명한 오류 처리 및 API 통신을 위한 Swagger 문서를 구현합니다"],"es":["Creación de excepciones específicas de función con patrones de excepción de núcleo reutilizables","Desarrollo de excepciones personalizadas con convenciones de nomenclatura estandarizadas","Implementación de la documentación Swagger para un manejo de errores transparente y una comunicación API"],"fr":["Création d''exceptions spécifiques aux fonctionnalités avec des modèles d''exception de noyau réutilisables","Développement d''exceptions personnalisées avec des conventions de nommage standardisées","Mise en œuvre de la documentation Swagger pour un traitement transparent des erreurs et une communication API"],"de":["Erstellung von funktionspezifischen Ausnahmen mit wiederverwendbaren Kernausnahmemustern","Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten Ausnahmen mit standardisierten Namenskonventionen","Implementierung der Swagger-Dokumentation für eine transparente Fehlerbehandlung und API-Kommunikation"],"pt":["Criar exceções específicas de recurso com padrões de exceção core reutilizáveis","Desenvolver exceções personalizadas com convenções de nomenclatura padronizadas","Implementar documentação do Swagger para tratamento de erros transparente e comunicação de API"],"ru":["Создание исключений, специфичных для функций, с повторно используемыми основными шаблонами исключений","Разработка пользовательских исключений со стандартизированными соглашениями об именах","Реализация документации Swagger для прозрачной обработки ошибок и коммуникации API"],"ar":["إنشاء استثناءات محددة للميزة مع أنماط استثناء الأساسية القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تطوير استثناءات مخصصة مع اتفاقيات تسمية معيارية","تطبيق توثيق Swagger لمعالجة الأخطاء الشفافة وتواصل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires NestJS project setup","Follows specific naming conventions and patterns","Needs understanding of ExceptionTypeEnum and BaseExceptionDto"],"zh":["需要NestJS项目设置","遵循特定的命名约定和模式","需要理解ExceptionTypeEnum和BaseExceptionDto"],"ja":["NestJSプロジェクトの設定が必要","特定の命名規則とパターンに従う","ExceptionTypeEnumとBaseExceptionDtoの理解が必要"],"ko":["NestJS 프로젝트 설정이 필요합니다","특정 명명 규칙과 패턴을 따릅니다","ExceptionTypeEnum과 BaseExceptionDto의 이해가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración del proyecto NestJS","Sigue convenciones y patrones de nomenclatura específicos","Requiere comprensión de ExceptionTypeEnum y BaseExceptionDto"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet NestJS","Suit des conventions et modèles de nommage spécifiques","Nécessite une compréhension de ExceptionTypeEnum et BaseExceptionDto"],"de":["Benötigt NestJS-Projektsetup","Befolgt spezifische Namenskonventionen und Muster","Benötigt Verständnis von ExceptionTypeEnum und BaseExceptionDto"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto NestJS","Segue convenções e padrões de nomenclatura específicos","Exige compreensão de ExceptionTypeEnum e BaseExceptionDto"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта NestJS","Следует конкретным соглашениям и шаблонам об именах","Требует понимания ExceptionTypeEnum и BaseExceptionDto"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع NestJS","يتبع اتفاقيات وأنساق تسمية محددة","يحتاج إلى فهم ExceptionTypeEnum و BaseExceptionDto"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"54180e0d6ce602c2e8cd23d8234c2b1840abdad7342749c243eb79f30ffa4eee","qualityScore":36}');
