","支持实时协作"],"ja":["CLI アシスタントのリモート実行をサポート","オフィスアシスタンモードを提供","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","強力なコードエディターを搭載","リアルタイムコラボレーションをサポート"],"ko":["원격으로 CLI 어시스트를 실행","사무실 어시스턴트 모드를 제공","여러 프로그래밍 언어를 지원","강력한 코드 에디터를 탑재","실시간 협업을 지원"],"es":["Ejecución de asistentes de CLI como Claude Code y Codex","Creación de GIF en Slack","Conexión con tu proyecto","Codificación en línea","Compatible con navegadores"],"fr":["Exécution d''assistants CLI tels que Claude Code et Codex","Création de GIF sur Slack","Connexion à votre projet","Codage en ligne","Compatible avec les navigateurs"],"de":["Ausführung von CLI-Assistenten wie Claude Code und Codex","Erstellung von GIFs in Slack","Verbindung mit Ihrem Projekt","Online-Codierung","Kompatibel mit Browsern"],"pt":["Criação de GIFs no Slack","Suporte a assistentes de linha de comando de IA","Plataforma de codificação baseada em navegador","Integração com Claude Code e Codex","Modo de assistente de escritório para planejamento e pesquisa"],"ru":["Создание GIF в Slack","Поддержка ИИ Агентов","Браузерная платформа кодирования","Интеграция с Claude Code и Codex","Офисный режим для планирования и исследования"],"ar":["إنشاء GIF في Slack","دعم أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","منصة ترميز معتمدة على المتصفح","التكامل مع Claude Code و Codex","وضع المساعد المكتبية للتخطيط والبحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 WebCode","什么是 AI 智能助手","WebCode 替代品","WebCode 与竞争对手比较","WebCode 安装","WebCode 设置指南","AI 智能助手工具","浏览器代码平台"],"ja":["WebCode の使い方","AIエージェントとは","WebCode の代替","WebCode と競合製品の比較","WebCode のインストール","WebCode のセットアップガイド","AI エージェントツール","ブラウザコードプラットフォーム"],"ko":["WebCode 사용법","AI 에이전트란","WebCode 대안","WebCode 와 경쟁사 비교","WebCode 설치","WebCode 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 도구","브라우저 코드 플랫폼"],"es":["herramientas de AI","creador de GIF de Slack","WebCode","codificación en línea","asistentes de CLI","Cómo usar WebCode","Alternativas a WebCode","Instalación de WebCode"],"fr":["outils d''IA","créateur de GIF Slack","WebCode","codage en ligne","assistants CLI","Comment utiliser WebCode","Alternatives à WebCode","Installation de WebCode"],"de":["KI-Tools","Slack-GIF-Ersteller","WebCode","Online-Codierung","CLI-Assistenten","Wie man WebCode verwendet","Alternativen zu WebCode","Installation von WebCode"],"pt":["como criar GIF no Slack","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","plataformas de codificação baseadas em navegador","alternativas ao Claude Code","Guia de instalação do WebCode","configuração do Codex","o que é IA","como usar ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["как создать GIF в Slack","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","браузерные платформы кодирования","альтернативы Claude Code","Установка WebCode","настройка Codex","что такое ИИ","как использовать ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["كيفية إنشاء GIF في Slack","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","منصات الترميز المعتمدة على المتصفح","بديل ل Claude Code","دليل تثبيت WebCode","إعداد Codex","ما هو الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"shuyu-labs","repo":"WebCode","repoPath":"shuyu-labs/WebCode","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.041Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slack-gif-creator","description":"Knowledge and utilities for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack. Provides constraints, validation tools, and animation concepts. Use when users request animated GIFs for Slack like make me a GIF of X doing Y for Slack.","bodyPreview":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GI","body":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\n\n# 2. Generate frames\nfor i in range(12):\n    frame = Image.new(''RGB'', (128, 128), (240, 248, 255))\n    draw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n    # Draw your animation using PIL primitives\n    # (circles, polygons, lines, etc.)\n\n    builder.add_frame(frame)\n\n# 3. Save with optimization\nbuilder.save(''output.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True)\n```\n\n## Drawing Graphics\n\n### Working with User-Uploaded Images\nIf a user uploads an image, consider whether they want to:\n- **Use it directly** (e.g., \"animate this\", \"split this into frames\")\n- **Use it as inspiration** (e.g., \"make something like this\")\n\nLoad and work with images using PIL:\n```python\nfrom PIL import Image\n\nuploaded = Image.open(''file.png'')\n# Use directly, or just as reference for colors/style\n```\n\n### Drawing from Scratch\nWhen drawing graphics from scratch, use PIL ImageDraw primitives:\n\n```python\nfrom PIL import ImageDraw\n\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n# Circles/ovals\ndraw.ellipse([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Stars, triangles, any polygon\npoints = [(x1, y1), (x2, y2), (x3, y3), ...]\ndraw.polygon(points, fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Lines\ndraw.line([(x1, y1), (x2, y2)], fill=(r, g, b), width=5)\n\n# Rectangles\ndraw.rectangle([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n```\n\n**Don''t use:** Emoji fonts (unreliable across platforms) or assume pre-packaged graphics exist in this skill.\n\n### Making Graphics Look Good\n\nGraphics should look polished and creative, not basic. Here''s how:\n\n**Use thicker lines** - Always set `width=2` or higher for outlines and lines. Thin lines (width=1) look choppy and amateurish.\n\n**Add visual depth**:\n- Use gradients for backgrounds (`create_gradient_background`)\n- Layer multiple shapes for complexity (e.g., a star with a smaller star inside)\n\n**Make shapes more interesting**:\n- Don''t just draw a plain circle - add highlights, rings, or patterns\n- Stars can have glows (draw larger, semi-transparent versions behind)\n- Combine multiple shapes (stars + sparkles, circles + rings)\n\n**Pay attention to colors**:\n- Use vibrant, complementary colors\n- Add contrast (dark outlines on light shapes, light outlines on dark shapes)\n- Consider the overall composition\n\n**For complex shapes** (hearts, snowflakes, etc.):\n- Use combinations of polygons and ellipses\n- Calculate points carefully for symmetry\n- Add details (a heart can have a highlight curve, snowflakes have intricate branches)\n\nBe creative and detailed! A good Slack GIF should look polished, not like placeholder graphics.\n\n## Available Utilities\n\n### GIFBuilder (`core.gif_builder`)\nAssembles frames and optimizes for Slack:\n```python\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\nbuilder.add_frame(frame)  # Add PIL Image\nbuilder.add_frames(frames)  # Add list of frames\nbuilder.save(''out.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True, remove_duplicates=True)\n```\n\n### Validators (`core.validators`)\nCheck if GIF meets Slack requirements:\n```python\nfrom core.validators import validate_gif, is_slack_ready\n\n# Detailed validation\npasses, info = validate_gif(''my.gif'', is_emoji=True, verbose=True)\n\n# Quick check\nif is_slack_ready(''my.gif''):\n    print(\"Ready!\")\n```\n\n### Easing Functions (`core.easing`)\nSmooth motion instead of linear:\n```python\nfrom core.easing import interpolate\n\n# Progress from 0.0 to 1.0\nt = i / (num_frames - 1)\n\n# Apply easing\ny = interpolate(start=0, end=400, t=t, easing=''ease_out'')\n\n# Available: linear, ease_in, ease_out, ease_in_out,\n#           bounce_out, elastic_out, back_out\n```\n\n### Frame Helpers (`core.frame_composer`)\nConvenience functions for common needs:\n```python\nfrom core.frame_composer import (\n    create_blank_frame,         # Solid color background\n    create_gradient_background,  # Vertical gradient\n    draw_circle,                # Helper for circles\n    draw_text,                  # Simple text rendering\n    draw_star                   # 5-pointed star\n)\n```\n\n## Animation Concepts\n\n### Shake/Vibrate\nOffset object position with oscillation:\n- Use `math.sin()` or `math.cos()` with frame index\n- Add small random variations for natural feel\n- Apply to x and/or y position\n\n### Pulse/Heartbeat\nScale object size rhythmically:\n- Use `math.sin(t * frequency * 2 * math.pi)` for smooth pulse\n- For heartbeat: two quick pulses then pause (adjust sine wave)\n- Scale between 0.8 and 1.2 of base size\n\n### Bounce\nObject falls and bounces:\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''bounce_out''` for landing\n- Use `easing=''ease_in''` for falling (accelerating)\n- Apply gravity by increasing y velocity each frame\n\n### Spin/Rotate\nRotate object around center:\n- PIL: `image.rotate(angle, resample=Image.BICUBIC)`\n- For wobble: use sine wave for angle instead of linear\n\n### Fade In/Out\nGradually appear or disappear:\n- Create RGBA image, adjust alpha channel\n- Or use `Image.blend(image1, image2, alpha)`\n- Fade in: alpha from 0 to 1\n- Fade out: alpha from 1 to 0\n\n### Slide\nMove object from off-screen to position:\n- Start position: outside frame bounds\n- End position: target location\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''ease_out''` for smooth stop\n- For overshoot: use `easing=''back_out''`\n\n### Zoom\nScale and position for zoom effect:\n- Zoom in: scale from 0.1 to 2.0, crop center\n- Zoom out: scale from 2.0 to 1.0\n- Can add motion blur for drama (PIL filter)\n\n### Explode/Particle Burst\nCreate particles radiating outward:\n- Generate particles with random angles and velocities\n- Update each particle: `x += vx`, `y += vy`\n- Add gravity: `vy += gravity_constant`\n- Fade out particles over time (reduce alpha)\n\n## Optimization Strategies\n\nOnly when asked to make the file size smaller, implement a few of the following methods:\n\n1. **Fewer frames** - Lower FPS (10 instead of 20) or shorter duration\n2. **Fewer colors** - `num_colors=48` instead of 128\n3. **Smaller dimensions** - 128x128 instead of 480x480\n4. **Remove duplicates** - `remove_duplicates=True` in save()\n5. **Emoji mode** - `optimize_for_emoji=True` auto-optimizes\n\n```python\n# Maximum optimization for emoji\nbuilder.save(\n    ''emoji.gif'',\n    num_colors=48,\n    optimize_for_emoji=True,\n    remove_duplicates=True\n)\n```\n\n## Philosophy\n\nThis skill provides:\n- **Knowledge**: Slack''s requirements and animation concepts\n- **Utilities**: GIFBuilder, validators, easing functions\n- **Flexibility**: Create the animation logic using PIL primitives\n\nIt does NOT provide:\n- Rigid animation templates or pre-made functions\n- Emoji font rendering (unreliable across platforms)\n- A library of pre-packaged graphics built into the skill\n\n**Note on user uploads**: This skill doesn''t include pre-built graphics, but if a user uploads an image, use PIL to load and work with it - interpret based on their request whether they want it used directly or just as inspiration.\n\nBe creative! Combine concepts (bouncing + rotating, pulsing + sliding, etc.) and use PIL''s full capabilities.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```bash\npip install pillow imageio numpy\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:23:13.430Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents needing advanced GIF creation capabilities for Slack optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要高级GIF创建功能来优化Slack的视觉内容代理。","ja":"Slackの最適化に必要な高度なGIF作成機能を必要とするビジュアルコンテンツエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Slack 최적화를 위한 고급 GIF 생성 기능이 필요한 시각적 콘텐츠 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Contenido Visual que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación de GIF para la optimización de Slack.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contenu visuel ayant besoin de capacités avancées de création de GIF pour l''optimisation de Slack.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle Inhaltsagenten, die erweiterte GIF-Erstellungsfunktionen für die Optimierung von Slack benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conteúdo Visual que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de criação de GIF para otimização do Slack.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Визуальных Контент Агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности создания GIF для оптимизации Slack.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء المحتوى المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء GIFs لتحسين Slack."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate optimized animated GIFs using Python libraries like PIL, with customizable parameters such as FPS, colors, and duration, all while adhering to Slack''s specific dimensions and requirements.","zh":"通过使用Python库如PIL，赋予代理生成优化的动画GIF的能力，具有可自定义的参数，如FPS、颜色和持续时间，同时遵守Slack的特定尺寸和要求。","ja":"Pythonライブラリ（例：PIL）を使用して、FPS、色、時間制限などのカスタマイズ可能なパラメータを使用して最適化されたアニメーションGIFを生成するエージェントの能力を提供し、Slackの特定のサイズと要件に準拠します。","ko":"Python 라이브러리(PIL 등)를 사용하여 FPS, 색상, 시간 제한 등을 사용자 정의 가능한 매개 변수로 최적화된 애니메이션 GIF를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, Slack의 특정 크기 및 요구 사항을 준수합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar GIFs animados optimizados utilizando bibliotecas de Python como PIL, con parámetros personalizables como FPS, colores y duración, todo mientras se ajusta a las dimensiones y requisitos específicos de Slack.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des GIFs animés optimisés en utilisant des bibliothèques Python comme PIL, avec des paramètres personnalisables tels que FPS, couleurs et durée, tout en respectant les dimensions et les exigences spécifiques de Slack.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, optimierte animierte GIFs mithilfe von Python-Bibliotheken wie PIL zu generieren, mit anpassbaren Parametern wie FPS, Farben und Dauer, und dabei die spezifischen Dimensionen und Anforderungen von Slack einzuhalten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem GIFs animados otimizados usando bibliotecas Python como PIL, com parâmetros personalizáveis como FPS, cores e duração, tudo isso seguindo as dimensões e requisitos específicos do Slack.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать оптимизированные анимированные GIF с использованием библиотек Python, таких как PIL, с настраиваемыми параметрами, такими как FPS, цвета и продолжительность, все это при соблюдении конкретных размеров и требований Slack.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من生成 GIFs متحركة محسنة باستخدام مكتبات Python مثل PIL، مع معلمات قابلة للتعديل مثل FPS والألوان والمدة، وكل ذلك مع اتباع الأبعاد والمتطلبات المحددة لبرنامج Slack."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating emoji GIFs for Slack conversations","Creating message GIFs with customized dimensions and FPS","Optimizing GIF file size by adjusting colors and duration"],"zh":["为Slack对话生成emoji GIF","创建具有自定义尺寸和FPS的消息GIF","通过调整颜色和持续时间来优化GIF文件大小"],"ja":["Slack会話用のemoji GIFを生成する","カスタマイズ可能なサイズとFPSを持つメッセージGIFを作成する","色や時間制限を調整してGIFファイルサイズを最適化する"],"ko":["Slack 대화용 이모티콘 GIF 생성","사용자 정의 크기 및 FPS를 가진 메시지 GIF 생성","색상 및 시간 제한을 조정하여 GIF 파일 크기 최적화"],"es":["Generar GIFs de emoticonos para conversaciones de Slack","Crear GIFs de mensajes con dimensiones y FPS personalizadas","Optimizar el tamaño del archivo GIF ajustando los colores y la duración"],"fr":["Générer des GIFs d''émoticônes pour les conversations Slack","Créer des GIFs de messages avec des dimensions et des FPS personnalisés","Optimiser la taille du fichier GIF en ajustant les couleurs et la durée"],"de":["Erstellen von Emoticon-GIFs für Slack-Unterhaltungen","Erstellen von Nachrichten-GIFs mit benutzerdefinierten Dimensionen und FPS","Optimieren der GIF-Dateigröße durch Anpassen der Farben und Dauer"],"pt":["Gerar GIFs de emojis para conversas do Slack","Criar GIFs de mensagens com dimensões e FPS personalizadas","Otimizar o tamanho do arquivo GIF ajustando cores e duração"],"ru":["Генерировать GIF-эмоции для разговоров в Slack","Создавать GIF-сообщения с настраиваемыми размерами и FPS","Оптимизировать размер файла GIF, регулируя цвета и продолжительность"],"ar":["генерить GIFs الإيموجي لمحادثات Slack","إنشاء GIFs الرسائل مع أبعاد وFPS مخصصة","تحسين حجم ملف GIF عن طريق ضبط الألوان والمدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment with PIL library","GIF duration limited to under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs","Specific dimensions required for Slack compatibility (e.g., 128x128 for emoji GIFs)"],"zh":["需要Python环境和PIL库","emoji GIF的持续时间限制在3秒以下","需要特定的尺寸以兼容Slack（例如，emoji GIF为128x128）"],"ja":["Python環境とPILライブラリが必要","emoji GIFの時間制限は3秒以下","Slackと互換性のある特定のサイズが必要（例：emoji GIFは128x128）"],"ko":["Python 환경 및 PIL 라이브러리가 필요","이모티콘 GIF의 시간 제한은 3초 이하","Slack과 호환되는 특정 크기가 필요함(예: 이모티콘 GIF는 128x128)"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python con la biblioteca PIL","La duración del GIF está limitada a menos de 3 segundos para los GIFs de emoticonos","Se requieren dimensiones específicas para la compatibilidad con Slack (por ejemplo, 128x128 para los GIFs de emoticonos)"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python avec la bibliothèque PIL","La durée du GIF est limitée à moins de 3 secondes pour les GIFs d''émoticônes","Des dimensions spécifiques sont requises pour la compatibilité avec Slack (par exemple, 128x128 pour les GIFs d''émoticônes)"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung mit der Bibliothek PIL","Die Dauer des GIFs ist auf unter 3 Sekunden für Emoticon-GIFs begrenzt","Spezifische Dimensionen sind für die Slack-Kompatibilität erforderlich (z.B. 128x128 für Emoticon-GIFs)"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python com biblioteca PIL","Duração do GIF limitada a menos de 3 segundos para GIFs de emojis","Dimensões específicas necessárias para compatibilidade com o Slack (por exemplo, 128x128 para GIFs de emojis)"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python с библиотекой PIL","Продолжительность GIF ограничена менее 3 секунд для GIF-эмоций","Требуются конкретные размеры для совместимости с Slack (например, 128x128 для GIF-эмоций)"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python مع مكتبة PIL","مدة GIF مقيدة بأقل من 3 ثوان ل GIFs الإيموجي","مطلوب أبعاد محددة للتوافق مع Slack (على سبيل المثال 128x128 ل GIFs الإيموجي)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2efca615ce55a3edd8fc05c779068a8085816617991987e446606403cd3abb22","qualityScore":36}');
