:["自動コードチェック","コードエラーの修復","コード品質の改善","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","CI/CDフローへの統合"],"ko":["자동 코드 체크","코드 오류 수정","코드 품질 개선","여러 프로그래밍 언어 지원","CI/CD 흐름 통합"],"es":["Análisis de código automático","Detección de errores y warnings","Mejora de la calidad del código","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación"],"fr":["Analyse de code automatique","Détection d''erreurs et de warnings","Amélioration de la qualité du code","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Support pour plusieurs langages de programmation"],"de":["Automatisierte Code-Analyse","Fehler- und Warnungserkennung","Qualitätsverbesserung des Codes","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Linting automatizado para múltiplas linguagens (JavaScript, Python, TypeScript)","Integração contínua em pipelines de desenvolvimento","Configuração personalizável de regras de linting","Relatórios detalhados de qualidade de código","Suporte para projetos acadêmicos e profissionais","Desenvolvido em colaboração com engenheiros da Microsoft"],"ru":["Автоматический линтинг для нескольких языков (JavaScript, Python, TypeScript)","Интеграция в CI/CD пайплайны разработки","Настраиваемые правила линтинга","Детальные отчеты о качестве кода","Поддержка академических и профессиональных проектов","Разработано при сотрудничестве с инженерами Microsoft"],"ar":["التفتيش التلقائي للعديد من اللغات (JavaScript, Python, TypeScript)","التكامل مع خطوط أنابيب التطوير المستمر","قواعد تفتيش قابلة للتخصيص","تقارير مفصلة عن جودة الكود","دعم المشاريع الأكاديمية والمهنية","مطورة بالتعاون مع مهندسي Microsoft"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用run-linting","什么是代码质量检查","run-linting替代品","run-linting vs eslint","run-linting安装","run-linting设置指南","代码质量检查工具"],"ja":["run-lintingの使い方","コード品質チェックとは","run-lintingの代替","run-linting vs eslint","run-lintingのインストール","run-lintingの設定ガイド","コード品質チェックツール"],"ko":["run-linting 사용법","코드 품질 체크란","run-linting 대체품","run-linting vs eslint","run-linting 설치","run-linting 설정 가이드","코드 품질 체크 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","run-linting","análisis de código automático","mejora de la calidad del código","integración con herramientas de desarrollo","alternativas a run-linting","cómo utilizar run-linting","instalación de run-linting","guía de configuración de run-linting"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","run-linting","analyse de code automatique","amélioration de la qualité du code","intégration avec des outils de développement","alternatives à run-linting","comment utiliser run-linting","installation de run-linting","guide de configuration de run-linting"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","run-linting","automatisierte Code-Analyse","Qualitätsverbesserung des Codes","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Alternativen zu run-linting","wie man run-linting verwendet","Installation von run-linting","Konfigurationsanleitung für run-linting"],"pt":["ferramenta linting automático","como usar run-linting","linting código JavaScript","run-linting vs eslint","instalar run-linting","configuração linting automático","ferramenta qualidade código","linting Python automático","projeto final USF Microsoft","IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для автоматического линтинга","как использовать run-linting","линтинг JavaScript код","run-linting vs eslint","установка run-linting","настройка автоматического линтинга","инструмент качества кода","автоматический линтинг Python","выпускной проект USF Microsoft","ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["أداة تفتيش تلقائي للكود","كيفية استخدام run-linting","تفتيش كود JavaScript","run-linting مقابل eslint","تثبيت run-linting","إعداد التفتيش التلقائي","أداة جودة الكود","تفتيش Python تلقائي","مشروع تخرج USF Microsoft","ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"judacas","repo":"LLM-Automated-Inventory-Management","repoPath":"judacas/LLM-Automated-Inventory-Management","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.046Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"run-linting","description":"Runs linting and LSP diagnostics to list all errors and warnings in the workspace. Use when fixing linter errors, checking code quality, or when the linter-fixer subagent or user asks to see all lint/LSP issues.","bodyPreview":"# Run Linting and See All Errors\r\n\r\nUse this workflow to get a complete list of linter and LSP diagnostics before fixing them.\r\n\r\n**ReadLints** is a tool the agent has: it returns the current workspace’s LSP/linter diagnostics (what the editor shows — e.g. Ruff, Pyright). **Ruff CLI** (`uv run ruff check --fix`) is a separate run over the whole project. They often report the same issues when Ruff is the main linter, but aren’t identical: the IDE may be stale or include other sources; Ruff CLI is","body":"# Run Linting and See All Errors\r\n\r\nUse this workflow to get a complete list of linter and LSP diagnostics before fixing them.\r\n\r\n**ReadLints** is a tool the agent has: it returns the current workspace’s LSP/linter diagnostics (what the editor shows — e.g. Ruff, Pyright). **Ruff CLI** (`uv run ruff check --fix`) is a separate run over the whole project. They often report the same issues when Ruff is the main linter, but aren’t identical: the IDE may be stale or include other sources; Ruff CLI is the canonical full-project pass. Use both for full coverage.\r\n\r\n## 1. Run Ruff on the entire project (required)\r\n\r\nAlways run:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nuv run ruff check --fix\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis runs Ruff over the whole project. Capture the output and treat it as the authoritative list of Ruff issues.\r\n\r\n## 2. Read LSP/linter diagnostics (optional extra)\r\n\r\nUse the **ReadLints** tool to get IDE diagnostics — same or overlapping with Ruff in many setups, but can include other LSP sources (e.g. Pyright) or reflect unsaved state.\r\n\r\n- **Paths**: Pass the path(s) you care about, or omit for the whole workspace.\r\n- Interpret each diagnostic: file, line, severity, message, and optional source.\r\n\r\nCombine with the Ruff output: merge by file/line, dedupe when they refer to the same issue.\r\n\r\n## 3. Consolidate and prioritize\r\n\r\n- Treat **errors** as must-fix; **warnings** as should-fix when feasible.\r\n- Group by file so fixes can be applied in one pass per file.\r\n- Note any diagnostics that need broader context so they can be delegated instead of auto-fixed.\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\n1. **Always** run `uv run ruff check --fix` on the entire project.\r\n2. Optionally call **ReadLints** for IDE diagnostics and merge with Ruff output.\r\n3. List all issues by file and severity; flag any that need human or main-agent context.\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:24:16.314Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring advanced linting and diagnostic capabilities for Python projects.","zh":"适用于需要高级linting和诊断功能的Python项目Code Review代理。","ja":"Pythonプロジェクトで高度なlintingと診断機能を必要とするCode Reviewエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 linting 및 진단 기능이 필요한 Python 프로젝트의 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que requieren capacidades avanzadas de linting y diagnóstico para proyectos de Python.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant des fonctionnalités de linting et de diagnostic avancées pour les projets Python.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die erweiterte Linting- und Diagnosefunktionen für Python-Projekte erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem capacidades avançadas de linting e diagnóstico para projetos Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, требующих продвинутых возможностей linting и диагностики для проектов Python.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات المراجعة الإلكترونية التي تتطلب قدرات متقدمة لتصحيح الأخطاء و تشخيص المشاكل في مشاريع بايثون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run comprehensive linting using Ruff CLI and retrieve LSP diagnostics with ReadLints, ensuring code quality and identifying errors through uv run ruff check --fix and LSP/linter diagnostics.","zh":"赋予代理运行使用Ruff CLI进行全面linting和使用ReadLints检索LSP诊断的能力，确保代码质量并通过uv run ruff check --fix和LSP/代码检查器诊断识别错误。","ja":"Ruff CLIを使用した包括的なlintingとReadLintsを使用したLSP診断の取得をエージェントに実行させることで、コード品質を確保し、uv run ruff check --fixおよびLSP/リンター診断を使用してエラーを識別します。","ko":"Ruff CLI를 사용한 종합적인 linting 및 ReadLints를 사용한 LSP 진단을 가져오는 에이전트를 실행하여 코드 품질을 보장하고 uv run ruff check --fix 및 LSP/린터 진단을 통해 오류를 식별합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para ejecutar un linting integral utilizando Ruff CLI y recuperar diagnósticos LSP con ReadLints, garantizando la calidad del código e identificando errores a través de uv run ruff check --fix y diagnósticos LSP/linter.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter un linting complet en utilisant Ruff CLI et de récupérer des diagnostics LSP avec ReadLints, garantissant la qualité du code et identifiant les erreurs via uv run ruff check --fix et les diagnostics LSP/linter.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, ein umfassendes Linting mit Ruff CLI durchzuführen und LSP-Diagnosen mit ReadLints abzurufen, um die Codequalität zu gewährleisten und Fehler durch uv run ruff check --fix und LSP/Linter-Diagnosen zu identifizieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes executem uma linting abrangente usando Ruff CLI e recoverem diagnósticos LSP com ReadLints, garantindo a qualidade do código e identificando erros por meio de uv run ruff check --fix e diagnósticos LSP/linter.","ru":"Позволяет агентам запускать комплексную проверку кода с помощью Ruff CLI и получать диагностические данные LSP с помощью ReadLints, обеспечивая качество кода и выявляя ошибки с помощью uv run ruff check --fix и диагностических данных LSP/линтера.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تشغيل تصحيح الأخطاء الشامل باستخدام Ruff CLI و استرجاع تشخيصات LSP مع ReadLints، و ضمان جودة الكود و تحديد الأخطاء من خلال تشغيل uv run ruff check --fix و تشخيصات LSP/لينتر."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for Python projects with Ruff and Pyright","Debugging LSP diagnostics and linter errors in codebases","Validating code quality through comprehensive linting and diagnostics"],"zh":["使用Ruff和Pyright自动化Python项目的代码审查","调试代码库中的LSP诊断和代码检查器错误","通过全面linting和诊断验证代码质量"],"ja":["RuffとPyrightを使用してPythonプロジェクトのコードレビューを自動化する","コードベースのLSP診断とリンターのエラーをデバッグする","包括的なlintingと診断を使用してコード品質を検証する"],"ko":["Ruff와 Pyright를 사용하여 Python 프로젝트의 코드 리뷰를 자동화하는 것","코드베이스의 LSP 진단 및 린터 오류를 디버깅하는 것","종합적인 linting 및 진단을 사용하여 코드 품질을 검증하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar revisiones de código para proyectos de Python con Ruff y Pyright","Depurar diagnósticos LSP y errores de linter en codebases","Validar la calidad del código a través de un linting y diagnóstico integral"],"fr":["Automatiser les révisions de code pour les projets Python avec Ruff et Pyright","Déboguer les diagnostics LSP et les erreurs de linter dans les codebases","Valider la qualité du code via un linting et des diagnostics complets"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Python-Projekte mit Ruff und Pyright","Debuggen von LSP-Diagnosen und Linter-Fehlern in Codebases","Validieren der Codequalität durch umfassendes Linting und Diagnosen"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para projetos Python com Ruff e Pyright","Depurar diagnósticos LSP e erros de linter em repositórios de código","Validar a qualidade do código por meio de linting e diagnósticos abrangentes"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверки кода для проектов Python с помощью Ruff и Pyright","Отладка диагностических данных LSP и ошибок линтера в кодовых базах","Проверка качества кода с помощью комплексной проверки кода и диагностических данных"],"ar":["توسيع مراجعة الكود تلقائيا لمشاريع بايثون مع Ruff و Pyright","تصحيح أخطاء تشخيص LSP و أخطاء لينتر في قواعد الكود","التحقق من جودة الكود من خلال تصحيح الأخطاء الشامل و التشخيصات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Ruff CLI and ReadLints tool integration","Primarily designed for Python projects","May require IDE synchronization for accurate diagnostics"],"zh":["需要Ruff CLI和ReadLints工具集成","主要设计用于Python项目","可能需要IDE同步以获得准确的诊断"],"ja":["Ruff CLIとReadLintsツールの統合が必要","主にPythonプロジェクト用に設計されています","正確な診断を得るためにIDEの同期が必要になる場合があります"],"ko":["Ruff CLI 및 ReadLints 도구 통합이 필요","주로 Python 프로젝트를 위해 설계됨","정확한 진단을 얻기 위해 IDE 동기화가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la integración de la herramienta Ruff CLI y ReadLints","Diseñado principalmente para proyectos de Python","Puede requerir la sincronización del IDE para diagnósticos precisos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de l''outil Ruff CLI et ReadLints","Conçu principalement pour les projets Python","Peut nécessiter une synchronisation de l''IDE pour des diagnostics précis"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration von Ruff CLI und ReadLints","In erster Linie für Python-Projekte konzipiert","Kann eine IDE-Synchronisation für genaue Diagnosen erfordern"],"pt":["Exige integração com as ferramentas Ruff CLI e ReadLints","Projetado principalmente para projetos Python","Pode exigir sincronização do IDE para diagnósticos precisos"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с инструментами Ruff CLI и ReadLints","В основном предназначен для проектов Python","Может требовать синхронизации IDE для точной диагностики"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل أدوات Ruff CLI و ReadLints","صمم في المقام الأول لمشاريع بايثون","يمكن أن يتطلب مزامنة بيئة التطوير لمعلومات تشخيص دقيقة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5fa8ffd7fc4bc6c5550ea4e12ecc5ffa0b747066123992e711897ccdf096605a","qualityScore":36}');
