ion von FSD"],"pt":["ferramentas de FSD","criar cartões de batalha","jogos personalizados","arquitetura de design de cartões","desenvolver jogos com IA","guias de instalação do FSD","FSD vs outras ferramentas de design"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты FSD","создать карты битвы","персонализированные игры","архитектура для создания карт","разработка игр с помощью ИИ","руководство по установке FSD","FSD против других инструментов дизайна"],"ar":["أدوات الفس دي","إنشاء بطاقات معركة","ألعاب مخصصة","هندسة تصميم البطاقات","تطوير الألعاب باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل تثبيت الفس دي","الفس دي مقابل أدوات تصميم أخرى"]}},"owner":"Nico7522","repo":"card-concept-maker","repoPath":"Nico7522/card-concept-maker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.047Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"FSD architecture","description":"This skill is used to structure the project correctly by following the principles of Feature Sliced Design Architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to create or move any file or folder. Use it to know where to place it.\n\n## When use it\n\n- When creating or moving any new file or folder\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Documentation\n\n- https://fsd.how/docs/reference/layers\n- https://fsd.how/docs/reference/slices-segments\n- https://fsd.how/docs/reference/public-api\n\n### Exemple\n\n- https://fsd.how/docs/get-started/tutorial","body":"# Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to create or move any file or folder. Use it to know where to place it.\n\n## When use it\n\n- When creating or moving any new file or folder\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Documentation\n\n- https://fsd.how/docs/reference/layers\n- https://fsd.how/docs/reference/slices-segments\n- https://fsd.how/docs/reference/public-api\n\n### Exemple\n\n- https://fsd.how/docs/get-started/tutorial\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:24:18.918Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing structured file system organization and navigation, such as Cursor or AutoGPT, utilizing FSD architecture for efficient data management.","zh":"适合需要结构化文件系统组织和导航的AI代理，例如Cursor或AutoGPT，利用FSD架构进行高效的数据管理。","ja":"構造化されたファイルシステムの組織化とナビゲーションが必要なAIエージェント、たとえばCursorまたはAutoGPTに適しています。FSDアーキテクチャを使用して効率的なデータ管理を実現します。","ko":"구조화된 파일 시스템의 조직 및 탐색이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어, Cursor 또는 AutoGPT와 같은 에이전트는 FSD 아키텍처를 사용하여 효율적인 데이터 관리를 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una organización y navegación de sistema de archivos estructurada, como Cursor o AutoGPT, que utilizan la arquitectura FSD para una gestión de datos eficiente.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une organisation et d''une navigation de système de fichiers structurées, comme Cursor ou AutoGPT, utilisant l''architecture FSD pour une gestion de données efficace.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine strukturierte Dateisystemorganisation und -navigation benötigen, wie z.B. Cursor oder AutoGPT, die die FSD-Architektur für eine effiziente Datenverwaltung nutzen.","pt":"Perfect for AI Agents needing structured file system organization and navigation, such as Cursor or AutoGPT, utilizing FSD architecture for efficient data management.","ru":"Perfect for AI Agents needing structured file system organization and navigation, such as Cursor or AutoGPT, utilizing FSD architecture for efficient data management.","ar":"Perfect for AI Agents needing structured file system organization and navigation, such as Cursor or AutoGPT, utilizing FSD architecture for efficient data management."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage files and folders effectively, utilizing layers and slices-segments for organized data storage, and leveraging the public API for seamless integration with their existing workflows, including support for documentation through https://fsd.how/docs/reference/layers and https://fsd.how/docs/reference/slices-segments.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理文件及文件夹的能力，利用层和切片段实现有组织的数据存储，并利用公共API实现与现有工作流的无缝集成，包括通过https://fsd.how/docs/reference/layers和https://fsd.how/docs/reference/slices-segments提供的文档支持。","ja":"エージェントがファイルとフォルダを効果的に作成して管理できるようにし、データの保存を整理された状態に保つためにレイヤーとスライスセグメントを利用し、パブリックAPIを利用して既存のワークフローとのシームレスな統合を実現し、https://fsd.how/docs/reference/layersおよびhttps://fsd.how/docs/reference/slices-segmentsでのドキュメントをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 파일 및 폴더를 효율적으로 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 데이터 저장을 유연하게 관리하기 위해 레이어와 슬라이스 세그먼트를 활용하고, 공개 API를 통해 기존 워크플로와의 무결점 통합을 가능하게 하며, https://fsd.how/docs/reference/layers 및 https://fsd.how/docs/reference/slices-segments의 문서를 통해 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar archivos y carpetas de forma efectiva, utilizando capas y segmentos de rebanadas para un almacenamiento de datos organizado, y aprovechando la API pública para una integración sin problemas con sus flujos de trabajo existentes, incluyendo el soporte para la documentación a través de https://fsd.how/docs/reference/layers y https://fsd.how/docs/reference/slices-segments.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des fichiers et des dossiers de manière efficace, en utilisant des couches et des segments de tranches pour un stockage de données organisé, et en exploitant l''API publique pour une intégration transparente avec leurs flux de travail existants, y compris le support pour la documentation via https://fsd.how/docs/reference/layers et https://fsd.how/docs/reference/slices-segments.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Dateien und Ordner effektiv zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem sie Schichten und Segment-Scheiben für ein organisiertes Daten-Speichern nutzen und die öffentliche API für eine nahtlose Integration mit ihren bestehenden Workflows nutzen, einschließlich Unterstützung für die Dokumentation über https://fsd.how/docs/reference/layers und https://fsd.how/docs/reference/slices-segments.","pt":"Empowers agents to create and manage files and folders effectively, utilizing layers and slices-segments for organized data storage, and leveraging the public API for seamless integration with their existing workflows, including support for documentation through https://fsd.how/docs/reference/layers and https://fsd.how/docs/reference/slices-segments.","ru":"Empowers agents to create and manage files and folders effectively, utilizing layers and slices-segments for organized data storage, and leveraging the public API for seamless integration with their existing workflows, including support for documentation through https://fsd.how/docs/reference/layers and https://fsd.how/docs/reference/slices-segments.","ar":"Empowers agents to create and manage files and folders effectively, utilizing layers and slices-segments for organized data storage, and leveraging the public API for seamless integration with their existing workflows, including support for documentation through https://fsd.how/docs/reference/layers and https://fsd.how/docs/reference/slices-segments."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new project directories with optimized folder structures","Moving files between layers for better data organization","Utilizing the public API for automated file system management"],"zh":["创建具有优化的文件夹结构的新项目目录","在层之间移动文件以实现更好的数据组织","利用公共API进行自动化的文件系统管理"],"ja":["最適化されたフォルダ構造を持つ新しいプロジェクトディレクトリを作成する","データの組織化を改善するためにレイヤー間でファイルを移動する","パブリックAPIを利用して自動化されたファイルシステム管理を実行する"],"ko":["최적화된 폴더 구조를 갖는 새로운 프로젝트 디렉토리를 생성하는 것","데이터를更 잘 조직하기 위해 레이어 간에 파일을 이동하는 것","공개 API를 활용하여 자동화된 파일 시스템 관리를 수행하는 것"],"es":["Crear nuevos directorios de proyectos con estructuras de carpetas optimizadas","Mover archivos entre capas para una mejor organización de datos","Utilizar la API pública para la gestión automática del sistema de archivos"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux répertoires de projets avec des structures de dossiers optimisées","Déplacer des fichiers entre couches pour une meilleure organisation des données","Utiliser l''API publique pour la gestion automatisée du système de fichiers"],"de":["Erstellen von neuen Projektverzeichnissen mit optimierten Ordnerstrukturen","Verschieben von Dateien zwischen Schichten für eine bessere Datenorganisation","Nutzen der öffentlichen API für die automatisierte Dateisystemverwaltung"],"pt":["Creating new project directories with optimized folder structures","Moving files between layers for better data organization","Utilizing the public API for automated file system management"],"ru":["Creating new project directories with optimized folder structures","Moving files between layers for better data organization","Utilizing the public API for automated file system management"],"ar":["Creating new project directories with optimized folder structures","Moving files between layers for better data organization","Utilizing the public API for automated file system management"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to file system","Dependent on FSD documentation for implementation details","Compatibility may vary with different agent frameworks like LangChain or Claude Code"],"zh":["需要访问文件系统","依赖于FSD文档以获取实现细节","与不同的代理框架（如LangChain或Claude Code）兼容性可能会有所不同"],"ja":["ファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","実装の詳細についてはFSDドキュメントに依存する","LangChainまたはClaude Codeのような異なるエージェントフレームワークとの互換性は異なる場合がある"],"ko":["파일 시스템에 접근할 수 있어야 함","구현 세부 정보를 얻기 위해 FSD 문서에 의존함","LangChain 또는 Claude Code와 같은 다른 에이전트 프레임워크와의 호환성은 다를 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos","Depende de la documentación de FSD para los detalles de implementación","La compatibilidad puede variar con diferentes marcos de agentes como LangChain o Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers","Dépend de la documentation FSD pour les détails d''implémentation","La compatibilité peut varier avec différents cadres d''agents comme LangChain ou Claude Code"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem","Hängt von der FSD-Dokumentation für Implementierungsdetails ab","Die Kompatibilität kann mit unterschiedlichen Agent-Frameworks wie LangChain oder Claude Code variieren"],"pt":["Requires access to file system","Dependent on FSD documentation for implementation details","Compatibility may vary with different agent frameworks like LangChain or Claude Code"],"ru":["Requires access to file system","Dependent on FSD documentation for implementation details","Compatibility may vary with different agent frameworks like LangChain or Claude Code"],"ar":["Requires access to file system","Dependent on FSD documentation for implementation details","Compatibility may vary with different agent frameworks like LangChain or Claude Code"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bd7eceaf8b842453101886582b574ca7fedbda41de51e8e3805e391f42e38639","qualityScore":36}');
