ия PR","ar":"أداة إنشاء بريد إلكتروني مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"pr-creator"},"description":{"zh":"pr-creator是一个开源的AI智能工具，直接将Gemini集成到您的终端，提供更高效的开发体验","ja":"pr-creatorはオープンソースのAIエージェントで、Geminiをターミナルに直接導入し、開発者に更なる効率的な開発体験を提供する","ko":"pr-creator는 오픈소스의 AI 에이전트로서 Gemini를 터미널에 직접 통합하여 개발자에게 더욱 효율적인 개발 경험을 제공한다","es":"Pr-creator es un agente AI de código abierto que trae la potencia de Gemini directamente a tu terminal, mejorando tu flujo de trabajo","fr":"Pr-creator est un agent IA open-source qui apporte la puissance de Gemini directement dans votre terminal, améliorant votre flux de travail","de":"Pr-creator ist ein Open-Source-AI-Agent, der die Leistung von Gemini direkt in Ihr Terminal bringt, Ihren Arbeitsablauf verbessert","pt":"O pr-creator é um agente de IA de código aberto que integra o Gemini no seu terminal, permitindo uma experiência de desenvolvimento mais eficiente","ru":"ИИ Агент pr-creator - это открытый агент, который интегрирует Gemini в ваш терминал, обеспечивая более эффективный опыт разработки","ar":"أداة pr-creator هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي مفتوحة المصدر تعمل على دمج Gemini في جهازك، مما يتيح لك تجربة تطوير أكثر كفاءة","en":"An open-source AI agent that brings the power of Gemini directly into your terminal."},"definition":{"en":"An open-source AI agent that brings the power of Gemini directly into your terminal."},"features":{"zh":["直接将Gemini集成到终端","提供更高效的开发体验","支持多种开发语言","开源和可定制","提高代码质量和开发效率"],"ja":["Geminiをターミナルに直接導入","開発効率を向上させる","複数の開発言語をサポート","オープンソースでカスタマイズ可能","コード品質と開発効率を向上させる"],"ko":["Gemini를 터미널에 직접 통합","개발 효율성을 높여라","여러 개발 언어를 지원","오픈소스이며 사용자 정의 가능","코드 품질과 개발 효율성을 향상"],"es":["Integración de Gemini en el terminal","Automatización de tareas con inteligencia artificial","Código abierto para personalización","Mejora de la productividad en el flujo de trabajo","Soporte para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Intégration de Gemini dans le terminal","Automatisation de tâches avec l''intelligence artificielle","Code open-source pour personnalisation","Amélioration de la productivité dans le flux de travail","Support pour les développeurs"],"de":["Integration von Gemini in das Terminal","Automatisierung von Aufgaben mit künstlicher Intelligenz","Open-Source-Code für Anpassung","Verbesserung der Produktivität im Arbeitsablauf","Unterstützung für Entwickler"],"pt":["Integração com o Gemini","Desenvolvimento mais eficiente","Código aberto","Fácil de usar","Personalizável"],"ru":["Интеграция с Gemini","Более эффективное развитие","Открытый код","Легко использовать","Настраиваемый"],"ar":["دمج مع Gemini","تطوير أكثر كفاءة","مفتوح المصدر","سهل الاستخدام","قابل للتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用pr-creator","什么是AI智能工具","pr-creator替代品","pr-creator vs 其他AI工具","pr-creator安装","pr-creator设置指南","AI智能工具开发","终端集成开发"],"ja":["pr-creatorの使い方","AIエージェントとは","pr-creatorの代替","pr-creator vs 他のAIエージェント","pr-creatorのインストール","pr-creatorの設定ガイド","AIエージェント開発","ターミナル集成開発"],"ko":["pr-creator 사용법","AI 에이전트란","pr-creator 대체품","pr-creator vs 다른 AI 에이전트","pr-creator 설치","pr-creator 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 개발","터미널 통합 개발"],"es":["cómo usar pr-creator","qué es un agente AI","pr-creator alternativa","pr-creator vs Gemini","instalación de pr-creator","guía de configuración de pr-creator","herramientas de desarrollo de AI","automatización de tareas con AI"],"fr":["comment utiliser pr-creator","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","alternative à pr-creator","pr-creator vs Gemini","installation de pr-creator","guide de configuration de pr-creator","outils de développement d''IA","automatisation de tâches avec IA"],"de":["wie man pr-creator verwendet","was ist ein AI-Agent","Alternative zu pr-creator","pr-creator vs Gemini","Installation von pr-creator","Einrichtungsanleitung für pr-creator","Entwicklungstools für künstliche Intelligenz","Automatisierung von Aufgaben mit künstlicher Intelligenz"],"pt":["como usar pr-creator","o que é agente de ia","pr-creator alternativa","pr-creator vs gemini","instalar pr-creator","guia de configuração do pr-creator"],"ru":["как использовать pr-creator","что такое ИИ Агент","альтернатива pr-creator","pr-creator vs gemini","установить pr-creator","руководство по настройке pr-creator"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام pr-creator","ما هي أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل pr-creator","pr-creator مقابل gemini","تثبيت pr-creator","دليل إعداد pr-creator"]}},"owner":"google-gemini","repo":"gemini-cli","repoPath":"google-gemini/gemini-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.084Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-creator","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Pull Request Creator\n\nThis skill guides the creation of high-quality Pull Requests that adhere to the\nrepository''s standards.\n\n## Workflow\n\nFollow these steps to create a Pull Request:\n\n1.  **Branch Management**: **CRITICAL:** Ensure you are NOT working on the\n    `main` branch.\n    - Run `git branch --show-current`.\n    - If the current branch is `main`, you MUST create and switch to a new\n      descriptive branch:\n      ```bash\n      git checkout -b <new-branch-name>\n      ```\n\n2.  **Commit","body":"# Pull Request Creator\n\nThis skill guides the creation of high-quality Pull Requests that adhere to the\nrepository''s standards.\n\n## Workflow\n\nFollow these steps to create a Pull Request:\n\n1.  **Branch Management**: **CRITICAL:** Ensure you are NOT working on the\n    `main` branch.\n    - Run `git branch --show-current`.\n    - If the current branch is `main`, you MUST create and switch to a new\n      descriptive branch:\n      ```bash\n      git checkout -b <new-branch-name>\n      ```\n\n2.  **Commit Changes**: Verify that all intended changes are committed.\n    - Run `git status` to check for unstaged or uncommitted changes.\n    - If there are uncommitted changes, stage and commit them with a descriptive\n      message before proceeding. NEVER commit directly to `main`.\n      ```bash\n      git add .\n      git commit -m \"type(scope): description\"\n      ```\n\n3.  **Locate Template**: Search for a pull request template in the repository.\n    - Check `.github/pull_request_template.md`\n    - Check `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md`\n    - If multiple templates exist (e.g., in `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE/`),\n      ask the user which one to use or select the most appropriate one based on\n      the context (e.g., `bug_fix.md` vs `feature.md`).\n\n4.  **Read Template**: Read the content of the identified template file.\n\n5.  **Draft Description**: Create a PR description that strictly follows the\n    template''s structure.\n    - **Headings**: Keep all headings from the template.\n    - **Checklists**: Review each item. Mark with `[x]` if completed. If an item\n      is not applicable, leave it unchecked or mark as `[ ]` (depending on the\n      template''s instructions) or remove it if the template allows flexibility\n      (but prefer keeping it unchecked for transparency).\n    - **Content**: Fill in the sections with clear, concise summaries of your\n      changes.\n    - **Related Issues**: Link any issues fixed or related to this PR (e.g.,\n      \"Fixes #123\").\n\n6.  **Preflight Check**: Before creating the PR, run the workspace preflight\n    script to ensure all build, lint, and test checks pass.\n    ```bash\n    npm run preflight\n    ```\n    If any checks fail, address the issues before proceeding to create the PR.\n\n7.  **Push Branch**: Push the current branch to the remote repository.\n    **CRITICAL SAFETY RAIL:** Double-check your branch name before pushing.\n    NEVER push if the current branch is `main`.\n    ```bash\n    # Verify current branch is NOT main\n    git branch --show-current\n    # Push non-interactively\n    git push -u origin HEAD\n    ```\n\n8.  **Create PR**: Use the `gh` CLI to create the PR. To avoid shell escaping\n    issues with multi-line Markdown, write the description to a temporary file\n    first.\n    ```bash\n    # 1. Write the drafted description to a temporary file\n    # 2. Create the PR using the --body-file flag\n    gh pr create --title \"type(scope): succinct description\" --body-file <temp_file_path>\n    # 3. Remove the temporary file\n    rm <temp_file_path>\n    ```\n    - **Title**: Ensure the title follows the\n      [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) format if the\n      repository uses it (e.g., `feat(ui): add new button`,\n      `fix(core): resolve crash`).\n\n## Principles\n\n- **Safety First**: NEVER push to `main`. This is your highest priority.\n- **Compliance**: Never ignore the PR template. It exists for a reason.\n- **Completeness**: Fill out all relevant sections.\n- **Accuracy**: Don''t check boxes for tasks you haven''t done.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:29:25.621Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined Pull Request creation and repository standards adherence.","zh":"非常适合需要简化Pull Request创建和存储库标准遵守的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがPull Requestの作成とリポジトリの標準の遵守を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"Pull Request 생성과 저장소 표준 준수를 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una creación de solicitudes de extracción simplificada y el cumplimiento de los estándares del repositorio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une création de demandes d''extraction simplifiée et du respect des normes du référentiel.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine vereinfachte Erstellung von Pull-Requests und die Einhaltung der Repository-Standards benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de criação de Pull Request simplificada e aderência a padrões de repositório.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым требуется упрощенное создание запросов на включение и соблюдение стандартов репозитория.","ar":" مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء طلبات السحب المُبسطة والامتثال لمعايير المستودع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality Pull Requests using Git branch management and commit protocols, ensuring repository standards are met through automated workflows and terminal integration.","zh":"通过Git分支管理和提交协议，赋予代理创建高质量Pull Request的能力，确保通过自动化工作流和终端集成满足存储库标准。","ja":"Gitブランチ管理とコミットプロトコルを使用して、エージェントが高品質のPull Requestを作成できるようにし、自動化されたワークフローとターミナル統合を通じてリポジトリの標準を満たします。","ko":"Git 브랜치 관리와 커밋 프로토콜을 사용하여 에이전트가 높은 품질의 Pull Request를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 자동화된 워크플로와 터미널 통합을 통해 저장소 표준을 충족합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear solicitudes de extracción de alta calidad utilizando la gestión de ramas Git y protocolos de confirmación, asegurando que los estándares del repositorio se cumplan a través de flujos de trabajo automatizados y la integración de terminal.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des demandes d''extraction de haute qualité en utilisant la gestion des branches Git et les protocoles de validation, en garantissant que les normes du référentiel soient respectées grâce à des flux de travail automatisés et à l''intégration du terminal.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertige Pull-Requests mit Git-Branch-Management und Commit-Protokollen zu erstellen, wodurch die Repository-Standards durch automatisierte Workflows und Terminal-Integration eingehalten werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar solicitações de Pull de alta qualidade usando gerenciamento de branch do Git e protocolos de commit, garantindo que os padrões do repositório sejam atendidos por meio de fluxos de trabalho automatizados e integração de terminal.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать запросы на включение высокого качества с помощью управления ветками Git и протоколов фиксации, гарантируя соблюдение стандартов репозитория посредством автоматизированных рабочих процессов и интеграции терминала.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إنشاء طلبات سحب عالية الجودة باستخدام إدارة الفروع من Git وبروتوكولات الالتزام، مما يضمن امتثال معايير المستودع من خلال سير العمل المُتحركة وتكامل المحطة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Pull Request creation for new features","Validating repository standards for incoming changes","Streamlining branch management for collaborative development"],"zh":["自动化新功能的Pull Request创建","验证传入的更改的存储库标准","简化协作开发的分支管理"],"ja":["新機能のPull Requestの自動化","リポジトリの標準を満たすためのインカミング変更の検証","共同開発のためのブランチ管理の簡素化"],"ko":["새로운 기능의 Pull Request 자동화","저장소 표준을满たする 인커밍 변경에 대한 검증","협업 개발을 위한 브랜치 관리의 간소화"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de solicitudes de extracción para nuevas características","Validación de los estándares del repositorio para los cambios entrantes","Optimización de la gestión de ramas para el desarrollo colaborativo"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de demandes d''extraction pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités","Validation des normes du référentiel pour les changements entrants","Optimisation de la gestion des branches pour le développement collaboratif"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Pull-Requests für neue Funktionen","Validierung der Repository-Standards für eingehende Änderungen","Optimierung der Branch-Verwaltung für die Zusammenarbeit bei der Entwicklung"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de Pull Request para novos recursos","Validar os padrões do repositório para alterações de entrada","Simplificar o gerenciamento de branch para desenvolvimento colaborativo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание запросов на включение для новых функций","Проверять стандарты репозитория для входящих изменений","Упрощать управление ветками для совместной разработки"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء طلبات السحب للسمات الجديدة","التحقق من معايير المستودع للتغييرات الواردة","تبسيط إدارة الفروع للتنمية التعاونية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Must not be working on the ''main'' branch"],"zh":["需要Git的安装和配置","不能在''main''分支上工作"],"ja":["Gitのインストールと設定が必要","''main''ブランチ上では作業できない"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요함","''main'' 브랜치에서 작업할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de Git","No debe estar trabajando en la rama ''main''"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Ne doit pas travailler sur la branche ''main''"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von Git","Darf nicht auf dem ''main''-Branch arbeiten"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Git","Não deve estar funcionando no branch ''main''"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки Git","Не должно работать в ветке ''main''"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتهيئة Git","لا يجب أن تعمل على الفرع ''main''"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"55b90da8be524f5f2f8e112e914de0d85b416576e221177835532bcf836e9af7","qualityScore":36}');
