io","Utilização de React e Node.js","CLI para facilitar o desenvolvimento","Suporte a múltiplos dispositivos móveis"],"ru":["Разработка мобильных игр в стиле бесконечного бега","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Оптимизация пользовательского опыта","Использование React и Node.js","CLI для упрощения разработки","Поддержка нескольких мобильных устройств"],"ar":["تطوير ألعاب الجوال من نوع الركض اللانهائي","دمج وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","استخدام React و Node.js","CLI لتسهيل التطوير","دعم عدة أجهزة محمولة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用plan-refactor开发移动游戏","plan-refactor安装指南","plan-refactor vs 其他游戏开发工具","plan-refactor游戏开发框架","AI智能工具plan-refactor","移动游戏开发解决方案","plan-refactor游戏开发教程"],"ja":["plan-refactorを使用してモバイルゲームを開発する方法","plan-refactorインストールガイド","plan-refactor vs その他のゲーム開発ツール","plan-refactorゲーム開発フレームワーク","AIエージェントplan-refactor","モバイルゲーム開発ソリューション","plan-refactorゲーム開発チュートリアル"],"ko":["plan-refactor를 사용하여 모바일 게임을 개발하는 방법","plan-refactor 설치 가이드","plan-refactor vs 다른 게임 개발 도구","plan-refactor 게임 개발 프레임워크","AI 에이전트 plan-refactor","모바일 게임 개발 솔루션","plan-refactor 게임 개발 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de AI para juegos","cómo usar plan-refactor","qué es el refactorizado de código","plan-refactor vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de plan-refactor","guía de configuración de plan-refactor"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les jeux","comment utiliser plan-refactor","qu''est-ce que le refactoring de code","plan-refactor vs autres outils d''IA","installation de plan-refactor","guide de configuration de plan-refactor"],"de":["AI-Tools für Spiele","wie man plan-refactor verwendet","was ist Code-Refactoring","plan-refactor vs andere AI-Tools","Installation von plan-refactor","Konfigurationsanleitung für plan-refactor"],"pt":["como usar Agentes de IA em jogos móveis","o que é plan-refactor","jogos móveis de corrida infinita","alternativas para plan-refactor","plan-refactor vs outros desenvolvedores de jogos","instalar plan-refactor","guia de configuração do plan-refactor","desenvolvimento de jogos móveis com React","otimização de jogos móveis com Node.js"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агентов в мобильных играх","что такое plan-refactor","мобильные игры в стиле бесконечного бега","альтернативы для plan-refactor","plan-refactor vs другие разработчики игр","установить plan-refactor","руководство по настройке plan-refactor","разработка мобильных игр с React","оптимизация мобильных игр с Node.js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي في ألعاب الجوال","ما هي plan-refactor","ألعاب الجوال من نوع الركض اللانهائي","بديلات ل plan-refactor","plan-refactor مقابل مطوري ألعاب آخرون","تثبيت plan-refactor","دليل إعداد plan-refactor","تطوير ألعاب الجوال مع React","تحسين ألعاب الجوال مع Node.js"]}},"owner":"adtak","repo":"super-red","repoPath":"adtak/super-red","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.122Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plan-refactor","description":"Analyze the codebase for refactoring opportunities, create a plan, and file GitHub issues for each proposal.","bodyPreview":"# Plan Refactor\n\nAnalyze the codebase for refactoring opportunities, present a plan to the user, and create GitHub issues for each approved proposal.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. **Analyze the codebase** — Explore the codebase to identify refactoring opportunities. Focus on:\n   - **Large files** — Files that mix multiple concerns and could benefit from extraction (hooks, utilities, constants)\n   - **Duplication** — Repeated styles, logic, or patterns across files\n   - **Inconsistency** — Style definitions, nam","body":"# Plan Refactor\n\nAnalyze the codebase for refactoring opportunities, present a plan to the user, and create GitHub issues for each approved proposal.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. **Analyze the codebase** — Explore the codebase to identify refactoring opportunities. Focus on:\n   - **Large files** — Files that mix multiple concerns and could benefit from extraction (hooks, utilities, constants)\n   - **Duplication** — Repeated styles, logic, or patterns across files\n   - **Inconsistency** — Style definitions, naming conventions, or patterns that differ from the rest of the codebase\n   - **Magic numbers** — Hardcoded values that should be named constants\n   - **Dead code** — Unused imports, variables, or exports\n\n   Use the project''s CLAUDE.md to understand conventions and architecture.\n\n2. **Clarify unknowns** — If the analysis reveals ambiguous areas or multiple valid approaches, ask the user before proceeding. Do not make assumptions on ambiguous points.\n\n3. **Draft the plan** — Write a refactoring plan listing each proposal. Use the template in [plan-template.md](plan-template.md) for each proposal. Keep proposals independent — each should be implementable on its own.\n\n4. **Present to the user** — Show the full plan and ask for approval. The user may:\n   - Approve all proposals\n   - Remove or modify specific proposals\n   - Ask for additional analysis\n\n   Do NOT proceed to issue creation until the user explicitly approves.\n\n5. **Create GitHub issues** — For each approved proposal, create a separate GitHub issue using `gh issue create --title \"<title>\" --body \"<plan>\"`. Use a HEREDOC for the body to preserve formatting. Title is Short, imperative, in English (e.g., \"Extract game loop logic into a custom hook\").\n\n6. **Report results** — After all issues are created, show the user a summary table with issue numbers, titles, and URLs.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- Write all issue content in English (project convention).\n- Converse with the user in Japanese (project convention).\n- Keep proposals minimal and focused — one concern per issue.\n- Do not propose changes that add complexity without clear benefit.\n- Reference actual file paths discovered during exploration, not guessed paths.\n- For each file change, specify whether it is Create, Modify, or Delete.\n- Do not include full code in the plan — describe what changes are needed and why.\n- Code snippets are acceptable when they clarify intent (e.g., type definitions, key structures).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:39:40.921Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing advanced refactoring capabilities for GitHub repositories.","zh":"非常适合需要为 GitHub 仓库提供高级重构功能的代码分析 Agent。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリに対する高度なリファクタリング機能を必要とするコード分析 Agent に最適です。","ko":"GitHub 저장소에 대한 고급 리팩토링 기능이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Código que necesitan capacidades de refactorización avanzadas para repositorios de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code ayant besoin de capacités de refactoring avancées pour les référentiels GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Refactoring-Funktionen für GitHub-Repositorys benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de capacidades de refatoração avançadas para repositórios GitHub.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Анализа Кодов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности рефакторинга для репозиториев GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى القدرات المتقدمة لإعادة الهيكلة لمستودعات GitHub."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze codebases for refactoring opportunities, create GitHub issues, and present plans to users, leveraging file analysis, duplication detection, and inconsistency resolution.","zh":"赋能 Agent 分析代码库以寻找重构机会、创建 GitHub issue 并向用户展示计划，其利用了文件分析、重复检测和不一致性解决功能。","ja":"ファイル分析、重複検出、および不整合解決を活用して、コードベースを分析してリファクタリングの機会を探し、GitHub issue を作成し、ユーザーに計画を提示するように Agent を強化します。","ko":"파일 분석, 중복 감지 및 불일치 해결 기능을 활용하여 코드베이스를 분석해 리팩토링 기회를 찾고, GitHub issue를 생성하며, 사용자에게 승인 및 구현을 위한 계획을 제시하도록 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar las bases de código para oportunidades de refactorización, crear problemas de GitHub y presentar planes a los usuarios, aprovechando el análisis de archivos, la detección de duplicados y la resolución de inconsistencias.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les bases de code pour les opportunités de refactoring, de créer des problèmes GitHub et de présenter des plans aux utilisateurs, en exploitant l''analyse de fichiers, la détection de doublons et la résolution d''incohérences.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Codebasen auf Refactoring-Möglichkeiten zu analysieren, GitHub-Probleme zu erstellen und Pläne den Benutzern vorzustellen, indem es Dateianalyse, Duplikat-Erkennung und Inkonsistenz-Auflösung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar repositórios de código para oportunidades de refatoração, criar problemas no GitHub e apresentar planos aos usuários, aproveitando a análise de arquivos, detecção de duplicação e resolução de inconsistências.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать кодовые базы на предмет возможностей рефакторинга, создавать проблемы в GitHub и представлять планы пользователям, используя анализ файлов, обнаружение дублирования и решение проблем несоответствий.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكيل من تحليل قواعد البيانات للبحث عن فرص لإعادة الهيكلة، وإنشاء مشاكل في GitHub وعرض خطط للمستخدمين، وذلك بالاستفادة من تحليل الملفات، وكشف التكرار وحلّ عدم الاتساق."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing codebases for large files and duplication","Generating GitHub issues for approved refactoring proposals","Presenting refactoring plans to users for approval and implementation"],"zh":["分析代码库中的大文件和重复代码","为已批准的重构提案生成 GitHub issue","向用户展示重构计划以获得批准并实施"],"ja":["コードベース内の大きなファイルと重複の分析","承認されたリファクタリング提案用の GitHub issue の生成","承認と実装のためにユーザーにリファクタリング計画を提示"],"ko":["대형 파일과 중복을 위한 코드베이스 분석","승인된 리팩토링 제안을 위한 GitHub issue 생성","승인 및 구현을 위해 사용자에게 리팩토링 계획 제시"],"es":["Análisis de bases de código para archivos grandes y duplicados","Generación de problemas de GitHub para propuestas de refactorización aprobadas","Presentación de planes de refactorización a los usuarios para su aprobación e implementación"],"fr":["Analyse de bases de code pour les fichiers volumineux et les doublons","Génération de problèmes GitHub pour les propositions de refactoring approuvées","Présentation de plans de refactoring aux utilisateurs pour approbation et mise en œuvre"],"de":["Analyse von Codebasen für große Dateien und Duplikate","Erstellung von GitHub-Problemen für genehmigte Refactoring-Vorschläge","Vorstellung von Refactoring-Plänen an Benutzer zur Genehmigung und Umsetzung"],"pt":["Analisar repositórios de código para arquivos grandes e duplicação","Gerar problemas no GitHub para propostas de refatoração aprovadas","Apresentar planos de refatoração aos usuários para aprovação e implementação"],"ru":["Анализ кодовых баз на предмет больших файлов и дублирования","Генерация проблем в GitHub для утвержденных предложений по рефакторингу","Представление планов рефакторинга пользователям для утверждения и реализации"],"ar":["تحليل قواعد البيانات للبحث عن الملفات الكبيرة والتكرار","إنشاء مشاكل في GitHub لخطط إعادة الهيكلة المعتمدة","عرض خطط إعادة الهيكلة على المستخدمين للموافقة والتنفيذ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub repository access","Limited to codebases with identifiable refactoring opportunities"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 仓库访问权限","仅限于具有可识别重构机会的代码库"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","識別可能なリファクタリングの機会があるコードベースに限定される"],"ko":["GitHub 저장소 접근 권한 필요","식별 가능한 리팩토링 기회가 있는 코드베이스로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de GitHub","Limitado a bases de código con oportunidades de refactorización identificables"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel GitHub","Limité aux bases de code avec des opportunités de refactoring identifiables"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das GitHub-Repository","Begrenzt auf Codebasen mit identifizierbaren Refactoring-Möglichkeiten"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório GitHub","Limitado a repositórios de código com oportunidades de refatoração identificáveis"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию GitHub","Ограничен кодовыми базами с идентифицируемыми возможностями рефакторинга"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع GitHub","محدود بقواعد البيانات التي تتيح فرصاً لإعادة الهيكلة التي يمكن تحديدها"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"351da3f5d9d2a80ff61753914605b07637295396900895591f97c02e9e20f1bb","qualityScore":36}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('aehrc/pathling/fhir-api', 'community', 'aehrc', 'pathling', 'aehrc/pathling', 'fhir-api', 0, 0, 36, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.135Z', '2026-03-02T03:42:48.516Z', '5ec4f887506c74dc0dad984343747526ed812bc07567c061037c408dbaef5dda', '{"id":"aehrc/pathling/fhir-api","name":"fhir-api","description":{"zh":"FHIR API智能工具基于Apache Spark，用于医疗数据分析和クリニカルテーミノロジー","ja":"FHIR API AIエージェントはApache Sparkに基づいており、クリニカルテーミノロジー分析を実行","ko":"FHIR API 인공지능 에이전트는 Apache Spark 기반으로 의료 데이터 분석과 クリニカルテーミノロジー 를 지원","es":"Herramientas FHIR API para análisis de datos con Apache Spark, facilitando el uso de FHIR y terminología clínica","fr":"Outils FHIR API pour l''analyse de données avec Apache Spark, facilitant l''utilisation de FHIR et de la terminologie clinique","de":"FHIR API Tools für Datenanalyse mit Apache Spark, erleichtern den Einsatz von FHIR und klinischer Terminologie","pt":"As ferramentas de IA para FHIR API facilitam o uso de FHIR e terminologia clínica na análise de dados, construídas em cima do Apache Spark","ru":"ИИ Агенты для FHIR API облегчают использование FHIR и клинической терминологии в анализе данных, построенные на Apache Spark","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ل FHIR API تسهل استخدام FHIR والترميز السريري في تحليل البيانات، مبنية على Apache Spark","en":"Tools that make it easier to use FHIR and clinical terminology within data analytics, built on Apache Spark."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"FHIR API智能工具 - 医疗数据分析","ja":"FHIR API AIエージェント - クリニカルテーミノロジー分析","ko":"FHIR API 인공지능 에이전트 - 의료 데이터 분석","es":"Herramientas FHIR API para análisis de datos","fr":"Outils FHIR API pour l''analyse de données","de":"FHIR API Tools für Datenanalyse","pt":"Ferramentas de Inteligência Artificial para FHIR API","ru":"ИИ Агенты для FHIR API","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ل FHIR API","en":"fhir-api"},"description":{"zh":"FHIR API智能工具基于Apache Spark，用于医疗数据分析和クリニカルテーミノロジー","ja":"FHIR API AIエージェントはApache Sparkに基づいており、クリニカルテーミノロジー分析を実行","ko":"FHIR API 인공지능 에이전트는 Apache Spark 기반으로 의료 데이터 분석과 クリニカルテーミノロジー 를 지원","es":"Herramientas FHIR API para análisis de datos con Apache Spark, facilitando el uso de FHIR y terminología clínica","fr":"Outils FHIR API pour l''analyse de données avec Apache Spark, facilitant l''utilisation de FHIR et de la terminologie clinique","de":"FHIR API Tools für Datenanalyse mit Apache Spark, erleichtern den Einsatz von FHIR und klinischer Terminologie","pt":"As ferramentas de IA para FHIR API facilitam o uso de FHIR e terminologia clínica na análise de dados, construídas em cima do Apache Spark","ru":"ИИ Агенты для FHIR API облегчают использование FHIR и клинической терминологии в анализе данных, построенные на Apache Spark","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ل FHIR API تسهل استخدام FHIR والترميز السريري في تحليل البيانات، مبنية على Apache Spark","en":"Tools that make it easier to use FHIR and clinical terminology within data analytics, built on Apache Spark."},"definition":{"en":"Tools that make it easier to use FHIR and clinical terminology within data analytics, built on Apache Spark."},"features":{"zh":["基于Apache Spark的医疗数据分析","支持クリニカルテーミノロジー分析","易于使用的FHIR API接口","高性能的数据处理能力","支持多种数据格式"],"ja":["Apache Sparkに基づくクリニカルテーミノロジー分析","FHIR APIの簡単な使用","高性能のデータ処理機能","複数のデータ形式のサポート","医療データ分析のサポート"],"ko":["Apache Spark 기반의 의료 데이터 분석","クリニカルテーミノロジー 분석 지원","쉽게 사용할 수 있는 FHIR API 인터페이스","고성능의 데이터 처리 능력","多种 데이터 형식 지원"],"es":["Integración con Apache Spark","Uso de FHIR y terminología clínica","Análisis de datos de salud","Herramientas para desarrolladores","Compatibilidad con estándares de salud"],"fr":["Intégration avec Apache Spark","Utilisation de FHIR et de la terminologie clinique","Analyse de données de santé","Outils pour développeurs","Compatibilité avec les normes de santé"],"de":["Integration mit Apache Spark","Einsatz von FHIR und klinischer Terminologie","Datenanalyse im Gesundheitswesen","Tools für Entwickler","Kompatibilität mit Gesundheitsstandards"],"pt":["Integração com Apache Spark","Suporte a FHIR e terminologia clínica","Análise de dados clínicos avançada","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos de saúde personalizados","Segurança e conformidade de dados"],"ru":["Интеграция с Apache Spark","Поддержка FHIR и клинической терминологии","Продвинутый анализ клинических данных","Разработка индивидуальных приложений для здравоохранения","Безопасность и соответствие данным"],"ar":["التكامل مع Apache Spark","دعم FHIR والترميز السريري","تحليل البيانات السريرية المتقدم","تطوير تطبيقات الرعاية الصحية المخصصة","أمان وامتثال البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["FHIR API智能工具","医疗数据分析","クリニカルテーミノロジー分析","Apache Spark","如何使用FHIR API","FHIR API安装","FHIR API设置指南"],"ja":["FHIR API AIエージェント","クリニカルテーミノロジー分析","医療データ分析","Apache Spark","FHIR APIの使い方","FHIR APIのインストール","FHIR APIの設定ガイド"],"ko":["FHIR API 인공지능 에이전트","의료 데이터 분석","クリニカルテーミノロジー 분석","Apache Spark","FHIR API 사용법","FHIR API 설치","FHIR API 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas FHIR API","análisis de datos de salud","cómo usar FHIR","qué es FHIR","alternativas a FHIR","FHIR vs HL7","instalación de FHIR API","guía de configuración de FHIR"],"fr":["outils FHIR API","analyse de données de santé","comment utiliser FHIR","qu''est-ce que FHIR","alternatives à FHIR","FHIR vs HL7","installation de FHIR API","guide de configuration de FHIR"],"de":["FHIR API Tools","Datenanalyse im Gesundheitswesen","wie man FHIR verwendet","was ist FHIR","Alternativen zu FHIR","FHIR vs HL7","Installation von FHIR API","Konfigurationsanleitung für FHIR"],"pt":["como usar FHIR API","o que é FHIR API","FHIR API alternativa","FHIR API vs outras ferramentas","instalar FHIR API","guia de configuração FHIR API","análise de dados clínicos com FHIR API","desenvolvimento de aplicativos de saúde com FHIR API"],"ru":["как использовать FHIR API","что такое FHIR API","ИИ Агенты для FHIR API","FHIR API альтернатива","FHIR API vs другие инструменты","установить FHIR API","руководство по настройке FHIR API","анализ клинических данных с FHIR API","разработка приложений для здравоохранения с FHIR API"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام FHIR API","ما هي FHIR API","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ل FHIR API","بديل FHIR API","FHIR API مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت FHIR API","دليل إعداد FHIR API","تحليل البيانات السريرية مع FHIR API","تطوير تطبيقات الرعاية الصحية مع FHIR API"]}},"owner":"aehrc","repo":"pathling","repoPath":"aehrc/pathling","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.135Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fhir-api","description":"Expert guidance for implementing FHIR RESTful API servers and clients following the HL7 FHIR specification. Use this skill when implementing a FHIR server with REST endpoints, building a FHIR client, designing FHIR API routes and handlers, implementing FHIR operations (read, create, update, delete, search, history), working with FHIR bundles, batch requests, or transactions, handling FHIR content negotiation, headers, and versioning, or implementing conditional operations. Trigger keywords include FHIR REST, FHIR API, FHIR server, FHIR client, FHIR endpoint, FHIR operations, RESTful FHIR, implement FHIR.","bodyPreview":"# FHIR REST API implementation\n\nThis skill provides guidance for implementing FHIR RESTful APIs according to the HL7 FHIR specification (R4/R5).\n\n## URL structure\n\nAll FHIR REST URLs follow the pattern:\n\n```\n[base]/[type]/[id]\n```\n\n- `[base]`: Service base URL (e.g., `https://fhir.example.org/r4`)\n- `[type]`: Resource type (e.g., `Patient`, `Observation`)\n- `[id]`: Logical resource ID\n\nURLs are case-sensitive and use UTF-8 encoding.\n\n## Core operations\n\n| Operation         | HTTP     | URL Patte","body":"# FHIR REST API implementation\n\nThis skill provides guidance for implementing FHIR RESTful APIs according to the HL7 FHIR specification (R4/R5).\n\n## URL structure\n\nAll FHIR REST URLs follow the pattern:\n\n```\n[base]/[type]/[id]\n```\n\n- `[base]`: Service base URL (e.g., `https://fhir.example.org/r4`)\n- `[type]`: Resource type (e.g., `Patient`, `Observation`)\n- `[id]`: Logical resource ID\n\nURLs are case-sensitive and use UTF-8 encoding.\n\n## Core operations\n\n| Operation         | HTTP     | URL Pattern                         | Success |\n| ----------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------- | ------- |\n| Read              | GET      | `[base]/[type]/[id]`                | 200     |\n| VRead             | GET      | `[base]/[type]/[id]/_history/[vid]` | 200     |\n| Create            | POST     | `[base]/[type]`                     | 201     |\n| Update            | PUT      | `[base]/[type]/[id]`                | 200/201 |\n| Patch             | PATCH    | `[base]/[type]/[id]`                | 200     |\n| Delete            | DELETE   | `[base]/[type]/[id]`                | 200/204 |\n| Search            | GET/POST | `[base]/[type]?params`              | 200     |\n| History           | GET      | `[base]/[type]/[id]/_history`       | 200     |\n| Capabilities      | GET      | `[base]/metadata`                   | 200     |\n| Batch/Transaction | POST     | `[base]`                            | 200     |\n\nFor detailed specifications of each operation, see [references/operations.md](references/operations.md).\n\n## Content negotiation\n\n### MIME types\n\n| Format | MIME Type                 |\n| ------ | ------------------------- |\n| JSON   | `application/fhir+json`   |\n| XML    | `application/fhir+xml`    |\n| RDF    | `application/fhir+turtle` |\n\nUse the `Accept` header for response format and `Content-Type` for request body format.\n\nThe `_format` query parameter overrides `Accept` when clients cannot set headers.\n\n### FHIR version\n\nSpecify version via MIME type parameter:\n\n```\nAccept: application/fhir+json; fhirVersion=4.0\n```\n\nVersion mappings: 1.0 (R2), 3.0 (R3), 4.0 (R4), 4.3 (R4B), 5.0 (R5).\n\n## Required headers\n\n### Request headers\n\n| Header        | Purpose             | Example                 |\n| ------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Accept        | Response format     | `application/fhir+json` |\n| Content-Type  | Request body format | `application/fhir+json` |\n| If-Match      | Optimistic locking  | `W/\"123\"`               |\n| If-None-Exist | Conditional create  | `identifier=123`        |\n| Prefer        | Return preference   | `return=representation` |\n\n### Response headers\n\n| Header        | Purpose            | Example                         |\n| ------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| ETag          | Version identifier | `W/\"123\"`                       |\n| Location      | New resource URL   | `[base]/Patient/123/_history/1` |\n| Last-Modified | Modification time  | RFC 7231 date                   |\n\n## Versioning and optimistic locking\n\nFHIR uses weak ETags for version tracking:\n\n1. Server returns `ETag: W/\"[versionId]\"` with responses\n2. Client sends `If-Match: W/\"[versionId]\"` with updates\n3. Server returns `412 Precondition Failed` if version mismatch\n\nImplement version-aware updates when `CapabilityStatement.rest.resource.versioning` is `versioned-update`.\n\n## Error handling\n\nReturn `OperationOutcome` resources for all errors:\n\n```json\n{\n    \"resourceType\": \"OperationOutcome\",\n    \"issue\": [\n        {\n            \"severity\": \"error\",\n            \"code\": \"invalid\",\n            \"diagnostics\": \"Patient.birthDate: Invalid date format\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n### Status codes\n\n| Code | Meaning                                |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------- |\n| 400  | Invalid syntax or validation failure   |\n| 404  | Resource not found                     |\n| 409  | Version conflict                       |\n| 410  | Resource deleted                       |\n| 412  | Precondition failed (version mismatch) |\n| 422  | Business rule violation                |\n\n## Prefer header\n\nControl response content with `Prefer`:\n\n| Value                     | Response body        |\n| ------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `return=minimal`          | Empty (headers only) |\n| `return=representation`   | Full resource        |\n| `return=OperationOutcome` | Validation outcome   |\n\nFor async operations, use `Prefer: respond-async` to get `202 Accepted` with status polling URL.\n\n## Implementation checklist\n\nServer implementations should:\n\n1. Implement CapabilityStatement at `/metadata`\n2. Support content negotiation (JSON at minimum)\n3. Return proper ETags for versioned resources\n4. Include `Location` header on create/update\n5. Return `OperationOutcome` for all errors\n6. Support `_format` parameter fallback\n7. Honour `Prefer` header for response content\n\n## References\n\n- [operations.md](references/operations.md): Detailed operation specifications\n- [search.md](references/search.md): Search parameter and result handling\n- [batch-transaction.md](references/batch-transaction.md): Batch and transaction processing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:42:48.516Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Healthcare Agents needing to implement FHIR RESTful APIs for clinical data exchange.","zh":"非常适合需要实现FHIR RESTful APIs用于临床数据交换的医疗保健代理。","ja":"FHIR RESTful APIを使用した臨床データの交換を実装する必要があるヘルスケアエージェントに最適です。","ko":"临床数据交换을 위한 FHIR RESTful API를 구현해야 하는 헬스케어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de atención médica que necesitan implementar API RESTful de FHIR para el intercambio de datos clínicos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de soins de santé ayant besoin de mettre en œuvre des API RESTful FHIR pour l''échange de données cliniques.","de":"Perfekt für Healthcare-Agents, die FHIR-REST-APIs für den Austausch von klinischen Daten implementieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Saúde que precisam implementar APIs RESTful FHIR para troca de dados clínicos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов здравоохранения, которым необходимо реализовать RESTful API FHIR для обмена клиническими данными.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الصحيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ واجهات برمجة تطبيقات RESTful FHIR لتبادل البيانات السريرية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build compliant FHIR REST APIs using Apache Spark, facilitating standardized clinical data analytics and exchange via the HL7 FHIR specification, including support for FHIR R4 and R5, and handling resources like Patient and Observation.","zh":"使代理能够使用Apache Spark构建兼容FHIR REST API，从而实现标准化的临床数据分析和交换，通过HL7 FHIR规范，包括对FHIR R4和R5的支持，并处理Patient和Observation等资源。","ja":"エージェントがApache Sparkを使用してFHIR REST APIを構築できるようにし、HL7 FHIR仕様を介して標準化された臨床データ分析および交換を可能にし、FHIR R4およびR5をサポートし、PatientやObservationなどのリソースを処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 Apache Spark를 사용하여 FHIR REST API를 구축할 수 있도록 하여 HL7 FHIR 사양을 통해 표준화된 임상 데이터 분석 및 교환을 가능하게 하며 FHIR R4 및 R5를 지원하고 Patient 및 Observation 등의 리소스를 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear API REST de FHIR compatibles utilizando Apache Spark, lo que facilita el análisis y el intercambio de datos clínicos estandarizados a través de la especificación HL7 FHIR, incluyendo soporte para FHIR R4 y R5, y manejo de recursos como Patient y Observation.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des API REST FHIR conformes en utilisant Apache Spark, ce qui facilite l''analyse et l''échange de données cliniques standardisées via la spécification HL7 FHIR, y compris la prise en charge de FHIR R4 et R5, et la gestion de ressources comme Patient et Observation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, mithilfe von Apache Spark konforme FHIR-REST-APIs zu erstellen, was die standardisierte Analyse und den Austausch von klinischen Daten über die HL7-FHIR-Spezifikation erleichtert, einschließlich Unterstützung für FHIR R4 und R5 sowie Handhabung von Ressourcen wie Patient und Observation.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir APIs REST FHIR conformes usando Apache Spark, facilitando a análise e troca de dados clínicos padronizados via especificação HL7 FHIR, incluindo suporte para FHIR R4 e R5, e manipulação de recursos como Paciente e Observação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать соответствующие API REST FHIR, используя Apache Spark, облегчая стандартизированную аналитику и обмен клиническими данными через спецификацию HL7 FHIR, включая поддержку FHIR R4 и R5, а также обработку ресурсов, таких как Пациент и Наблюдение.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء APIs REST FHIR المتوافقة باستخدام Apache Spark، و تسهيل تحليل البيانات السريرية وتبادلها بشكل قياسي عبر مواصفة HL7 FHIR، بما في ذلك دعم FHIR R4 و R5، و معالجة موارد مثل المريض والملاحظة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing FHIR RESTful APIs for electronic health records","Analyzing clinical data using Apache Spark","Validating FHIR resource IDs and URLs"],"zh":["实现电子健康记录的FHIR RESTful API","使用Apache Spark分析临床数据","验证FHIR资源ID和URL"],"ja":["電子ヘルスレコードのFHIR RESTful APIの実装","Apache Sparkを使用した臨床データの分析","FHIRリソースIDおよびURLの検証"],"ko":["전자 건강 기록을 위한 FHIR RESTful API 구현","Apache Spark를 사용한 임상 데이터 분석","FHIR 리소스 ID 및 URL 확인"],"es":["Implementación de API RESTful de FHIR para registros electrónicos de salud","Análisis de datos clínicos utilizando Apache Spark","Validación de IDs y URLs de recursos FHIR"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''API RESTful FHIR pour les dossiers médicaux électroniques","Analyse de données cliniques à l''aide d''Apache Spark","Validation des ID et des URL de ressources FHIR"],"de":["Implementierung von FHIR-REST-APIs für elektronische Gesundheitsakten","Analyse von klinischen Daten mit Apache Spark","Validierung von FHIR-Ressourcen-IDs und -URLs"],"pt":["Implementação de APIs RESTful FHIR para registros eletrônicos de saúde","Análise de dados clínicos usando Apache Spark","Validação de IDs de recursos FHIR e URLs"],"ru":["Реализация RESTful API FHIR для электронных медицинских записей","Анализ клинических данных с помощью Apache Spark","Проверка идентификаторов ресурсов FHIR и URL-адресов"],"ar":["تنفيذ واجهات برمجة تطبيقات RESTful FHIR لسجلات الصحة الإلكترونية","تحليل البيانات السريرية باستخدام Apache Spark","التحقق من معرفات موارد FHIR والعناوين URL"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of HL7 FHIR specification","Case-sensitive and UTF-8 encoding compliance necessary","Apache Spark dependency"],"zh":["需要了解HL7 FHIR规范","需要符合区分大小写和UTF-8编码","依赖Apache Spark"],"ja":["HL7 FHIR仕様の知識が必要","大文字と小文字を区別し、UTF-8エンコードに準拠する必要がある","Apache Sparkに依存する"],"ko":["HL7 FHIR 사양에 대한 지식이 필요","대/소문자 구분 및 UTF-8 인코딩 준수 필요","Apache Spark 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la especificación HL7 FHIR","Cumplimiento de la codificación case-sensitive y UTF-8 necesario","Dependencia de Apache Spark"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de la spécification HL7 FHIR","Conformité à la codage case-sensitive et UTF-8 nécessaire","Dépendance d''Apache Spark"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der HL7-FHIR-Spezifikation","Einhaltung der case-sensitiven und UTF-8-Codierung erforderlich","Abhängigkeit von Apache Spark"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento da especificação HL7 FHIR","Necessária conformidade com codificação sensível a maiúsculas e minúsculas e UTF-8","Dependência do Apache Spark"],"ru":["Требуется знание спецификации HL7 FHIR","Необходимо соблюдение регистрозависимой и UTF-8 кодировки","Зависимость от Apache Spark"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمواصفة HL7 FHIR","الامتثال لحساسية الحروف الكبيرة والصغيرة والترميز UTF-8 ضروري","اعتماد على Apache Spark"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5ec4f887506c74dc0dad984343747526ed812bc07567c061037c408dbaef5dda","qualityScore":36}');
