","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Informes personalizados y detallados"],"fr":["Planification de la feuille de route","Création de modèles d''histoires utilisateur","Analyse de métriques KPI avec les Agents d''IA","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Rapports personnalisés et détaillés"],"de":["Planung der Roadmap","Erstellung von Benutzerstory-Vorlagen","Analyse von KPI-Metriken mit KI-Agenten","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Individuelle und detaillierte Berichte"],"pt":["Análise de métricas e KPI","Planejamento de roadmap","Templates de histórias de usuário","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Relatórios personalizados","Alertas e notificações"],"ru":["Аналитика метрик и KPI","Планирование дорожной карты","Шаблоны пользовательских историй","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Пользовательские отчеты","Оповещения и уведомления"],"ar":["تحليل المترات والكبي","تخطيط الطريق","قوالب قصص المستخدم","التكامل مع أدوات البرمجة","تقارير مخصصة","تنبيهات و إشعارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","分析指标","KPI","产品管理","路线图规划","用户故事模板","React","Python","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装"],"ja":["AIエージェント","分析メトリクス","KPI","製品管理","ロードマップ計画","ユーザーストーリーテンプレート","React","Python","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","分析 메트릭스","KPI","제품 관리","路線圖計画","ユーザーストーリーテンプレート","React","Python","AI 에이전트의 사용법","AI 에이전트의 설치"],"es":["cómo utilizar Agentes de IA","qué es un plugin de análisis de métricas KPI","alternativas a Tableau","cómo instalar nuestro plugin","guía de configuración de nuestro plugin","análisis de datos con Python","desarrollo de software con Node.js"],"fr":["comment utiliser les Agents d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un plugin d''analyse de métriques KPI","alternatives à Tableau","comment installer notre plugin","guide de configuration de notre plugin","analyse de données avec Python","développement de logiciels avec Node.js"],"de":["wie man KI-Agenten verwendet","was ist ein Analyse-Plugin für KPI-Metriken","Alternativen zu Tableau","wie man unser Plugin installiert","Konfigurationsanleitung für unser Plugin","Datenanalyse mit Python","Softwareentwicklung mit Node.js"],"pt":["como usar plugin de análise de métricas","o que é kpi em desenvolvimento","ferramentas de análise de métricas para desenvolvedores","plugin de análise de métricas alternative","instalar plugin de análise de métricas","guia de configuração de plugin de análise de métricas","desenvolvimento de produtos com análise de métricas","análise de métricas em python","análise de métricas em react"],"ru":["как использовать плагин аналитики метрик","что такое kpi в разработке","инструменты аналитики метрик для разработчиков","плагин аналитики метрик alternative","установить плагин аналитики метрик","руководство по настройке плагина аналитики метрик","разработка продуктов с аналитикой метрик","аналитика метрик на python","аналитика метрик на react"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ملحق تحليل المترات","ما هو الكبي في البرمجة","أدوات تحليل المترات للبرمجة","ملحق تحليل المترات بديل","تثبيت ملحق تحليل المترات","دليل إعداد ملحق تحليل المترات","برمجة المنتجات مع تحليل المترات","تحليل المترات في بايثون","تحليل المترات في رياكت"]}},"owner":"pluginagentmarketplace","repo":"custom-plugin-product-manager","repoPath":"pluginagentmarketplace/custom-plugin-product-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.148Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"analytics-metrics-kpi","description":"Master metrics definition, KPI tracking, dashboarding, A/B testing, and data-driven decision making. Use data to guide product decisions.","version":"2.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Analytics & Metrics Skill\n\nBecome data-driven. Define meaningful metrics, build dashboards, run experiments, and make decisions based on data, not intuition.\n\n## Metrics Framework (Acquisition → Revenue)\n\n### North Star Metric\n\n**Definition:** One metric that best captures the value your product delivers.\n\n**Characteristics:**\n- Directly tied to business success\n- Driven by product improvements\n- Leading indicator of revenue\n- Understandable to whole company\n\n**Examples:**\n- Slack: Daily Activ","body":"# Analytics & Metrics Skill\n\nBecome data-driven. Define meaningful metrics, build dashboards, run experiments, and make decisions based on data, not intuition.\n\n## Metrics Framework (Acquisition → Revenue)\n\n### North Star Metric\n\n**Definition:** One metric that best captures the value your product delivers.\n\n**Characteristics:**\n- Directly tied to business success\n- Driven by product improvements\n- Leading indicator of revenue\n- Understandable to whole company\n\n**Examples:**\n- Slack: Daily Active Users (DAU)\n- Airbnb: Booked Nights\n- YouTube: Watch Time\n- Uber: Rides Completed\n- Stripe: Payment Volume Processed\n\n### Funnel Metrics (Acquisition)\n\n```\nTotal Visitors: 100,000/month\n↓ 20% conversion\nFree Signups: 20,000\n↓ 10% free-to-paid\nPaid Customers: 2,000\n\nCAC: $50 (marketing + sales spend / customers acquired)\nLTCAC: $100 (all customer acquisition costs)\n```\n\n**Metrics to Track:**\n- **Traffic** - Total visitors to website/app\n- **Signup Rate** - % who sign up (target: 10-15%)\n- **Free-to-Paid Conversion** - % free users who pay (target: 2-5%)\n- **CAC** - Cost per acquired customer\n- **CAC Payback** - Months to recover CAC from revenue (target: < 12 months)\n\n### Activation Metrics\n\n**Goal:** New users become active users\n\n```\nFree Signups: 2,000\n↓ 30% onboard successfully\nActivated: 600\n↓ 60% remain active Day 7\nDay 7 Active: 360\n```\n\n**Metrics to Track:**\n- **Onboarding Completion Rate** - % who complete setup (target: 50-80%)\n- **Time to First Value** - Hours to first successful use\n- **Feature Adoption** - % who try key features\n- **Day 1/7/30 Retention** - % active those days (target: 40/25/15)\n\n### Engagement Metrics\n\n**Goal:** Users regularly use product\n\n**Daily/Monthly Metrics:**\n- **DAU/MAU** - Daily/Monthly Active Users\n- **DAU/MAU Ratio** - Stickiness (target: 20-30%)\n- **Feature Usage** - % using key features\n- **Session Length** - Minutes per session\n- **Session Frequency** - Times per week\n\n**Cohort Analysis Example:**\n```\nJan Cohort (1,000 signups):\n- Day 1: 600 active (60%)\n- Day 7: 360 active (36%)\n- Day 30: 180 active (18%)\n- Month 3: 90 active (9%)\n\nFeb Cohort (1,500 signups):\n- Day 1: 1050 active (70%) ← Improving!\n- Day 7: 630 active (42%)\n- Day 30: 300 active (20%)\n```\n\n### Retention Metrics\n\n**Goal:** Users stay and continue paying\n\n```\nMonth 1: 1,000 customers\nMonth 2: 900 active (90% retained)\nMonth 3: 810 active (90% of month 2)\nMonth 12: 314 active (31% annual retention)\n```\n\n**Churn Rate:** % lost each period\n- Monthly churn: (Customers Lost / Month Start) × 100\n- Annual churn: 1 - (Ending / Starting)\n- Target for SaaS: < 5% monthly churn\n\n**NPS (Net Promoter Score)**\n- Question: \"How likely to recommend (0-10)?\"\n- Score = % Promoters (9-10) - % Detractors (0-6)\n- Range: -100 to +100\n- Target: 50+ (world-class)\n\n### Revenue Metrics\n\n**Monthly Recurring Revenue (MRR)**\n```\nMRR = (Total paid customers) × (average subscription price)\nGrowth MRR = New MRR + Expansion MRR - Churn MRR\n```\n\n**Annual Run Rate (ARR)**\n```\nARR = MRR × 12\n```\n\n**Average Revenue Per User (ARPU)**\n```\nARPU = MRR / Total Users\n```\n\n**Customer Lifetime Value (LTV)**\n```\nLTV = (ARPU × Gross Margin %) / Monthly Churn %\n\nExample:\nARPU: $100\nGross Margin: 80%\nMonthly Churn: 5%\nLTV = ($100 × 80%) / 5% = $1,600\n\nIf CAC = $400: LTV/CAC = 4x ✓ (target: 3x+)\n```\n\n## Dashboard Architecture\n\n### Executive Dashboard (C-Level)\n\n**Weekly Updates:**\n- MRR / ARR (vs target, vs month ago)\n- New customers (weekly, monthly)\n- Churn rate (%)\n- NPS score\n- Engagement (DAU, MAU)\n- Key initiatives status\n\n**Frequency:** Weekly\n\n### Product Dashboard (Product Team)\n\n**Daily/Weekly:**\n- Funnel metrics (signup → paid)\n- Feature adoption\n- Engagement metrics\n- User feedback score\n- A/B test results\n- Support ticket volume\n\n**Frequency:** Daily updates\n\n### Financial Dashboard (Finance/Operations)\n\n**Monthly:**\n- MRR / ARR\n- Customer acquisition cost\n- Customer lifetime value\n- Gross margin\n- CAC payback period\n- Revenue by segment\n- Churn by cohort\n\n**Frequency:** Monthly\n\n### Health Dashboard (Operations)\n\n**Realtime:**\n- System uptime (%)\n- Error rate (%)\n- Response time (p95)\n- Database performance\n- Support ticket response time\n- Support backlog\n\n**Frequency:** Realtime/hourly\n\n## A/B Testing (Experimentation)\n\n### Test Planning\n\n**Hypothesis:**\n\"If we change X, then Y will improve, because Z\"\n\n**Example:**\n\"If we move signup button above the fold, then conversion will improve 15%, because users won''t scroll.\"\n\n### Test Structure\n\n**Experiment Design:**\n- **Control:** Keep current version\n- **Treatment:** New version\n- **Sample size:** Enough users to be statistical\n- **Duration:** 2-4 weeks minimum\n- **Metric:** Clear success metric\n\n### Statistical Significance\n\n**Confidence Level:** 95% (industry standard)\n- Means 5% chance of false positive\n- Need enough samples (typically 1000-10K per variant)\n- Use calculator for exact sample size\n\n**P-Value:** Probability result is random chance\n- P < 0.05: Statistically significant\n- P > 0.05: Not significant, inconclusive\n\n### Example A/B Test\n\n**Hypothesis:** Moving signup button above fold increases conversion 15%\n\n**Setup:**\n- Control: Current design\n- Treatment: Button moved above fold\n- Success metric: Conversion rate (signup / visit)\n- Sample size: 10,000 users per variant\n- Duration: 2 weeks\n- Confidence: 95%\n\n**Results:**\n- Control: 2.0% conversion (200 signups from 10K visitors)\n- Treatment: 2.8% conversion (280 signups from 10K visitors)\n- Improvement: 40% increase (0.8% / 2% = 40%)\n- P-value: 0.02 (statistically significant!)\n- Decision: **SHIP IT** - Roll out to 100%\n\n### Test Ideas by Priority\n\n**High Priority (Start Here):**\n- Signup flow optimization (biggest funnel)\n- Onboarding experience\n- Pricing page clarity\n- Feature discoverability\n\n**Medium Priority:**\n- UI copy optimization\n- CTA button colors\n- Email subject lines\n- Notification triggers\n\n**Low Priority:**\n- Micro-copy tweaks\n- Animation effects\n- Color scheme changes\n\n## Metric Pitfalls to Avoid\n\n### Vanity Metrics\n❌ \"We have 1M page views!\"\n✓ \"We have 50K daily active users, growing 10% monthly\"\n\n### Actionable vs Non-Actionable\n❌ \"User satisfaction increased\" (what changed?)\n✓ \"Onboarding completion rate 65% → 78% (↑20%)\" (clear action)\n\n### Correlation vs Causation\n❌ \"Ice cream sales correlate with drownings\"\n✓ Understand actual causation, not just correlation\n\n### Look-Alike Metrics\n❌ Track MRR but not Customer LTV (can grow MRR by spending more on acquisition)\n✓ Track both acquisition efficiency AND retention\n\n## Metrics Review Cadence\n\n**Daily:**\n- System uptime\n- Error rates\n- Support response time\n\n**Weekly:**\n- Funnel metrics\n- Feature adoption\n- Key engagement metrics\n- Test results\n\n**Monthly:**\n- Revenue metrics\n- Cohort analysis\n- Churn breakdown\n- LTV/CAC trends\n\n**Quarterly:**\n- Strategic metric review\n- Long-term trend analysis\n- Metric changes needed\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Yaygın Hatalar & Çözümler\n\n| Hata | Olası Sebep | Çözüm |\n|------|-------------|-------|\n| Vanity metrics focus | Wrong KPI selection | North Star alignment |\n| Inconclusive A/B test | Low sample size | Extend duration |\n| Data inconsistency | Multiple sources | Single source of truth |\n| Dashboard unused | Too complex | Simplify to 5-7 KPIs |\n\n### Debug Checklist\n\n```\n[ ] North Star metric defined mi?\n[ ] Metrics business goals''a aligned mi?\n[ ] Data collection accurate mi?\n[ ] Dashboard refreshed mi?\n[ ] A/B test sample sufficient mi?\n[ ] Statistical significance achieved mi?\n```\n\n### Recovery Procedures\n\n1. **Data Quality Issues** → Flag affected metrics, exclude\n2. **Inconclusive A/B** → Extend test duration\n3. **Misleading Metrics** → Add context/segmentation\n\n---\n\n**Master data-driven decision making and grow faster!**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:45:26.697Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data-Driven Agents needing advanced analytics and metrics capabilities for informed decision-making.","zh":"非常适合需要高级分析和指标功能的数据驱动代理，用于明智的决策。","ja":"高度な分析とメトリクス機能を必要とするデータ駆動型エージェントに最適です。","ko":"데이터 주도형 에이전트에게 적합하며, 고급 분석 및 측정 기능이 필요한 경우에 적절합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Impulsados por Datos que necesitan capacidades de análisis y métricas avanzadas para la toma de decisiones informadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Axés sur les Données ayant besoin de capacités d''analyse et de métriques avancées pour une prise de décision éclairée.","de":"Perfekt für datengetriebene Agenten, die erweiterte Analyse- und Metrikfunktionen für informierte Entscheidungsfindung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Impulsionados por Dados que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise e métricas para tomada de decisões informadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, управляемых данными, которым необходимы продвинутые аналитические и метрические возможности для принятия обоснованных решений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المدفوعين بالبيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تحليلية متقدمة ومتغيرات لمعايير اتخاذ القرارات المطلعة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define meaningful metrics, build dashboards, and run experiments using a metrics framework, driving data-driven decisions with North Star Metrics and Acquisition-to-Revenue analysis.","zh":"赋予代理定义有意义的指标、构建仪表盘和使用指标框架运行实验的能力，通过北极星指标和采集到收入分析驱动数据驱动的决策。","ja":"エージェントが有意義なメトリクスを定義し、ダッシュボードを構築し、メトリクス フレームワークを使用して実験を実行する機能を提供し、北極星メトリクスと採用から収益分析によるデータ ドリブンの意思決定を推進します。","ko":"에이전트가 의미 있는 지표를 정의하고 대시보드를 구축하며 측정 프레임워크를 사용하여 실험을 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여, 북극성 지표 및 수집에서 수익 분석을 통해 데이터 주도형 의사 결정을 구동합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir métricas significativas, crear paneles de control y ejecutar experimentos utilizando un marco de métricas, impulsando decisiones basadas en datos con North Star Metrics y análisis de Adquisición a Ingresos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des métriques significatives, de créer des tableaux de bord et d''exécuter des expériences en utilisant un cadre de métriques, impulsant les décisions basées sur les données avec North Star Metrics et l''analyse Acquisition-to-Revenue.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, bedeutungsvolle Metriken zu definieren, Dashboards zu erstellen und Experimente mit einem Metrik-Framework durchzuführen, um datengetriebene Entscheidungen mit North Star Metrics und Acquisition-to-Revenue-Analyse anzutreiben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir métricas significativas, construir painéis e executar experimentos usando um framework de métricas, impulsionando decisões baseadas em dados com Métricas North Star e análise de Aquisição para Receita.","ru":"Наделяет агентов способностью определять значимые метрики, создавать панели управления и проводить эксперименты с помощью метрического фреймворка, что стимулирует принятие решений на основе данных с метриками North Star и анализом приобретения к выручке.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تعريف معايير معنوية، وبناء لوحات تحكم، وتنفيذ التجارب باستخدام إطار عمل للمعايير، مما يدفع القرارات القائمة على البيانات مع معايير النجم الشمالي وتحليل الحصول على الإيرادات."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining North Star Metrics for product success","Building dashboards for data-driven decision-making","Running experiments to optimize product improvements"],"zh":["为产品成功定义北极星指标","为数据驱动的决策构建仪表盘","运行实验以优化产品改进"],"ja":["製品の成功のための北極星メトリクスを定義する","データ ドリブンの意思決定のためのダッシュボードを構築する","製品の改善を最適化するための実験を実行する"],"ko":["제품 성공을 위한 북극성 지표 정의","데이터 주도형 의사 결정을 위한 대시보드 구축","제품 개선 최적화를 위한 실험 실행"],"es":["Definir North Star Metrics para el éxito del producto","Crear paneles de control para la toma de decisiones basadas en datos","Ejecutar experimentos para optimizar mejoras de productos"],"fr":["Définir les North Star Metrics pour la réussite du produit","Créer des tableaux de bord pour la prise de décision basée sur les données","Exécuter des expériences pour optimiser les améliorations de produits"],"de":["Definieren von North Star Metrics für den Erfolg von Produkten","Erstellen von Dashboards für datengetriebene Entscheidungsfindung","Durchführen von Experimenten zur Optimierung von Produktverbesserungen"],"pt":["Definir Métricas North Star para o sucesso do produto","Construir painéis para tomada de decisões baseadas em dados","Executar experimentos para otimizar melhorias de produto"],"ru":["Определение метрик North Star для успеха продукта","Создание панелей для принятия решений на основе данных","Проведение экспериментов для оптимизации улучшений продукта"],"ar":["تحديد معايير النجم الشمالي لنجاح المنتج","بناء لوحات تحكم لاتخاذ القرارات القائمة على البيانات","تنفيذ التجارب لتحسين تحسينات المنتج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of business success metrics","Limited to product management and user story template contexts"],"zh":["需要了解业务成功指标","仅限于产品管理和用户故事模板的上下文"],"ja":["ビジネスの成功メトリクスを理解する必要がある","製品管理とユーザー ストーリー テンプレートのコンテキストに限定される"],"ko":["사업 성공 지표를 이해해야 함","제품 관리 및 사용자 스토리 템플릿의 contexto에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de las métricas de éxito empresarial","Limitado a contextos de gestión de productos y plantillas de historias de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des métricas de réussite commerciale","Limité aux contextes de gestion de produits et de modèles d''histoires d''utilisateurs"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis der Geschäftserfolgsmetriken","Begrenzt auf Produktmanagement- und Benutzerstory-Vorlagen-Kontexte"],"pt":["Exige compreensão das métricas de sucesso empresarial","Limitado a contextos de gerenciamento de produtos e modelos de história de usuário"],"ru":["Требует понимания метрик бизнес-успеха","Ограничен контекстами управления продуктами и шаблонов пользовательской истории"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم معايير نجاح الأعمال","محدود السياقات لإدارة المنتجات وقوالب قصة المستخدم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4f37ea86c1282beef01260ebbd78c23c27028a5d70940ab760da4703557488a7","qualityScore":36}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('chengyihua/nanobot-ts/baoyu-post-to-x', 'community', 'chengyihua', 'nanobot-ts', 'chengyihua/nanobot-ts', 'baoyu-post-to-x', 0, 0, 36, '2026-03-01T12:47:24.659Z', '2026-03-01T13:19:13.730Z', '4522ae2cfa2a7c79dfdce9f84be9f6541cdc36f5e234daff762f756faf614ebb', '{"id":"chengyihua/nanobot-ts/baoyu-post-to-x","name":"baoyu-post-to-x","description":{"zh":"Nanobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of handling complex tasks through a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration.","ja":"Nanobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of handling complex tasks through a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration.","ko":"Nanobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of handling complex tasks through a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration.","es":"baoyu-post-to-x es un marco de asistente AI personal construido con TypeScript, diseñado para manejar tareas complejas","fr":"baoyu-post-to-x est un cadre d''assistant AI personnel construit avec TypeScript, conçu pour gérer des tâches complexes","de":"baoyu-post-to-x ist ein Framework für persönliche AI-Assistenten, entwickelt mit TypeScript, das komplexe Aufgaben bewältigen kann","pt":"O baoyu-post-to-x é um framework de assistente AI pessoal construído com TypeScript, projetado para lidar com tarefas complexas","ru":"ИИ Агент baoyu-post-to-x - это ультралегкий фреймворк для личного помощника, построенный на TypeScript","ar":"وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي baoyu-post-to-x هو إطار عمل خفيف الوزن للوكيل الشخصي الذكاء الاصطناعي المبني على TypeScript","en":"An ultra-lightweight, extensible personal AI assistant framework built with TypeScript. Nanobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of handling complex tasks through a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration."},"