dards 설정 가이드","HTML to Markdown 변환기 도구","CommonMark 지원 변환기","고성능 문서 처리 도구"],"es":["conversor html a markdown","herramientas de ai","commonmark","kreuzberg","conversión de documentos","parseo de flujo","ocr","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["convertisseur html en markdown","outils d''ia","commonmark","kreuzberg","conversion de documents","analyse de flux","ocr","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["html zu markdown konverter","ki tools","commonmark","kreuzberg","dokumentenkonvertierung","streaming parsing","ocr","software entwickeln","entwicklertools"],"pt":["conversor HTML para Markdown","ferramentas de IA","CommonMark","extrair dados de documentos","Kreuzberg","conversor de texto","como usar conversor HTML para Markdown","o que é conversor HTML para Markdown"],"ru":["конвертер HTML в Markdown","ИИ агенты","CommonMark","извлекать данные из документов","Kreuzberg","конвертер текста","как использовать конвертер HTML в Markdown","что такое конвертер HTML в Markdown"],"ar":["محول HTML إلى Markdown","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","CommonMark","استخراج البيانات من الوثائق","Kreuzberg","محول النص","كيفية استخدام محول HTML إلى Markdown","ما هو محول HTML إلى Markdown"]}},"owner":"kreuzberg-dev","repo":"html-to-markdown","repoPath":"kreuzberg-dev/html-to-markdown","stars":538,"forks":48,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T07:34:41Z","topics":["hocr","html","html-converter","markdown","markdown-converter","rag","text-extraction","text-processing"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-standards","description":"","bodyPreview":"______________________________________________________________________\n\n## priority: medium\n\n# Git Commit Standards\n\n**Conventional Commits 1.0.0 · Pre-commit hooks enforce quality**\n\n- Commit message format: feat/fix/docs/refactor/test/chore(scope): description\n- Scopes: rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci, docs\n- Example: fix(rust-core): handle nested lists in markdown output\n- Example: feat(py-binding): expose sanitization options to Python API\n- Example: tes","body":"______________________________________________________________________\n\n## priority: medium\n\n# Git Commit Standards\n\n**Conventional Commits 1.0.0 · Pre-commit hooks enforce quality**\n\n- Commit message format: feat/fix/docs/refactor/test/chore(scope): description\n- Scopes: rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci, docs\n- Example: fix(rust-core): handle nested lists in markdown output\n- Example: feat(py-binding): expose sanitization options to Python API\n- Example: test(ts-binding): add parametrized tests for edge cases\n- Commits MUST pass prek hooks: fmt, lint, tests (at min)\n- NEVER include AI signatures in commits; commits authored by humans\n- NEVER force push to main/development; require PR reviews\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:28:16.568Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring strict adherence to Conventional Commits 1.0.0 standards","zh":"非常适合需要严格遵守 Conventional Commits 1.0.0 标准的代码审查智能体","ja":"Conventional Commits 1.0.0 標準への厳格な準拠を必要とするコードレビューエージェントに最適です","ko":"Conventional Commits 1.0.0 표준을 엄격히 준수해야 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 이상적입니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que requieren una adherencia estricta a los estándares de Conventional Commits 1.0.0","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une adhésion stricte aux normes Conventional Commits 1.0.0","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die eine strikte Einhaltung der Conventional Commits 1.0.0-Standards erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem adesão estrita aos padrões Conventional Commits 1.0.0","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодового обзора, требующих строгого соблюдения стандартов Conventional Commits 1.0.0","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة للرمز الذين يتطلبون اتباع صارم لمعايير الإلتزامات التقليدية 1.0.0"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce high-quality commit messages using pre-commit hooks, ensuring consistency across feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, and chore scopes, while supporting multiple bindings such as rust-core, py-binding, and ts-binding","zh":"使智能体能够使用 pre-commit hooks 强制执行高质量的提交消息，确保 feat、fix、docs、refactor、test 和 chore 等范围的一致性，同时支持多种绑定，如 rust-core、py-binding 和 ts-binding","ja":"pre-commit hooks を使用して高品質のコミットメッセージを強制するエージェントを強化し、feat、fix、docs、refactor、test、chore などのスコープ全体で一貫性を確保します。同時に、rust-core、py-binding、ts-binding などの複数のバインディングをサポートします","ko":"pre-commit hooks를 사용하여 고품질 커밋 메시지를 적용하도록 에이전트를 강화하여 feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore 범위 전반에 걸쳐 일관성을 보장하며, rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding과 같은 여러 바인딩을 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar mensajes de confirmación de alta calidad utilizando ganchos pre-confirmación, garantizando la consistencia en los ámbitos feat, fix, docs, refactor, test y chore, y admitiendo múltiples enlaces como rust-core, py-binding y ts-binding","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des messages de commit de haute qualité en utilisant des hooks pré-commit, garantissant la cohérence dans les étendues feat, fix, docs, refactor, test et chore, tout en prenant en charge plusieurs liaisons telles que rust-core, py-binding et ts-binding","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertige Commit-Mitteilungen mithilfe von Pre-Commit-Hooks anzuwenden, wodurch die Konsistenz in den Bereichen feat, fix, docs, refactor, test und chore sichergestellt wird und mehrere Bindings wie rust-core, py-binding und ts-binding unterstützt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor mensagens de confirmação de alta qualidade usando ganchos pré-confirmação, garantindo consistência em escopos como feat, fix, docs, refactor, test e chore, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta várias ligações como rust-core, py-binding e ts-binding","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать высококачественные сообщения о фиксации с помощью хуков до фиксации, гарантируя согласованность во всех областях, таких как feat, fix, docs, refactor, test и chore, а также поддерживая несколько привязок, таких как rust-core, py-binding и ts-binding","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض رسائل التأكيد عالية الجودة باستخدام مشابك ما قبل الإلتزام، مما يضمن الاتساق عبر نطاقات مثل feat و fix و docs و refactor و test و chore، مع دعم ربطات متعددة مثل rust-core و py-binding و ts-binding"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit message formatting for consistent repository history","Validating commit scopes to ensure accurate change tracking","Enforcing pre-commit hooks for quality control across various bindings"],"zh":["自动化提交消息格式化，以实现一致的仓库历史记录","验证提交范围以确保准确的变更跟踪","强制执行 pre-commit hooks 以在各种绑定中进行质量控制"],"ja":["一貫したリポジトリ履歴のためのコミットメッセージフォーマットの自動化","正確な変更追跡を確保するためのコミットスコープの検証","様々なバインディング全体での品質管理のための pre-commit hooks の強制"],"ko":["일관된 저장소 기록을 위한 커밋 메시지 형식 지정 자동화","정확한 변경 사항 추적을 보장하기 위한 커밋 범위 검증","다양한 바인딩 전반에 걸친 품질 관리를 위한 pre-commit hooks 적용"],"es":["Automatizar el formato de los mensajes de confirmación para una historia de repositorio coherente","Validar los ámbitos de confirmación para garantizar un seguimiento preciso de los cambios","Aplicar ganchos pre-confirmación para el control de calidad en varios enlaces"],"fr":["Automatiser le formatage des messages de commit pour une histoire de référentiel cohérente","Valider les étendues de commit pour garantir un suivi précis des modifications","Appliquer des hooks pré-commit pour le contrôle qualité sur plusieurs liaisons"],"de":["Automatisierung des Formatierens von Commit-Mitteilungen für eine konsistente Repository-Historie","Validierung der Commit-Bereiche, um eine genaue Änderungsverfolgung sicherzustellen","Anwenden von Pre-Commit-Hooks für die Qualitätskontrolle bei verschiedenen Bindings"],"pt":["Automatizar a formatação de mensagens de confirmação para garantir um histórico de repositório consistente","Validar escopos de confirmação para garantir o acompanhamento preciso de alterações","Impor ganchos pré-confirmação para controle de qualidade em várias ligações"],"ru":["Автоматизировать форматирование сообщений о фиксации для обеспечения согласованной истории репозитория","Проверять области фиксации для обеспечения точного отслеживания изменений","Внедрять хуки до фиксации для контроля качества в различных привязках"],"ar":["تحسين تنسيق رسائل الإلتزام تلقائيا لضمان سجل مستودع متسق","تحقق من نطاقات الإلتزام لضمان تتبع دقيق للتغييرات","فرض مشابك ما قبل الإلتزام للرقابة الجودة عبر ربطات متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires implementation of Conventional Commits 1.0.0 standard","Limited to specific scopes such as rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci, and docs"],"zh":["需要实施 Conventional Commits 1.0.0 标准","仅限于特定范围，如 rust-core、py-binding、ts-binding、rb-binding、php-binding、build、ci 和 docs"],"ja":["Conventional Commits 1.0.0 標準の実装が必要","rust-core、py-binding、ts-binding、rb-binding、php-binding、build、ci、docs などの特定のスコープに限定される"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 1.0.0 표준 구현이 필요함","rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci, docs와 같은 특정 범위로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la implementación del estándar Conventional Commits 1.0.0","Limitado a ámbitos específicos como rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci y docs"],"fr":["Nécessite la mise en œuvre de la norme Conventional Commits 1.0.0","Limité à des étendues spécifiques telles que rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci et docs"],"de":["Erfordert die Implementierung des Conventional Commits 1.0.0-Standards","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Bereiche wie rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci und docs"],"pt":["Exige a implementação do padrão Conventional Commits 1.0.0","Limitado a escopos específicos, como rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci e docs"],"ru":["Требует реализации стандарта Conventional Commits 1.0.0","Ограничен конкретными областями, такими как rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci и docs"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ معيار الإلتزامات التقليدية 1.0.0","محدود بنطاقات محددة مثل rust-core و py-binding و ts-binding و rb-binding و php-binding و build و ci و docs"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fc8fb9ca20df8e0c13e14c7612ee9ea091e38a8b20ed803d80c5a9c0f47759e0","qualityScore":36}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('frankxai/arcanea/ReasoningBank with AgentDB', 'community', 'frankxai', 'arcanea', 'frankxai/arcanea', 'ReasoningBank with AgentDB', 3, 1, 36, '2026-02-25T02:23:41Z', '2026-02-26T08:39:42.384Z', 'ac77beb5bd7741be9ecfc1c97874b5a588df87b409b665b5dff863e19db4f355', '{"id":"frankxai/arcanea/ReasoningBank with AgentDB","name":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB","description":{"zh":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB是一种基于AI的智能代理，支持多智能体、上下文复合和创意编写","ja":"ReasoningBank with AgentDBは、多智能体、コンテキスト複合、創造的書き込みをサポートするAIベースの智能エージェントです","ko":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB는 멀티 에이전트, 컨텍스트 컴파운드, 창의적 작성을 지원하는 AI 기반의智能 에이전트입니다","es":"ReasoningBank es una plataforma de inteligencia artificial que potencia la creatividad con agentes y tecnologías de vanguardia","fr":"ReasoningBank est une plateforme d''intelligence artificielle qui booste la créativité avec des agents et des technologies de pointe","de":"ReasoningBank ist eine Plattform für künstliche Intelligenz, die die Kreativität mit Agenten und SpitzenTechnologien fördert","pt":"ReasoningBank é uma inteligência viva que overlay em qualquer IA, permitindo a criação de universos inteligentes.","ru":"ReasoningBank - это живая интеллект, который накладывается на любую ИИ, позволяя создавать интеллектуальные вселенные.","ar":"ReasoningBank هو ذكاء حي ي覆ي أي ذكاء اصطناعي، مما يسمح بإنشاء عوالم ذكية.","en":"Living intelligence that overlays any AI. Ten Guardian intelligences, context that compounds, and the creative civilization OS for creators who build universes."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理ReasoningBank with AgentDB","ja":"AIエージェントReasoningBank with AgentDB","ko":"AI 에이전트 ReasoningBank with AgentDB","es":"Agente de Inteligencia Artificial con ReasoningBank","fr":"Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle avec ReasoningBank","de":"KI-Agent mit ReasoningBank","pt":"Agentes de IA Avançados com ReasoningBank","ru":"ИИ Агенты с ReasoningBank и AgentDB","ar":"وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مع ReasoningBank","en":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB"},"description":{"zh":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB是一种基于AI的智能代理，支持多智能体、上下文复合和创意编写","ja":"ReasoningBank with AgentDBは、多智能体、コンテキスト複合、創造的書き込みをサポートするAIベースの智能エージェントです","ko":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB는 멀티 에이전트, 컨텍스트 컴파운드, 창의적 작성을 지원하는 AI 기반의智能 에이전트입니다","es":"ReasoningBank es una plataforma de inteligencia artificial que potencia la creatividad con agentes y tecnologías de vanguardia","fr":"ReasoningBank est une plateforme d''intelligence artificielle qui booste la créativité avec des agents et des technologies de pointe","de":"ReasoningBank ist eine Plattform für künstliche Intelligenz, die die Kreativität mit Agenten und SpitzenTechnologien fördert","pt":"ReasoningBank é uma inteligência viva que overlay em qualquer IA, permitindo a criação de universos inteligentes.","ru":"ReasoningBank - это живая интеллект, который накладывается на любую ИИ, позволяя создавать интеллектуальные вселенные.","ar":"ReasoningBank هو ذكاء حي ي覆ي أي ذكاء اصطناعي، مما يسمح بإنشاء عوالم ذكية.","en":"Living intelligence that overlays any AI. Ten Guardian intelligences, context that compounds, and the creative civilization OS for creators who build universes."},"definition":{"en":"Living intelligence that overlays any AI. Ten Guardian intelligences, context that compounds, and the creative civilization OS for creators who build universes."},"features":{"zh":["支持多智能体","上下文复合","创意编写","基于AI的智能代理","支持Next.js和Vercel AI SDK","使用TypeScript和claude-code"],"ja":["多智能体サポート","コンテキスト複合","創造的書き込み","AIベースの智能エージェント","Next.jsとVercel AI SDKサポート","TypeScriptとclaude-code使用"],"ko":["멀티 에이전트 지원","컨텍스트 컴파운드","창의적 작성을","AI 기반의智能 에이전트","Next.js와 Vercel AI SDK 지원","TypeScript와 claude-code 사용"],"es":["Inteligencia artificial avanzada","Agentes de aprendizaje automático","Tecnologías de vanguardia para la creatividad","Plataforma de orquestación para desarrolladores","Compatibilidad con Claude Code y Vercel AI SDK"],"fr":["Intelligence artificielle avancée","Agents d''apprentissage automatique","Technologies de pointe pour la créativité","Plateforme d''orchestration pour les développeurs","Compatibilité avec Claude Code et Vercel AI SDK"],"de":["Fortgeschrittene künstliche Intelligenz","Agenten für maschinellen Lernen","SpitzenTechnologien für die Kreativität","Plattform für die Orchestrierung von Entwicklern","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code und Vercel AI SDK"],"pt":["Inteligência viva que overlay em qualquer IA","Criação de universos inteligentes","10 inteligências guardiãs","Contexto que compõe","Sistema operacional de civilização criativa"],"ru":["Живая интеллект, которая накладывается на любую ИИ","Создание интеллектуальных вселенных","10 хранителей интеллекта","Контекст, который составляется","Операционная система творческой цивилизации"],"ar":["ذكاء حي يغطي أي ذكاء اصطناعي","إنشاء عوالم ذكية","10 حارس ذكاء","سياق يتشكل","نظام تشغيل للحضارة الإبداعية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","ReasoningBank with AgentDB","多智能体","上下文复合","创意编写","Next.js","Vercel AI SDK","TypeScript","claude-code","如何使用ReasoningBank with AgentDB"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ReasoningBank with AgentDB","多智能体","コンテキスト複合","創造的書き込み","Next.js","Vercel AI SDK","TypeScript","claude-code","ReasoningBank with AgentDBの使い方"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","ReasoningBank with AgentDB","멀티 에이전트","컨텍스트 컴파운드","창의적 작성을","Next.js","Vercel AI SDK","TypeScript","claude-code","ReasoningBank with AgentDB 사용법"],"es":["cómo utilizar agentes de inteligencia artificial","qué es la inteligencia artificial","ReasoningBank vs otros agentes de IA","instalación de ReasoningBank","guía de configuración de ReasoningBank","desarrollo de aplicaciones con ReasoningBank","agentes de inteligencia artificial para la creatividad"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents d''intelligence artificielle","qu''est-ce que l''intelligence artificielle","ReasoningBank vs autres agents d''IA","installation de ReasoningBank","guide de configuration de ReasoningBank","développement d''applications avec ReasoningBank","agents d''intelligence artificielle pour la créativité"],"de":["wie man KI-Agenten verwendet","was ist künstliche Intelligenz","ReasoningBank im Vergleich zu anderen KI-Agents","Installation von ReasoningBank","Konfigurationsanleitung für ReasoningBank","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit ReasoningBank","KI-Agenten für die Kreativität"],"pt":["como usar ReasoningBank","o que é ReasoningBank","agentes de IA avançados","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","ReasoningBank vs outros agentes de IA","instalar ReasoningBank","guia de configuração do ReasoningBank"],"ru":["как использовать ReasoningBank","что такое ReasoningBank","передовые ИИ Агенты","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","ReasoningBank vs другие ИИ Агенты","установить ReasoningBank","руководство по настройке ReasoningBank"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ReasoningBank","ما هو ReasoningBank","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدمين","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","ReasoningBank مقابل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الآخرون","تثبيت ReasoningBank","دليل إعداد ReasoningBank"]}},"owner":"frankxai","repo":"arcanea","repoPath":"frankxai/arcanea","stars":3,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T02:23:41Z","topics":["agents","ai","claude-code","creative-ai","creative-writing","intelligence","mcp","multi-agent","next-js","orchestration","prompts","skills","typescript","vercel-ai-sdk","world-building"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB","description":"Implement ReasoningBank adaptive learning with AgentDBs 150x faster vector database. Includes trajectory tracking, verdict judgment, memory distillation, and pattern recognition. Use when building self-learning agents, optimizing decision-making, or implementing experience replay systems.","bodyPreview":"# ReasoningBank with AgentDB\r\n\r\n## What This Skill Does\r\n\r\nProvides ReasoningBank adaptive learning patterns using AgentDB''s high-performance backend (150x-12,500x faster). Enables agents to learn from experiences, judge outcomes, distill memories, and improve decision-making over time with 100% backward compatibility.\r\n\r\n**Performance**: 150x faster pattern retrieval, 500x faster batch operations, <1ms memory access.\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites\r\n\r\n- Node.js 18+\r\n- AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow)\r\n-","body":"# ReasoningBank with AgentDB\r\n\r\n## What This Skill Does\r\n\r\nProvides ReasoningBank adaptive learning patterns using AgentDB''s high-performance backend (150x-12,500x faster). Enables agents to learn from experiences, judge outcomes, distill memories, and improve decision-making over time with 100% backward compatibility.\r\n\r\n**Performance**: 150x faster pattern retrieval, 500x faster batch operations, <1ms memory access.\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites\r\n\r\n- Node.js 18+\r\n- AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow)\r\n- Understanding of reinforcement learning concepts (optional)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Quick Start with CLI\r\n\r\n### Initialize ReasoningBank Database\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Initialize AgentDB for ReasoningBank\r\nnpx agentdb@latest init ./.agentdb/reasoningbank.db --dimension 1536\r\n\r\n# Start MCP server for Claude Code integration\r\nnpx agentdb@latest mcp\r\nclaude mcp add agentdb npx agentdb@latest mcp\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Migrate from Legacy ReasoningBank\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Automatic migration with validation\r\nnpx agentdb@latest migrate --source .swarm/memory.db\r\n\r\n# Verify migration\r\nnpx agentdb@latest stats ./.agentdb/reasoningbank.db\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Quick Start with API\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nimport { createAgentDBAdapter, computeEmbedding } from ''agentic-flow/reasoningbank'';\r\n\r\n// Initialize ReasoningBank with AgentDB\r\nconst rb = await createAgentDBAdapter({\r\n  dbPath: ''.agentdb/reasoningbank.db'',\r\n  enableLearning: true,      // Enable learning plugins\r\n  enableReasoning: true,      // Enable reasoning agents\r\n  cacheSize: 1000,            // 1000 pattern cache\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Store successful experience\r\nconst query = \"How to optimize database queries?\";\r\nconst embedding = await computeEmbedding(query);\r\n\r\nawait rb.insertPattern({\r\n  id: '''',\r\n  type: ''experience'',\r\n  domain: ''database-optimization'',\r\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\r\n    embedding,\r\n    pattern: {\r\n      query,\r\n      approach: ''indexing + query optimization'',\r\n      outcome: ''success'',\r\n      metrics: { latency_reduction: 0.85 }\r\n    }\r\n  }),\r\n  confidence: 0.95,\r\n  usage_count: 1,\r\n  success_count: 1,\r\n  created_at: Date.now(),\r\n  last_used: Date.now(),\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Retrieve similar experiences with reasoning\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\r\n  domain: ''database-optimization'',\r\n  k: 5,\r\n  useMMR: true,              // Diverse results\r\n  synthesizeContext: true,    // Rich context synthesis\r\n});\r\n\r\nconsole.log(''Memories:'', result.memories);\r\nconsole.log(''Context:'', result.context);\r\nconsole.log(''Patterns:'', result.patterns);\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Core ReasoningBank Concepts\r\n\r\n### 1. Trajectory Tracking\r\n\r\nTrack agent execution paths and outcomes:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// Record trajectory (sequence of actions)\r\nconst trajectory = {\r\n  task: ''optimize-api-endpoint'',\r\n  steps: [\r\n    { action: ''analyze-bottleneck'', result: ''found N+1 query'' },\r\n    { action: ''add-eager-loading'', result: ''reduced queries'' },\r\n    { action: ''add-caching'', result: ''improved latency'' }\r\n  ],\r\n  outcome: ''success'',\r\n  metrics: { latency_before: 2500, latency_after: 150 }\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst embedding = await computeEmbedding(JSON.stringify(trajectory));\r\n\r\nawait rb.insertPattern({\r\n  id: '''',\r\n  type: ''trajectory'',\r\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\r\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({ embedding, pattern: trajectory }),\r\n  confidence: 0.9,\r\n  usage_count: 1,\r\n  success_count: 1,\r\n  created_at: Date.now(),\r\n  last_used: Date.now(),\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 2. Verdict Judgment\r\n\r\nJudge whether a trajectory was successful:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// Retrieve similar past trajectories\r\nconst similar = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\r\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\r\n  k: 10,\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Judge based on similarity to successful patterns\r\nconst verdict = similar.memories.filter(m =>\r\n  m.pattern.outcome === ''success'' &&\r\n  m.similarity > 0.8\r\n).length > 5 ? ''likely_success'' : ''needs_review'';\r\n\r\nconsole.log(''Verdict:'', verdict);\r\nconsole.log(''Confidence:'', similar.memories[0]?.similarity || 0);\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 3. Memory Distillation\r\n\r\nConsolidate similar experiences into patterns:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// Get all experiences in domain\r\nconst experiences = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\r\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\r\n  k: 100,\r\n  optimizeMemory: true,  // Automatic consolidation\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Distill into high-level pattern\r\nconst distilledPattern = {\r\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\r\n  pattern: ''For N+1 queries: add eager loading, then cache'',\r\n  success_rate: 0.92,\r\n  sample_size: experiences.memories.length,\r\n  confidence: 0.95\r\n};\r\n\r\nawait rb.insertPattern({\r\n  id: '''',\r\n  type: ''distilled-pattern'',\r\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\r\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\r\n    embedding: await computeEmbedding(JSON.stringify(distilledPattern)),\r\n    pattern: distilledPattern\r\n  }),\r\n  confidence: 0.95,\r\n  usage_count: 0,\r\n  success_count: 0,\r\n  created_at: Date.now(),\r\n  last_used: Date.now(),\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Integration with Reasoning Agents\r\n\r\nAgentDB provides 4 reasoning modules that enhance ReasoningBank:\r\n\r\n### 1. PatternMatcher\r\n\r\nFind similar successful patterns:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\r\n  domain: ''problem-solving'',\r\n  k: 10,\r\n  useMMR: true,  // Maximal Marginal Relevance for diversity\r\n});\r\n\r\n// PatternMatcher returns diverse, relevant memories\r\nresult.memories.forEach(mem => {\r\n  console.log(`Pattern: ${mem.pattern.approach}`);\r\n  console.log(`Similarity: ${mem.similarity}`);\r\n  console.log(`Success Rate: ${mem.success_count / mem.usage_count}`);\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 2. ContextSynthesizer\r\n\r\nGenerate rich context from multiple memories:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\r\n  domain: ''code-optimization'',\r\n  synthesizeContext: true,  // Enable context synthesis\r\n  k: 5,\r\n});\r\n\r\n// ContextSynthesizer creates coherent narrative\r\nconsole.log(''Synthesized Context:'', result.context);\r\n// \"Based on 5 similar optimizations, the most effective approach\r\n//  involves profiling, identifying bottlenecks, and applying targeted\r\n//  improvements. Success rate: 87%\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 3. MemoryOptimizer\r\n\r\nAutomatically consolidate and prune:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\r\n  domain: ''testing'',\r\n  optimizeMemory: true,  // Enable automatic optimization\r\n});\r\n\r\n// MemoryOptimizer consolidates similar patterns and prunes low-quality\r\nconsole.log(''Optimizations:'', result.optimizations);\r\n// { consolidated: 15, pruned: 3, improved_quality: 0.12 }\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 4. ExperienceCurator\r\n\r\nFilter by quality and relevance:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\r\n  domain: ''debugging'',\r\n  k: 20,\r\n  minConfidence: 0.8,  // Only high-confidence experiences\r\n});\r\n\r\n// ExperienceCurator returns only quality experiences\r\nresult.memories.forEach(mem => {\r\n  console.log(`Confidence: ${mem.confidence}`);\r\n  console.log(`Success Rate: ${mem.success_count / mem.usage_count}`);\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Legacy API Compatibility\r\n\r\nAgentDB maintains 100% backward compatibility with legacy ReasoningBank:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nimport {\r\n  retrieveMemories,\r\n  judgeTrajectory,\r\n  distillMemories\r\n} from ''agentic-flow/reasoningbank'';\r\n\r\n// Legacy API works unchanged (uses AgentDB backend automatically)\r\nconst memories = await retrieveMemories(query, {\r\n  domain: ''code-generation'',\r\n  agent: ''coder''\r\n});\r\n\r\nconst verdict = await judgeTrajectory(trajectory, query);\r\n\r\nconst newMemories = await distillMemories(\r\n  trajectory,\r\n  verdict,\r\n  query,\r\n  { domain: ''code-generation'' }\r\n);\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Performance Characteristics\r\n\r\n- **Pattern Search**: 150x faster (100µs vs 15ms)\r\n- **Memory Retrieval**: <1ms (with cache)\r\n- **Batch Insert**: 500x faster (2ms vs 1s for 100 patterns)\r\n- **Trajectory Judgment**: <5ms (including retrieval + analysis)\r\n- **Memory Distillation**: <50ms (consolidate 100 patterns)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Advanced Patterns\r\n\r\n### Hierarchical Memory\r\n\r\nOrganize memories by abstraction level:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// Low-level: Specific implementation\r\nawait rb.insertPattern({\r\n  type: ''concrete'',\r\n  domain: ''debugging/null-pointer'',\r\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\r\n    embedding,\r\n    pattern: { bug: ''NPE in UserService.getUser()'', fix: ''Add null check'' }\r\n  }),\r\n  confidence: 0.9,\r\n  // ...\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Mid-level: Pattern across similar cases\r\nawait rb.insertPattern({\r\n  type: ''pattern'',\r\n  domain: ''debugging'',\r\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\r\n    embedding,\r\n    pattern: { category: ''null-pointer'', approach: ''defensive-checks'' }\r\n  }),\r\n  confidence: 0.85,\r\n  // ...\r\n});\r\n\r\n// High-level: General principle\r\nawait rb.insertPattern({\r\n  type: ''principle'',\r\n  domain: ''software-engineering'',\r\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\r\n    embedding,\r\n    pattern: { principle: ''fail-fast with clear errors'' }\r\n  }),\r\n  confidence: 0.95,\r\n  // ...\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Multi-Domain Learning\r\n\r\nTransfer learning across domains:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// Learn from backend optimization\r\nconst backendExperience = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\r\n  domain: ''backend-optimization'',\r\n  k: 10,\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Apply to frontend optimization\r\nconst transferredKnowledge = backendExperience.memories.map(mem => ({\r\n  ...mem,\r\n  domain: ''frontend-optimization'',\r\n  adapted: true,\r\n}));\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## CLI Operations\r\n\r\n### Database Management\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Export trajectories and patterns\r\nnpx agentdb@latest export ./.agentdb/reasoningbank.db ./backup.json\r\n\r\n# Import experiences\r\nnpx agentdb@latest import ./experiences.json\r\n\r\n# Get statistics\r\nnpx agentdb@latest stats ./.agentdb/reasoningbank.db\r\n# Shows: total patterns, domains, confidence distribution\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Migration\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Migrate from legacy ReasoningBank\r\nnpx agentdb@latest migrate --source .swarm/memory.db --target .agentdb/reasoningbank.db\r\n\r\n# Validate migration\r\nnpx agentdb@latest stats .agentdb/reasoningbank.db\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Troubleshooting\r\n\r\n### Issue: Migration fails\r\n```bash\r\n# Check source database exists\r\nls -la .swarm/memory.db\r\n\r\n# Run with verbose logging\r\nDEBUG=agentdb:* npx agentdb@latest migrate --source .swarm/memory.db\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Issue: Low confidence scores\r\n```typescript\r\n// Enable context synthesis for better quality\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\r\n  synthesizeContext: true,\r\n  useMMR: true,\r\n  k: 10,\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Issue: Memory growing too large\r\n```typescript\r\n// Enable automatic optimization\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\r\n  optimizeMemory: true,  // Consolidates similar patterns\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Or manually optimize\r\nawait rb.optimize();\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Learn More\r\n\r\n- **AgentDB Integration**: node_modules/agentic-flow/docs/AGENTDB_INTEGRATION.md\r\n- **GitHub**: https://github.com/ruvnet/agentic-flow/tree/main/packages/agentdb\r\n- **MCP Integration**: `npx agentdb@latest mcp`\r\n- **Website**: https://agentdb.ruv.io\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Category**: Machine Learning / Reinforcement Learning\r\n**Difficulty**: Intermediate\r\n**Estimated Time**: 20-30 minutes\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:39:42.384Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents seeking accelerated adaptive learning and decision-making capabilities with Node.js 18+ and AgentDB v1.0.7+","zh":"适用于高级 AI 代理，寻求加速自适应学习和决策能力，搭配 Node.js 18+ 和 AgentDB v1.0.7+","ja":"Node.js 18+ および AgentDB v1.0.7+ を使用した加速された適応型学習および意思決定機能を備えた高度な AI エージェントに適しています","ko":"Node.js 18+ 및 AgentDB v1.0.7+와 함께 가속화된 적응형 학습 및 의사 결정 기능을 갖춘 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avanzados que buscan un aprendizaje adaptativo acelerado y capacidades de toma de decisiones con Node.js 18+ y AgentDB v1.0.7+","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents IA Avancés qui recherchent un apprentissage adaptatif accéléré et des capacités de prise de décision avec Node.js 18+ et AgentDB v1.0.7+","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents, die ein beschleunigtes adaptives Lernen und Entscheidungskapazitäten mit Node.js 18+ und AgentDB v1.0.7+ suchen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados que buscam aprendizado adaptativo acelerado e capacidades de tomada de decisão com Node.js 18+ e AgentDB v1.0.7+","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых агентов ИИ, стремящихся к ускоренному адаптивному обучению и возможностям принятия решений с Node.js 18+ и AgentDB v1.0.7+","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يسعون إلى تعلم وتحسين القرارات المُسرعة مع Node.js 18+ و AgentDB v1.0.7+"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents with 150x faster pattern retrieval and 500x faster batch operations, utilizing AgentDB''s high-performance backend for enhanced judgment and memory distillation, all while maintaining 100% backward compatibility and sub-1ms memory access","zh":"