軟なパーミッション管理","アクセス制御機能","Laravelフレームワーク統合"],"ko":["계층 역할 권한 관리","무한한 계층 레벨의 조직 구조 지원","유연한 권한 관리","접근 제어 기능","Laravel 프레임워크 통합"],"es":["Autenticación jerárquica con niveles organizativos ilimitados","Gestión de acceso y permisos avanzada","Integración con Laravel","Soporte para PHP 8","Código abierto y personalizable"],"fr":["Authentification hiérarchique avec des niveaux organisationnels illimités","Gestion d''accès et de permissions avancée","Intégration avec Laravel","Support pour PHP 8","Code ouvert et personnalisable"],"de":["Hierarchische Authentifizierung mit unbegrenzten Organisationsstufen","Erweiterte Zugriffs- und Berechtigungsverwaltung","Integration mit Laravel","Unterstützung für PHP 8","Open-Source-Code und anpassbar"],"pt":["Controle de acesso baseado em funções","Níveis ilimitados de organizações","Autenticação hierárquica","Integração com Laravel","Permissões personalizáveis","Suporte a PHP 8"],"ru":["Контроль доступа на основе ролей","Неограниченный уровень организаций","Иерархическая авторизация","Интеграция с Laravel","Настраиваемые разрешения","Поддержка PHP 8"],"ar":["سيطرة الوصول القائمة على الأدوار","مستويات غير محدودة من المنظمات","التحكم في الوصول المتدرج","التكامل مع لارافيل","أذونات مخصصة","دعم PHP 8"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Laravel权限管理","层次角色权限","aauth安装","Laravel访问控制","如何使用aauth","aauth教程","Laravel安全","aauth替代品"],"ja":["Laravelパーミッション管理","階層ロールパーミッション","aauthのインストール","Laravelアクセス制御","aauthの使い方","aauthチュートリアル","Laravelのセキュリティ","aauthの代替"],"ko":["Laravel 권한 관리","계층 역할 권한","aauth 설치","Laravel 접근 제어","aauth 사용법","aauth 튜토리얼","Laravel 보안","aauth 대안"],"es":["aauth","autenticación jerárquica","gestión de acceso","permisos en Laravel","cómo usar aauth","alternativas aauth","aauth vs otros paquetes de autenticación","instalación aauth","guía de configuración aauth"],"fr":["aauth","authentification hiérarchique","gestion d''accès","permissions dans Laravel","comment utiliser aauth","alternatives à aauth","aauth vs autres packages d''authentification","installation aauth","guide de configuration aauth"],"de":["aauth","hierarchische Authentifizierung","Zugriffsverwaltung","Berechtigungen in Laravel","wie man aauth verwendet","Alternativen zu aauth","aauth vs andere Authentifizierungspakete","Installation aauth","Konfigurationsanleitung aauth"],"pt":["como usar aauth","o que é autenticação hierárquica","aauth alternativa","aauth vs outros pacotes","instalar aauth","guia de configuração aauth","autenticação laravel","controle de acesso laravel"],"ru":["как использовать aauth","что такое иерархическая авторизация","aauth альтернатива","aauth vs другие пакеты","установить aauth","руководство по настройке aauth","авторизация laravel","контроль доступа laravel"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام aauth","ما هي التحكم في الوصول المتدرج","aauth بديل","aauth مقابل حزم أخرى","تثبيت aauth","دليل إعداد aauth","التحكم في الوصول لارافيل","التحكم في الوصول لارافيل"]}},"owner":"AuroraWebSoftware","repo":"AAuth","repoPath":"AuroraWebSoftware/AAuth","stars":41,"forks":7,"updatedAt":"2026-02-05T11:39:37Z","topics":["abac","access-control","access-management","auth","authentication","authorization","laravel","laravel-framework","laravel-package","permissions","php","php8"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aauth","description":"AAuth Laravel RBAC package implementation assistant","bodyPreview":"# AAuth Implementation Guide\n\nAAuth is a Laravel RBAC package with organization hierarchy and parametric permissions.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ncomposer require aurora-web-software/aauth\n```\n\n```bash\nphp artisan vendor:publish --tag=aauth-config\nphp artisan vendor:publish --tag=aauth-migrations\nphp artisan migrate\n```\n\n## Step 1: Prepare User Model\n\nYour User model must implement `AAuthUserContract`:\n\n```php\n<?php\n\nnamespace App\\Models;\n\nuse AuroraWebSoftware\\AAuth\\Contracts\\AAuthUserContract;\nu","body":"# AAuth Implementation Guide\n\nAAuth is a Laravel RBAC package with organization hierarchy and parametric permissions.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ncomposer require aurora-web-software/aauth\n```\n\n```bash\nphp artisan vendor:publish --tag=aauth-config\nphp artisan vendor:publish --tag=aauth-migrations\nphp artisan migrate\n```\n\n## Step 1: Prepare User Model\n\nYour User model must implement `AAuthUserContract`:\n\n```php\n<?php\n\nnamespace App\\Models;\n\nuse AuroraWebSoftware\\AAuth\\Contracts\\AAuthUserContract;\nuse AuroraWebSoftware\\AAuth\\Traits\\AAuthUser;\nuse Illuminate\\Foundation\\Auth\\User as Authenticatable;\n\nclass User extends Authenticatable implements AAuthUserContract\n{\n    use AAuthUser;\n\n    // Your existing code...\n}\n```\n\n## Step 2: Basic Permission Checks\n\n### In Controllers\n\n```php\nuse AuroraWebSoftware\\AAuth\\Facades\\AAuth;\n\nclass PostController extends Controller\n{\n    public function edit(Post $post)\n    {\n        // Simple permission check\n        if (!AAuth::can(''edit-post'')) {\n            abort(403);\n        }\n\n        return view(''posts.edit'', compact(''post''));\n    }\n\n    public function approve(Post $post)\n    {\n        // Parametric permission - check if user can approve this amount\n        if (!AAuth::can(''approve-budget'', [$post->amount])) {\n            abort(403, ''Budget limit exceeded'');\n        }\n\n        $post->approve();\n        return redirect()->back();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Using passOrAbort (Shortcut)\n\n```php\npublic function edit(Post $post)\n{\n    AAuth::passOrAbort(''edit-post'');\n\n    return view(''posts.edit'', compact(''post''));\n}\n```\n\n## Step 3: Middleware Usage\n\n### Register Middleware (Laravel 11+)\n\n```php\n// bootstrap/app.php\n->withMiddleware(function (Middleware $middleware) {\n    $middleware->alias([\n        ''aauth.permission'' => \\AuroraWebSoftware\\AAuth\\Http\\Middleware\\AAuthPermission::class,\n        ''aauth.role'' => \\AuroraWebSoftware\\AAuth\\Http\\Middleware\\AAuthRole::class,\n    ]);\n})\n```\n\n### Apply to Routes\n\n```php\n// Permission middleware\nRoute::get(''/posts/{post}/edit'', [PostController::class, ''edit''])\n    ->middleware(''aauth.permission:edit-post'');\n\n// Role middleware\nRoute::get(''/admin/dashboard'', [AdminController::class, ''index''])\n    ->middleware(''aauth.role:admin'');\n\n// Multiple permissions\nRoute::resource(''users'', UserController::class)\n    ->middleware(''aauth.permission:manage-users'');\n```\n\n## Step 4: Blade Directives\n\n```blade\n{{-- Show only if user has permission --}}\n@aauth(''edit-post'')\n    <a href=\"{{ route(''posts.edit'', $post) }}\">Edit</a>\n@endaauth\n\n{{-- With parametric permission --}}\n@aauth(''approve-budget'', [1000])\n    <button>Approve</button>\n@endaauth\n```\n\n## Step 5: Role Management\n\n### Create Roles\n\n```php\nuse AuroraWebSoftware\\AAuth\\Models\\Role;\n\n// System role (global, no organization)\n$adminRole = Role::create([\n    ''name'' => ''admin'',\n    ''type'' => ''system'',\n    ''status'' => ''active'',\n]);\n\n// Organization role (tied to organization hierarchy)\n$managerRole = Role::create([\n    ''name'' => ''manager'',\n    ''type'' => ''organization'',\n    ''organization_scope_id'' => $scopeId,\n    ''status'' => ''active'',\n]);\n```\n\n### Assign Permissions to Role\n\n```php\nuse AuroraWebSoftware\\AAuth\\Services\\RolePermissionService;\n\n$service = app(RolePermissionService::class);\n\n// Simple permission\n$service->givePermissionToRole($roleId, ''edit-post'');\n\n// Parametric permission with max value\n$service->givePermissionToRole($roleId, ''approve-budget'', [\n    ''max_amount'' => 5000\n]);\n\n// Parametric permission with allowed values\n$service->givePermissionToRole($roleId, ''manage-department'', [\n    ''departments'' => [''HR'', ''IT'', ''Finance'']\n]);\n```\n\n### Assign Role to User\n\n```php\n$service->attachRoleToUser($user, $roleId, $organizationNodeId);\n```\n\n## Step 6: Organization Hierarchy (Optional)\n\n### Create Organization Scope\n\n```php\nuse AuroraWebSoftware\\AAuth\\Models\\OrganizationScope;\n\n// Define hierarchy levels\nOrganizationScope::create([''name'' => ''Company'', ''level'' => 1]);\nOrganizationScope::create([''name'' => ''Department'', ''level'' => 2]);\nOrganizationScope::create([''name'' => ''Team'', ''level'' => 3]);\n```\n\n### Create Organization Nodes\n\n```php\nuse AuroraWebSoftware\\AAuth\\Models\\OrganizationNode;\n\n// Root node\n$company = OrganizationNode::create([\n    ''name'' => ''Acme Corp'',\n    ''organization_scope_id'' => 1,\n    ''path'' => ''1'',\n]);\n\n// Child nodes\n$hrDept = OrganizationNode::create([\n    ''name'' => ''HR Department'',\n    ''organization_scope_id'' => 2,\n    ''parent_id'' => $company->id,\n    ''path'' => ''1/2'',\n]);\n```\n\n### Query User''s Accessible Nodes\n\n```php\n// Get all accessible organization nodes\n$nodes = AAuth::organizationNodes();\n\n// With query builder for custom filters\n$nodes = AAuth::organizationNodesQuery()\n    ->where(''organization_scope_id'', 2)\n    ->get();\n\n// Check if node is descendant\nif (AAuth::descendant($parentNodeId, $childNodeId)) {\n    // User can access this node\n}\n```\n\n## Step 7: Caching Configuration\n\nEdit `config/aauth-advanced.php`:\n\n```php\n''cache'' => [\n    ''enabled'' => env(''AAUTH_CACHE_ENABLED'', true),\n    ''store'' => env(''AAUTH_CACHE_STORE'', null), // null = default driver\n    ''ttl'' => env(''AAUTH_CACHE_TTL'', 3600),\n    ''prefix'' => env(''AAUTH_CACHE_PREFIX'', ''aauth''),\n],\n```\n\nIn `.env`:\n```\nAAUTH_CACHE_ENABLED=true\nAAUTH_CACHE_STORE=redis\nAAUTH_CACHE_TTL=3600\n```\n\n## Step 8: Super Admin (Optional)\n\nEnable users to bypass all permission checks:\n\n```php\n// config/aauth-advanced.php\n''super_admin'' => [\n    ''enabled'' => env(''AAUTH_SUPER_ADMIN_ENABLED'', true),\n    ''column'' => ''is_super_admin'',\n],\n```\n\nAdd column to users table:\n```php\n$table->boolean(''is_super_admin'')->default(false);\n```\n\n## Common Scenarios\n\n### Scenario 1: Blog with Roles\n\n```php\n// Create roles\n$adminRole = Role::create([''name'' => ''admin'', ''type'' => ''system'', ''status'' => ''active'']);\n$editorRole = Role::create([''name'' => ''editor'', ''type'' => ''system'', ''status'' => ''active'']);\n$authorRole = Role::create([''name'' => ''author'', ''type'' => ''system'', ''status'' => ''active'']);\n\n// Assign permissions\n$service->givePermissionToRole($adminRole->id, ''manage-users'');\n$service->givePermissionToRole($adminRole->id, ''manage-posts'');\n$service->givePermissionToRole($editorRole->id, ''edit-any-post'');\n$service->givePermissionToRole($authorRole->id, ''create-post'');\n$service->givePermissionToRole($authorRole->id, ''edit-own-post'');\n```\n\n### Scenario 2: Multi-Tenant with Budget Limits\n\n```php\n// Department manager can approve up to 10,000\n$service->givePermissionToRole($deptManagerRole->id, ''approve-budget'', [\n    ''max_amount'' => 10000\n]);\n\n// Team lead can approve up to 1,000\n$service->givePermissionToRole($teamLeadRole->id, ''approve-budget'', [\n    ''max_amount'' => 1000\n]);\n\n// In controller\npublic function approvePurchase(Purchase $purchase)\n{\n    if (!AAuth::can(''approve-budget'', [$purchase->amount])) {\n        abort(403, ''Amount exceeds your approval limit'');\n    }\n\n    $purchase->approve();\n}\n```\n\n### Scenario 3: Department-Based Access\n\n```php\n// Give access to specific departments\n$service->givePermissionToRole($roleId, ''view-reports'', [\n    ''departments'' => [''HR'', ''Finance'']\n]);\n\n// Check access\nif (AAuth::can(''view-reports'', [''HR''])) {\n    // Can view HR reports\n}\n```\n\n## Helper Functions\n\n```php\n// Global helper function\nif (aauth_can(''edit-post'')) {\n    // ...\n}\n\n// With parameters\nif (aauth_can(''approve-budget'', [5000])) {\n    // ...\n}\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Permission Not Working\n\n1. **Clear cache**: `php artisan cache:clear`\n2. **Check role has permission**:\n   ```php\n   $role = Role::find($roleId);\n   dd($role->rolePermissions);\n   ```\n3. **Check user has role**:\n   ```php\n   dd($user->roles);\n   ```\n\n### Cache Not Updating\n\n```php\n// Clear AAuth context manually\nAAuth::clearContext();\n\n// Or clear specific cache keys\nCache::forget(''aauth:role:'' . $roleId);\n```\n\n### Super Admin Not Working\n\nCheck your User model has the column:\n```php\ndd($user->is_super_admin);\n```\n\nCheck config is enabled:\n```php\ndd(config(''aauth-advanced.super_admin.enabled''));\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Permission Types\n\n| Type | Role Parameter | Check Example |\n|------|---------------|---------------|\n| Simple | `null` | `AAuth::can(''edit-post'')` |\n| Max Value | `[''max_amount'' => 5000]` | `AAuth::can(''approve-budget'', [3000])` |\n| Boolean | `[''is_admin'' => true]` | `AAuth::can(''admin-access'', [true])` |\n| Allowed Values | `[''depts'' => [''HR'',''IT'']]` | `AAuth::can(''view-dept'', [''HR''])` |\n\n### Essential Methods\n\n| Method | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `AAuth::can($permission, $params)` | Check permission |\n| `AAuth::passOrAbort($permission)` | Check or 403 |\n| `AAuth::currentRole()` | Get active role |\n| `AAuth::switchableRoles()` | Get user''s roles |\n| `AAuth::organizationNodes()` | Get accessible nodes |\n| `AAuth::clearContext()` | Clear cached context |\n\n### Middleware\n\n| Middleware | Usage |\n|------------|-------|\n| `aauth.permission:edit-post` | Check permission |\n| `aauth.role:admin` | Check role name |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T13:09:05.824Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Laravel-based AI Agents requiring advanced role-based access control with hierarchical organization management.","zh":"适用于需要高级基于角色的访问控制和层次组织管理的Laravel-based AI Agents。","ja":"LaravelベースのAIエージェントに適しており、階層的なロールベースのアクセス制御と組織管理が必要です。","ko":"고급 역할 기반 접근 제어 및 계층적 조직 관리가 필요한 Laravel 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Laravel que requieren un control de acceso avanzado basado en roles con gestión de organización jerárquica.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA basés sur Laravel nécessitant un contrôle d''accès avancé basé sur les rôles avec une gestion d''organisation hiérarchique.","de":"Ideal für Laravel-basierte KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte rollenbasierte Zugriffskontrolle mit hierarchischer Organisationsverwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Laravel que exigem controle de acesso baseado em função avançado com gestão de organização hierárquica.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Laravel, требующих расширенного контроля доступа на основе ролей с иерархическим управлением организацией.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستند إلى لارافيل الذي يتطلب التحكم المتقدم في الوصول المستند إلى الدور مع إدارة المنظمة الهيكلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex user permissions and organization hierarchies using Laravel''s RBAC package with parametric permissions, enabling seamless integration with existing Laravel applications via composer and artisan commands.","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂的用户权限和组织层次结构的能力，使用Laravel的RBAC包和参数权限，使得与现有Laravel应用程序的集成变得无缝，通过composer和artisan命令。","ja":"LaravelのRBACパッケージとパラメトリックな権限を使用して、エージェントが複雑なユーザーの権限と組織の階層構造を管理できるようにし、composerとartisanコマンドを介して既存のLaravelアプリケーションとのシームレスな統合を可能にします。","ko":"Laravel의 RBAC 패키지 및 매개 변수 권한을 사용하여 에이전트가 복잡한 사용자 권한 및 조직 계층 구조를 관리할 수 있도록 하여 컴포저 및 아티산命令을 통해 기존 Laravel 애플리케이션과 무결점 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar permisos de usuario complejos y jerarquías de organización utilizando el paquete RBAC de Laravel con permisos paramétricos, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con aplicaciones Laravel existentes a través de composer y comandos de artisan.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des autorisations d''utilisateur complexes et des hiérarchies d''organisation en utilisant le package RBAC de Laravel avec des autorisations paramétriques, ce qui permet une intégration transparente avec les applications Laravel existantes via composer et des commandes d''artisan.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, komplexe Benutzerberechtigungen und Organisationshierarchien mithilfe des Laravel-RBAC-Pakets mit parametrischen Berechtigungen zu verwalten, was eine nahtlose Integration mit bestehenden Laravel-Anwendungen über Composer und Artisan-Befehle ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar permissões de usuário complexas e hierarquias de organização usando o pacote RBAC do Laravel com permissões paramétricas, permitindo integração perfeita com aplicativos Laravel existentes via composer e comandos artisan.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность управлять сложными разрешениями пользователей и иерархиями организаций с помощью пакета RBAC Laravel с параметрическими разрешениями, что позволяет обеспечить бесшовную интеграцию с существующими приложениями Laravel через composer и команды artisan.","ar":"تمكن العميل من إدارة صلاحيات المستخدم المعقدة وهيراركية المنظمة باستخدام حزمة RBAC من لارافيل مع صلاحيات متغيرة، مما يتيح دمجًا مثاليًا مع تطبيقات لارافيل الحالية عبر كومبوزر وأوامر أرتيسان."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing hierarchical role-based access control","Managing organization hierarchies with limitless levels","Assigning parametric permissions to users"],"zh":["实现层次化的基于角色的访问控制","管理组织层次结构，具有无限级别","将参数权限分配给用户"],"ja":["階層的なロールベースのアクセス制御の実装","組織の階層構造の管理、無限のレベル","ユーザーへのパラメトリックな権限の割り当て"],"ko":["계층적인 역할 기반 접근 제어의 구현","조직의 계층 구조 관리, 무한의 수준","사용자에게 매개 변수 권한 할당"],"es":["Implementación de un control de acceso basado en roles jerárquicos","Gestión de jerarquías de organización con niveles ilimitados","Asignación de permisos paramétricos a los usuarios"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''un contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles hiérarchiques","Gestion des hiérarchies d''organisation avec des niveaux illimités","Attribution d''autorisations paramétriques aux utilisateurs"],"de":["Implementierung einer rollenbasierten Zugriffskontrolle mit hierarchischer Organisation","Verwaltung von Organisationshierarchien mit unbegr