m Node.js","Desenvolvimento em Python","Interface de linha de comando (CLI)","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de e-mail"],"ru":["Автоматизация памяти","Интеграция с Node.js","Разработка на Python","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI)","Поддержка нескольких форматов электронной почты"],"ar":["توفير الذاكرة التلقائية","التكامل مع Node.js","التطوير باستخدام Python","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI)","دعم عدة صيغ للبريد الإلكتروني"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","email-summary","自动化内存系统","如何使用email-summary","email-summary安装","email-summary设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","email-summary","自動化されたメモリシステム","email-summaryの使い方","email-summaryのインストール","email-summaryの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","email-summary","자동화된 메모리 시스템","email-summary 사용 방법","email-summary 설치","email-summary 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA","qué es un resumen de correo electrónico","Agentes de IA para correo electrónico","alternativas a los resúmenes de correo electrónico","instalación de Agentes de IA","guía de configuración de Agentes de IA","uso de Python para el resumen de correo electrónico","uso de Node.js para el resumen de correo electrónico"],"fr":["comment utiliser les Outils d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un résumé de courriel","Outils d''IA pour le courrier électronique","alternatives aux résumés de courriel","installation des Outils d''IA","guide de configuration des Outils d''IA","utilisation de Python pour le résumé de courriel","utilisation de Node.js pour le résumé de courriel"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist eine E-Mail-Zusammenfassung","KI-Agents für E-Mail","Alternativen zu E-Mail-Zusammenfassungen","Installation von KI-Agents","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Agents","Verwendung von Python für die E-Mail-Zusammenfassung","Verwendung von Node.js für die E-Mail-Zusammenfassung"],"pt":["como usar email-summary","o que é email-summary","ferramentas de IA para automação","email-summary vs outros agentes","instalar email-summary","guia de configuração do email-summary"],"ru":["как использовать email-summary","что такое email-summary","инструменты ИИ для автоматизации","email-summary vs другие агенты","установить email-summary","руководство по настройке email-summary"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام برنامج email-summary","ما هو برنامج email-summary","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتحكم الآلي","برنامج email-summary مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت برنامج email-summary","دليل إعداد برنامج email-summary"]}},"owner":"johncarpenter","repo":"knowledge-base","repoPath":"johncarpenter/knowledge-base","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-12T17:37:57Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"email-summary","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Email Summary — Gmail & Exchange Integration\n\nSummarize emails from configured Gmail and Exchange accounts, categorize them by action type, and save to a local markdown file in `operations/emails/`.\n\n## Available MCP Tools\n\n### Gmail Tools\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `mcp__gmail__gmail_list_accounts` | List configured Gmail accounts |\n| `mcp__gmail__gmail_search` | Search emails with Gmail query syntax |\n| `mcp__gmail__gmail_get_thread` | Get full email thread by ID |\n| `mcp__gmail__gmail_s","body":"# Email Summary — Gmail & Exchange Integration\n\nSummarize emails from configured Gmail and Exchange accounts, categorize them by action type, and save to a local markdown file in `operations/emails/`.\n\n## Available MCP Tools\n\n### Gmail Tools\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `mcp__gmail__gmail_list_accounts` | List configured Gmail accounts |\n| `mcp__gmail__gmail_search` | Search emails with Gmail query syntax |\n| `mcp__gmail__gmail_get_thread` | Get full email thread by ID |\n| `mcp__gmail__gmail_summarize` | Get thread content formatted for summarization |\n\n### Exchange Tools\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `mcp__exchange__exchange_list_accounts` | List configured Exchange accounts |\n| `mcp__exchange__exchange_search` | Search emails with KQL syntax |\n| `mcp__exchange__exchange_get_message` | Get full message details |\n| `mcp__exchange__exchange_get_thread` | Get conversation thread |\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Determine Time Period\n\nAsk the user for the date range if not specified. Common patterns:\n- \"today\" → current date\n- \"yesterday\" → previous day\n- \"this week\" → Monday to today\n- \"last week\" → previous Monday to Sunday\n- \"last 7 days\" → rolling 7 days\n- Custom range: \"from YYYY-MM-DD to YYYY-MM-DD\"\n\n### 2. List Available Accounts\n\n```\nmcp__gmail__gmail_list_accounts()\nmcp__exchange__exchange_list_accounts()\n```\n\nPresent the list and confirm which accounts to include (default: all).\n\n### 3. Fetch Emails\n\n**Gmail** (use date query syntax):\n```\nmcp__gmail__gmail_search(account=\"<name>\", query=\"after:2026/01/01 before:2026/01/08\", max_results=50, include_body=true)\n```\n\n**Exchange** (use KQL syntax):\n```\nmcp__exchange__exchange_search(account=\"<name>\", query=\"received:2026-01-01..2026-01-07\", max_results=50, include_body=true)\n```\n\n### 4. Categorize Each Email\n\nReview each email and assign to ONE category:\n\n| Category | Criteria | Examples |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Tasks** | Explicit action required, assignments, deadlines | \"Please complete by Friday\", \"Action required\", task assignments |\n| **Response Needed** | Awaiting your reply, questions directed at you | Direct questions, meeting requests pending response, approval requests |\n| **Informational** | FYI, newsletters, updates, notifications | Status updates, automated notifications, newsletters, announcements |\n| **Other** | Doesn''t fit above categories | Spam, promotional, unclear intent |\n\n### 5. Generate Summary Document\n\n**Filename convention:** `YYYY-MM-DD-email-summary.md` (use end date of range)\n\n**Output location:** `operations/emails/`\n\n**Markdown format:**\n\n```markdown\n# Email Summary: [Start Date] to [End Date]\n\n**Generated:** YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\n**Accounts:** account1, account2, account3\n**Total Emails:** N\n\n---\n\n## Tasks That Need To Be Done\n\n| Source | From | Subject | Date | Details |\n|--------|------|---------|------|---------|\n| Gmail/Exchange | sender@example.com | Subject line | YYYY-MM-DD | Brief description of task required |\n\n### Task Details\n\n#### [Subject Line]\n- **From:** sender@example.com\n- **Date:** YYYY-MM-DD\n- **Account:** Gmail (account-name) / Exchange (account-name)\n- **Action Required:** [Clear description of what needs to be done]\n- **Deadline:** [If mentioned]\n\n---\n\n## Response Needed\n\n| Source | From | Subject | Date | Details |\n|--------|------|---------|------|---------|\n| Gmail/Exchange | sender@example.com | Subject line | YYYY-MM-DD | What response is needed |\n\n### Response Details\n\n#### [Subject Line]\n- **From:** sender@example.com\n- **Date:** YYYY-MM-DD\n- **Account:** Gmail (account-name) / Exchange (account-name)\n- **Question/Request:** [What they''re asking]\n\n---\n\n## Informational\n\n| Source | From | Subject | Date | Summary |\n|--------|------|---------|------|---------|\n| Gmail/Exchange | sender@example.com | Subject line | YYYY-MM-DD | One-line summary |\n\n---\n\n## Other\n\n| Source | From | Subject | Date | Notes |\n|--------|------|---------|------|-------|\n| Gmail/Exchange | sender@example.com | Subject line | YYYY-MM-DD | Why categorized here |\n\n---\n\n## Statistics\n\n- **Tasks:** N emails\n- **Response Needed:** N emails\n- **Informational:** N emails\n- **Other:** N emails\n```\n\n### 6. Save and Confirm\n\nWrite the file to `operations/emails/YYYY-MM-DD-email-summary.md` and confirm the path to the user.\n\n## Date Query Reference\n\n### Gmail Query Syntax\n- `after:YYYY/MM/DD` — emails after date\n- `before:YYYY/MM/DD` — emails before date\n- `newer_than:7d` — last 7 days\n- `older_than:1d` — older than 1 day\n\n### Exchange KQL Syntax\n- `received:YYYY-MM-DD` — specific date\n- `received:YYYY-MM-DD..YYYY-MM-DD` — date range\n- `received>=YYYY-MM-DD` — on or after date\n\n## Tips\n\n- **Large volumes:** If >50 emails, summarize in batches and combine.\n- **Priority emails:** Check `importance:high` (Exchange) or `is:important` (Gmail) first.\n- **Thread context:** Use `gmail_get_thread` or `exchange_get_thread` for full conversation context when categorization is unclear.\n- **Deduplication:** Emails may appear in multiple searches; dedupe by message ID.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- Account not found → Run list accounts and verify configuration.\n- No emails in range → Confirm date format and expand range.\n- MCP not connected → Check MCP server configuration.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:11:43.306Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Email Analysis Agents requiring automated email summarization and categorization capabilities for Gmail and Exchange accounts","zh":"适合需要自动化电子邮件摘要和分类功能的电子邮件分析代理，支持Gmail和Exchange账户","ja":"GmailおよびExchangeアカウントに対する自動化された電子メールの要約と分類機能を必要とするメール分析エージェントに最適","ko":"Gmail 및 Exchange 계정에 대한 자동화된 이메일 요약 및 분류 기능을 필요로 하는 이메일 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Correo Electrónico que requieren capacidades de resumen y categorización de correo electrónico automatizadas para cuentas de Gmail y Exchange","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Courriels nécessitant des capacités de résumé et de catégorisation de courriels automatisées pour les comptes Gmail et Exchange","de":"Ideal für E-Mail-Analyse-Agents, die automatisierte E-Mail-Zusammenfassungs- und Kategorisierungsfunktionen für Gmail- und Exchange-Konten erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de E-mail que exigem capacidades de resumo e categorização de e-mails automatizadas para contas do Gmail e Exchange","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа электронной почты, требующих автоматизированных возможностей суммирования и категоризации электронной почты для учетных записей Gmail и Exchange","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل البريد الإلكتروني التي تتطلب قدرات تلخيص وتصنيف البريد الإلكتروني أتمتة ل حسابات الجيميل و اكسشنج"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to summarize emails using Gmail query syntax, categorize them by action type, and save to local markdown files, leveraging tools like `mcp__gmail__gmail_search` and `mcp__gmail__gmail_get_thread` for advanced email analysis","zh":"赋予代理使用Gmail查询语法对电子邮件进行总结，按操作类型对其进行分类，并将其保存到本地markdown文件中，利用像`mcp__gmail__gmail_search`和`mcp__gmail__gmail_get_thread`的工具进行高级电子邮件分析","ja":"Gmailクエリ構文を使用して電子メールを要約し、操作タイプ別に電子メールを分類し、ローカルのMarkdownファイルに保存するようにエージェントに権限を与え、`mcp__gmail__gmail_search`や`mcp__gmail__gmail_get_thread`などのツールを使用して高度な電子メール分析を実行","ko":"Gmail 쿼리 구문을 사용하여 이메일을 요약하고, 작업 유형별로 이메일을 분류하고, 로컬 Markdown 파일에 저장할 수 있도록 에이전트에 권한을 부여하며, `mcp__gmail__gmail_search` 및 `mcp__gmail__gmail_get_thread`와 같은 도구를 사용하여 고급 이메일 분석을 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a resumir correos electrónicos utilizando la sintaxis de consulta de Gmail, categorizarlos por tipo de acción y guardarlos en archivos markdown locales, aprovechando herramientas como `mcp__gmail__gmail_search` y `mcp__gmail__gmail_get_thread` para un análisis de correo electrónico avanzado","fr":"Permet aux agents de résumer les courriels en utilisant la syntaxe de requête Gmail, de les catégoriser par type d''action et de les enregistrer dans des fichiers markdown locaux, en exploitant des outils tels que `mcp__gmail__gmail_search` et `mcp__gmail__gmail_get_thread` pour une analyse de courriel avancée","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, E-Mails mithilfe der Gmail-Abfragesyntax zusammenzufassen, nach Aktionstyp zu kategorisieren und in lokale Markdown-Dateien zu speichern, indem es Tools wie `mcp__gmail__gmail_search` und `mcp__gmail__gmail_get_thread` für eine erweiterte E-Mail-Analyse nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a resumir e-mails usando a sintaxe de consulta do Gmail, categorizá-los por tipo de ação e salvá-los em arquivos markdown locais, aproveitando ferramentas como `mcp__gmail__gmail_search` e `mcp__gmail__gmail_get_thread` para análise de e-mails avançada","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью суммировать электронные письма с использованием синтаксиса запросов Gmail, категоризировать их по типу действия и сохранять в локальные файлы markdown, используя инструменты seperti `mcp__gmail__gmail_search` и `mcp__gmail__gmail_get_thread` для расширенного анализа электронной почты","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تلخيص البريد الإلكتروني باستخدام بناء جملة استعلام الجيميل، وتصنيفها حسب نوع الإجراء وحفظها في ملفات ماركداون محلية، واستخدام أدوات مثل `mcp__gmail__gmail_search` و `mcp__gmail__gmail_get_thread` للتحليل المتقدم للبريد الإلكتروني"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating email summaries for multiple Gmail accounts","Categorizing emails by action type for prioritized responses","Generating local markdown files for email archives"],"zh":["自动为多个Gmail账户生成电子邮件摘要","按操作类型对电子邮件进行分类以实现优先响应","生成本地Markdown文件以存档电子邮件"],"ja":["複数のGmailアカウントに対する電子メールの自動要約","操作タイプ別の電子メールの分類による優先対応","電子メールアーカイブ用のローカルのMarkdownファイルの生成"],"ko":["여러 개의 Gmail 계정에 대한 자동 이메일 요약","작업 유형별로 이메일을 분류하여 우선 응답","이메일 아카이브를 위한 로컬 Markdown 파일 생성"],"es":["Automatizar resúmenes de correo electrónico para varias cuentas de Gmail","Categorizar correos electrónicos por tipo de acción para respuestas priorizadas","Generar archivos markdown locales para archivos de correo electrónico"],"fr":["Automatiser les résumés de courriels pour plusieurs comptes Gmail","Catégoriser les courriels par type d''action pour des réponses priorisées","Générer des fichiers markdown locaux pour les archives de courriels"],"de":["Automatisieren von E-Mail-Zusammenfassungen für mehrere Gmail-Konten","Kategorisieren von E-Mails nach Aktionstyp für priorisierte Antworten","Erstellen von lokalen Markdown-Dateien für E-Mail-Archive"],"pt":["Automatizar resumos de e-mails para várias contas do Gmail","Categorizar e-mails por tipo de ação para respostas priorizadas","Gerar arquivos markdown locais para arquivos de e-mails"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сводки электронной почты для нескольких учетных записей Gmail","Категоризировать электронные письма по типу действия для приоритизированных ответов","Генерировать локальные файлы markdown для архивов электронной почты"],"ar":["أتمتة تلخيص البريد الإلكتروني لمнож　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　ت　　　　　　　　　　　حسابات الجيميل","تصنيف البريد الإلكتروني حسب نوع الإجراء لأجـل الردود الموضوعة بالاولوية","إيجاد ملفات ماركداون محلية لأرشيف البريد الإلكتروني"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires configured Gmail and Exchange accounts","Limited to Gmail and Exchange email services","Needs local file system access for saving markdown files"],"zh":["需要配置Gmail和Exchange账户","仅限于Gmail和Exchange电子邮件服务","需要本地文件系统访问权限以保存Markdown文件"],"ja":["GmailおよびExchangeアカウントの設定が必要","GmailおよびExchangeの電子メールサービスのみに対応","Markdownファイルを保存するためにローカルファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Gmail 및 Exchange 계정 설정이 필요","Gmail 및 Exchange 이메일 서비스만 지원","Markdown 파일을 저장하기 위해 로컬 파일 시스템에 대한 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere cuentas de Gmail y Exchange configuradas","Limitado a los servicios de correo electrónico de Gmail y Exchange","Necesita acceso al sistema de archivos local para guardar archivos markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite des comptes Gmail et Exchange configurés","Limité aux services de courriel Gmail et Exchange","Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers local pour enregistrer des fichiers markdown"],"de":["Benötigt konfigurierte Gmail- und Exchange-Konten","Begrenzt auf die E-Mail-Dienste von Gmail und Exchange","Benötigt Zugriff auf das lokale Dateisystem zum Speichern von Markdown-Dateien"],"pt":["Exige contas do Gmail e Exchange configuradas","Limitado a serviços de e-mail do Gmail e Exchange","Necessita acesso ao sistema de arquivos local para salvar arquivos markdown"],"ru":["Требует настроенных учетных записей Gmail и Exchange","Ограничен сервисами электронной почты Gmail и Exchange","Требует доступа к локальной файловой системе для сохранения файлов markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب حسابات جيميل واكسشنج مفكوكة","محدود بخدمات البريد الإلكتروني من الجيميل و اكسشنج","يحتاج إلى وصول إلى نظام الملفات المحلي لحفظ ملفات ماركداون"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"960566a6b8a6430fae275eb29183b95c06caf6d3d9c3f1ed8d9bff698f50a8ff","qualityScore":34}');
