 de Navegador Cloudflare","ru":"Контроль браузера Cloudflare","ar":"تحكم متصفح Cloudflare","en":"cloudflare-browser"},"description":{"zh":"Cloudflare 浏览器渲染控制允许您使用 Chrome DevTools Protocol 进行浏览器渲染控制","ja":"Cloudflare ブラウザレンダリング制御は、Chrome DevTools Protocol を使用したブラウザレンダリング制御を可能にします","ko":"클라우드플레어 브라우저 렌더링 제어는 크롬 개발자 도구 프로토콜을 사용한 브라우저 렌더링 제어를 허용합니다","es":"El servicio de renderizado de Cloudflare permite controlar navegadores headless mediante CDP. Configure su entorno con OpenClaw y Cloudflare Workers.","fr":"Le service de rendu de Cloudflare permet de contrôler les navigateurs headless via CDP. Configurez votre environnement avec OpenClaw et Cloudflare Workers.","de":"Der Cloudflare-Renderdienst ermöglicht die Steuerung von headless-Browsern über CDP. Konfigurieren Sie Ihre Umgebung mit OpenClaw und Cloudflare Workers.","pt":"O Cloudflare Browser Rendering permite controlar navegadores headless via CDP e WebSocket. Configure seu ambiente com OpenClaw e Cloudflare Workers","ru":"Сервис рендеринга браузера Cloudflare позволяет контролировать безголовые браузеры через CDP и WebSocket. Настройте свою среду с OpenClaw и Cloudflare Workers","ar":"خدمة عرض المتصفح من Cloudflare تسمح بالتحكم في المتصفحات بدون رأس عبر CDP و WebSocket. قم بتكوين بيئتك مع OpenClaw و Cloudflare Workers","en":"Run OpenClaw, (formerly Moltbot, formerly Clawdbot) on Cloudflare Workers"},"definition":{"en":"Run OpenClaw, (formerly Moltbot, formerly Clawdbot) on Cloudflare Workers"},"features":{"zh":["使用 Cloudflare Workers 运行 OpenClaw","支持 Chrome DevTools Protocol","通过 WebSocket 进行浏览器渲染控制","配置浏览器(profile)以使用 Cloudflare 浏览器渲染服务","支持环境变量 CDP_SECRET"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workers で OpenClaw を実行","Chrome DevTools Protocol をサポート","WebSocket を使用したブラウザレンダリング制御","ブラウザ(profile)を Cloudflare ブラウザレンダリングサービスで使用するように設定","環境変数 CDP_SECRET をサポート"],"ko":["클라우드플레어 워커에서 오픈클로를 실행","크롬 개발자 도구 프로토콜을 지원","웹소켓을 사용한 브라우저 렌더링 제어","브라우저(프로파일)을 클라우드플레어 브라우저 렌더링 서비스에서 사용하도록 설정","환경 변수 CDP_SECRET를 지원"],"es":["Control de navegadores headless","Integración con Cloudflare Workers","Uso de CDP para la comunicación","Configuración de perfiles de navegador en OpenClaw","Soporte para WebSocket"],"fr":["Contrôle des navigateurs headless","Intégration avec Cloudflare Workers","Utilisation de CDP pour la communication","Configuration des profils de navigateur dans OpenClaw","Prise en charge de WebSocket"],"de":["Steuerung von headless-Browsern","Integration mit Cloudflare Workers","Verwendung von CDP für die Kommunikation","Konfiguration von Browser-Profilen in OpenClaw","Unterstützung für WebSocket"],"pt":["Controle de navegadores headless via CDP","Integração com Cloudflare Workers","Suporte a WebSocket","Configuração de perfis de navegador com OpenClaw","Geração de screenshots"],"ru":["Контроль безголовых браузеров через CDP","Интеграция с Cloudflare Workers","Поддержка WebSocket","Настройка профилей браузера с OpenClaw","Генерация скриншотов"],"ar":["التحكم في المتصفحات بدون رأس عبر CDP","التكامل مع Cloudflare Workers","دعم WebSocket","تكوين ملفات تعريف المتصفح مع OpenClaw","генерация لقطات الشاشة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare Workers","OpenClaw","浏览器渲染控制","Chrome DevTools Protocol","WebSocket","CDP_SECRET","浏览器(profile)"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workers","OpenClaw","ブラウザレンダリング制御","Chrome DevTools Protocol","WebSocket","CDP_SECRET","ブラウザ(profile)"],"ko":["클라우드플레어 워커","오픈클로","브라우저 렌더링 제어","크롬 개발자 도구 프로토콜","웹소켓","CDP_SECRET","브라우저(프로파일)"],"es":["Cloudflare Browser","headless browser","Cloudflare Workers","CDP","OpenClaw","renderizado de navegador","navegadores headless"],"fr":["Cloudflare Browser","navigateur headless","Cloudflare Workers","CDP","OpenClaw","rendu de navigateur","navigateurs headless"],"de":["Cloudflare Browser","headless Browser","Cloudflare Workers","CDP","OpenClaw","Browser-Renderdienst","headless-Browser"],"pt":["Cloudflare Browser Rendering","CDP","WebSocket","OpenClaw","Cloudflare Workers","navegadores headless","renderização de navegador"],"ru":["Сервис рендеринга браузера Cloudflare","CDP","WebSocket","OpenClaw","Cloudflare Workers","безголовые браузеры","рендеринг браузера"],"ar":["خدمة عرض المتصفح من Cloudflare","CDP","WebSocket","OpenClaw","Cloudflare Workers","المتصفحات بدون رأس","عرض المتصفح"]}},"owner":"cloudflare","repo":"moltworker","repoPath":"cloudflare/moltworker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.879Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloudflare-browser","description":"Control headless Chrome via Cloudflare Browser Rendering CDP WebSocket. Use for screenshots, page navigation, scraping, and video capture when browser automation is needed in a Cloudflare Workers environment. Requires CDP_SECRET env var and cdpUrl configured in browser.profiles.","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Browser Rendering\n\nControl headless browsers via Cloudflare''s Browser Rendering service using CDP (Chrome DevTools Protocol) over WebSocket.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `CDP_SECRET` environment variable set\n- Browser profile configured in openclaw.json with `cdpUrl` pointing to the worker endpoint:\n  ```json\n  \"browser\": {\n    \"profiles\": {\n      \"cloudflare\": {\n        \"cdpUrl\": \"https://your-worker.workers.dev/cdp?secret=...\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Screenshot\n```bas","body":"# Cloudflare Browser Rendering\n\nControl headless browsers via Cloudflare''s Browser Rendering service using CDP (Chrome DevTools Protocol) over WebSocket.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `CDP_SECRET` environment variable set\n- Browser profile configured in openclaw.json with `cdpUrl` pointing to the worker endpoint:\n  ```json\n  \"browser\": {\n    \"profiles\": {\n      \"cloudflare\": {\n        \"cdpUrl\": \"https://your-worker.workers.dev/cdp?secret=...\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Screenshot\n```bash\nnode /path/to/skills/cloudflare-browser/scripts/screenshot.js https://example.com output.png\n```\n\n### Multi-page Video\n```bash\nnode /path/to/skills/cloudflare-browser/scripts/video.js \"https://site1.com,https://site2.com\" output.mp4\n```\n\n## CDP Connection Pattern\n\nThe worker creates a page target automatically on WebSocket connect. Listen for Target.targetCreated event to get the targetId:\n\n```javascript\nconst WebSocket = require(''ws'');\nconst CDP_SECRET = process.env.CDP_SECRET;\nconst WS_URL = `wss://your-worker.workers.dev/cdp?secret=${encodeURIComponent(CDP_SECRET)}`;\n\nconst ws = new WebSocket(WS_URL);\nlet targetId = null;\n\nws.on(''message'', (data) => {\n  const msg = JSON.parse(data.toString());\n  if (msg.method === ''Target.targetCreated'' && msg.params?.targetInfo?.type === ''page'') {\n    targetId = msg.params.targetInfo.targetId;\n  }\n});\n```\n\n## Key CDP Commands\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| Page.navigate | Navigate to URL |\n| Page.captureScreenshot | Capture PNG/JPEG |\n| Runtime.evaluate | Execute JavaScript |\n| Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride | Set viewport size |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Navigate and Screenshot\n```javascript\nawait send(''Page.navigate'', { url: ''https://example.com'' });\nawait new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 3000)); // Wait for render\nconst { data } = await send(''Page.captureScreenshot'', { format: ''png'' });\nfs.writeFileSync(''out.png'', Buffer.from(data, ''base64''));\n```\n\n### Scroll Page\n```javascript\nawait send(''Runtime.evaluate'', { expression: ''window.scrollBy(0, 300)'' });\n```\n\n### Set Viewport\n```javascript\nawait send(''Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride'', {\n  width: 1280,\n  height: 720,\n  deviceScaleFactor: 1,\n  mobile: false\n});\n```\n\n## Creating Videos\n\n1. Capture frames as PNGs during navigation\n2. Use ffmpeg to stitch: `ffmpeg -framerate 10 -i frame_%04d.png -c:v libx264 -pix_fmt yuv420p output.mp4`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **No target created**: Race condition - wait for Target.targetCreated event with timeout\n- **Commands timeout**: Worker may have cold start delay; increase timeout to 30-60s\n- **WebSocket hangs**: Verify CDP_SECRET matches worker configuration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:06.807Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Automation Agents needing headless browser control via Cloudflare Workers and Chrome DevTools Protocol","zh":"非常适合需要通过Cloudflare Workers和Chrome DevTools Protocol进行无头浏览器控制的Web自动化代理","ja":"Cloudflare WorkersおよびChrome DevTools Protocolを介したヘッドレスブラウザ制御を必要とするWeb自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"Cloudflare Workers 및 Chrome DevTools Protocol을 통해 헤드리스 브라우저 제어가 필요한 웹 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización web que necesitan control de navegador headless a través de Cloudflare Workers y Chrome DevTools Protocol","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation web nécessitant un contrôle de navigateur headless via Cloudflare Workers et Chrome DevTools Protocol","de":"Perfekt für Web-Automations-Agents, die eine headless-Browser-Steuerung über Cloudflare Workers und Chrome DevTools Protocol benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação da Web que necessitam de controle de navegador headless via Cloudflare Workers e Protocolo Chrome DevTools","ru":"Идеально подходит для веб-агентов, автоматизации, требующих управления безголовым браузером через Cloudflare Workers и Chrome DevTools Protocol","ar":"مثالي لعميل التutomatiوn الويب الذي يحتاج إلى تحكم متصفح بدون رأس عبر Cloudflare Workers و بروتوكول Chrome DevTools"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to control headless browsers over WebSocket using CDP, enabling advanced web automation and rendering capabilities with Cloudflare''s Browser Rendering service, configured through openclaw.json and utilizing environment variables like CDP_SECRET","zh":"赋予代理通过WebSocket使用CDP控制无头浏览器的能力，实现高级的网页自动化和渲染能力，利用Cloudflare的浏览器渲染服务，通过openclaw.json配置，并使用环境变量如CDP_SECRET","ja":"エージェントがWebSocketを使用してCDPでヘッドレスブラウザを制御する機能を提供し、CloudflareのBrowser Renderingサービスを使用して高度なWeb自動化およびレンダリング機能を実現する。openclaw.jsonで構成し、CDP_SECRETなどの環境変数を使用する","ko":"에이전트가 WebSocket을 사용하여 CDP로 헤드리스 브라우저를 제어할 수 있는 기능을 제공하