ストなマルチエージェントオーケストレーション","ワークフローとタスク管理の自動化","開発効率の向上","Claude Code開発のサポート","開発プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["팀 우선의 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션","작업 흐름과 작업 관리의 자동화","개발 효율성의 향상","Claude Code 개발의 지원","개발 프로세스의 간소화"],"es":["Orquestación de agentes para Claude Code","Mejora la colaboración en equipo","Solución de código para desarrolladores","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Automatización de tareas y flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["Orchestration multi-agents pour Claude Code","Amélioration de la collaboration d''équipe","Solution de code pour les développeurs","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Automatisation des tâches et des flux de travail"],"de":["Orchestrierung von Multi-Agenten für Claude Code","Verbesserung der Teamzusammenarbeit","Code-Lösung für Entwickler","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Automatisierung von Aufgaben und Workflows"],"pt":["Orquestração de agentes de IA para Claude Code","Integração com equipes para melhorar a produtividade","Gerenciamento de agentes de IA para tarefas complexas","Suporte a múltiplos agentes de IA","Interface de usuário intuitiva para configuração e gerenciamento"],"ru":["Мультиагентная оркестрация для Claude Code","Интеграция с командами для повышения производительности","Управление ИИ Агентами для сложных задач","Поддержка нескольких ИИ Агентов","Интуитивный интерфейс для конфигурации и управления"],"ar":["إدارة الوحدات المتعددة لآي كلود كود","التكامل مع الفرق لتحسين الإنتاجية","إدارة وحدات آي كي للمهام المعقدة","دعم وحدات آي كي متعددة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام لإعداد والإدارة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Ultrawork","什么是团队优先的多智能体编排","Ultrawork替代品","Ultrawork与竞争对手的比较","Ultrawork安装","Ultrawork设置指南","AI智能代理","Claude Code开发"],"ja":["Ultraworkの使い方","チームファーストなマルチエージェントオーケストレーションとは","Ultraworkの代替","Ultraworkと競合製品の比較","Ultraworkのインストール","Ultraworkの設定ガイド","AIエージェント","Claude Code開発"],"ko":["Ultrawork 사용 방법","팀 우선의 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션이란","Ultrawork 대체","Ultrawork와 경쟁 제품 비교","Ultrawork 설치","Ultrawork 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","Claude Code 개발"],"es":["herramientas de ai","orquestación de agentes","desarrollo de código","colaboración en equipo","ultrawork alternativa","instalación de ultrawork","guía de configuración de ultrawork","qué es ultrawork","cómo usar ultrawork"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","orchestration multi-agents","développement de code","collaboration d''équipe","alternative à ultrawork","installation d''ultrawork","guide de configuration d''ultrawork","qu''est-ce qu''ultrawork","comment utiliser ultrawork"],"de":["künstliche intelligenz tools","multi-agenten-orchestrierung","code-entwicklung","teamzusammenarbeit","ultrawork alternative","ultrawork installation","ultrawork konfigurationshandbuch","was ist ultrawork","wie verwendet man ultrawork"],"pt":["orquestração de agentes de IA","como usar Ultrawork","o que é Ultrawork","Ultrawork vs outros agentes de IA","instalar Ultrawork","guia de configuração do Ultrawork","desenvolvimento de agentes de IA com Ultrawork","equipes de desenvolvimento de IA","ferramentas de IA para equipes"],"ru":["Мультиагентная оркестрация","как использовать Ultrawork","что такое Ultrawork","Ultrawork vs другие ИИ Агенты","установить Ultrawork","руководство по конфигурации Ultrawork","разработка ИИ Агентов с помощью Ultrawork","команды разработки ИИ","инструменты ИИ для команд"],"ar":["إدارة الوحدات المتعددة","كيفية استخدام ألتروورك","ما هو ألتروورك","ألتروورك مقابل وحدات آي كي أخرى","تثبيت ألتروورك","دليل إعداد ألتروورك","تطوير وحدات آي كي باستخدام ألتروورك","فرق تطوير آي كي","أدوات آي كي للفرق"]}},"owner":"Yeachan-Heo","repo":"oh-my-claudecode","repoPath":"Yeachan-Heo/oh-my-claudecode","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.885Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ultrawork","description":"Parallel execution engine for high-throughput task completion","bodyPreview":"<Purpose>\nUltrawork is a parallel execution engine that runs multiple agents simultaneously for independent tasks. It is a component, not a standalone persistence mode -- it provides parallelism and smart model routing but not persistence, verification loops, or state management.\n</Purpose>\n\n<Use_When>\n- Multiple independent tasks can run simultaneously\n- User says \"ulw\", \"ultrawork\", or wants parallel execution\n- You need to delegate work to multiple agents at once\n- Task benefits from concurre","body":"<Purpose>\nUltrawork is a parallel execution engine that runs multiple agents simultaneously for independent tasks. It is a component, not a standalone persistence mode -- it provides parallelism and smart model routing but not persistence, verification loops, or state management.\n</Purpose>\n\n<Use_When>\n- Multiple independent tasks can run simultaneously\n- User says \"ulw\", \"ultrawork\", or wants parallel execution\n- You need to delegate work to multiple agents at once\n- Task benefits from concurrent execution but the user will manage completion themselves\n</Use_When>\n\n<Do_Not_Use_When>\n- Task requires guaranteed completion with verification -- use `ralph` instead (ralph includes ultrawork)\n- Task requires a full autonomous pipeline -- use `autopilot` instead (autopilot includes ralph which includes ultrawork)\n- There is only one sequential task with no parallelism opportunity -- delegate directly to an executor agent\n- User needs session persistence for resume -- use `ralph` which adds persistence on top of ultrawork\n</Do_Not_Use_When>\n\n<Why_This_Exists>\nSequential task execution wastes time when tasks are independent. Ultrawork enables firing multiple agents simultaneously and routing each to the right model tier, reducing total execution time while controlling token costs. It is designed as a composable component that ralph and autopilot layer on top of.\n</Why_This_Exists>\n\n<Execution_Policy>\n- Fire all independent agent calls simultaneously -- never serialize independent work\n- Always pass the `model` parameter explicitly when delegating\n- Read `docs/shared/agent-tiers.md` before first delegation for agent selection guidance\n- Use `run_in_background: true` for operations over ~30 seconds (installs, builds, tests)\n- Run quick commands (git status, file reads, simple checks) in the foreground\n</Execution_Policy>\n\n<Steps>\n1. **Read agent reference**: Load `docs/shared/agent-tiers.md` for tier selection\n2. **Classify tasks by independence**: Identify which tasks can run in parallel vs which have dependencies\n3. **Route to correct tiers**:\n   - Simple lookups/definitions: LOW tier (Haiku)\n   - Standard implementation: MEDIUM tier (Sonnet)\n   - Complex analysis/refactoring: HIGH tier (Opus)\n4. **Fire independent tasks simultaneously**: Launch all parallel-safe tasks at once\n5. **Run dependent tasks sequentially**: Wait for prerequisites before launching dependent work\n6. **Background long operations**: Builds, installs, and test suites use `run_in_background: true`\n7. **Verify when all tasks complete** (lightweight):\n   - Build/typecheck passes\n   - Affected tests pass\n   - No new errors introduced\n</Steps>\n\n<Tool_Usage>\n- Use `Task(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor-low\", model=\"haiku\", ...)` for simple changes\n- Use `Task(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"sonnet\", ...)` for standard work\n- Use `Task(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor-high\", model=\"opus\", ...)` for complex work\n- Use `run_in_background: true` for package installs, builds, and test suites\n- Use foreground execution for quick status checks and file operations\n</Tool_Usage>\n\n<Examples>\n<Good>\nThree independent tasks fired simultaneously:\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor-low\", model=\"haiku\", prompt=\"Add missing type export for Config interface\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"sonnet\", prompt=\"Implement the /api/users endpoint with validation\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"sonnet\", prompt=\"Add integration tests for the auth middleware\")\n```\nWhy good: Independent tasks at appropriate tiers, all fired at once.\n</Good>\n\n<Good>\nCorrect use of background execution:\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"sonnet\", prompt=\"npm install && npm run build\", run_in_background=true)\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor-low\", model=\"haiku\", prompt=\"Update the README with new API endpoints\")\n```\nWhy good: Long build runs in background while short task runs in foreground.\n</Good>\n\n<Bad>\nSequential execution of independent work:\n```\nresult1 = Task(executor-low, \"Add type export\")  # wait...\nresult2 = Task(executor, \"Implement endpoint\")     # wait...\nresult3 = Task(executor, \"Add tests\")              # wait...\n```\nWhy bad: These tasks are independent. Running them sequentially wastes time.\n</Bad>\n\n<Bad>\nWrong tier selection:\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor-high\", model=\"opus\", prompt=\"Add a missing semicolon\")\n```\nWhy bad: Opus is expensive overkill for a trivial fix. Use executor-low with Haiku instead.\n</Bad>\n</Examples>\n\n<Escalation_And_Stop_Conditions>\n- When ultrawork is invoked directly (not via ralph), apply lightweight verification only -- build passes, tests pass, no new errors\n- For full persistence and comprehensive architect verification, recommend switching to `ralph` mode\n- If a task fails repeatedly across retries, report the issue rather than retrying indefinitely\n- Escalate to the user when tasks have unclear dependencies or conflicting requirements\n</Escalation_And_Stop_Conditions>\n\n<Final_Checklist>\n- [ ] All parallel tasks completed\n- [ ] Build/typecheck passes\n- [ ] Affected tests pass\n- [ ] No new errors introduced\n</Final_Checklist>\n\n<Advanced>\n## Relationship to Other Modes\n\n```\nralph (persistence wrapper)\n \\-- includes: ultrawork (this skill)\n     \\-- provides: parallel execution only\n\nautopilot (autonomous execution)\n \\-- includes: ralph\n     \\-- includes: ultrawork (this skill)\n```\n\nUltrawork is the parallelism layer. Ralph adds persistence and verification. Autopilot adds the full lifecycle pipeline.\n</Advanced>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:09:05.489Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Multi-agent Ecosystems needing parallel execution and smart model routing, such as those utilizing Claude Code or similar AI frameworks.","zh":"适用于需要并行执行和智能模型路由的多代理生态系统，例如使用 Claude Code 或类似的 AI 框架。","ja":"並列実行とスマート モデル ルーティングを必要とするマルチエージェント エコシステムに適しています。たとえば、Claude Code または同等の AI フレームワークを使用する場合などです。","ko":"병렬 실행과 스마트 모델 라우팅이 필요한 멀티 에이전트 생태계에 적합합니다. 예를 들어, Claude Code 또는 유사한 AI 프레임워크를 사용하는 경우 등에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para ecosistemas de multiagentes que necesitan ejecución paralela y enrutamiento de modelos inteligentes, como aquellos que utilizan Claude Code o marcos de trabajo de inteligencia artificial similares.","fr":"Idéal pour les écosystèmes multi-agents nécessitant une exécution parallèle et un routage de modèles intelligents, tels que ceux utilisant Claude Code ou des frameworks d''IA similaires.","de":"Ideal für Multiagenten-Ökosysteme, die eine parallele Ausführung und eine intelligente Modellverteilung benötigen, wie z. B. solche, die Claude Code oder ähnliche KI-Frameworks verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Ecossistemas de Multi-agentes que necessitam de execução paralela e roteamento de modelo inteligente, como aqueles que utilizam Claude Code ou frameworks de IA semelhantes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для экосистем многоагентных систем, требующих параллельного выполнения и умного маршрутизации моделей, таких как те, которые используют Claude Code или аналогичные框ки AI.","ar":"مثالي لنظم متعددة الوكلاء التي تحتاج إلى تنفيذ متوازي وتوجيه نموذج ذكي، مثل تلك التي تستخدم Claude Code أو إطارات شبيهة بالذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute multiple independent tasks simultaneously, leveraging parallelism and efficient model routing, while supporting teams-first multi-agent orchestration and delegation of work to multiple agents at once, utilizing keywords like ''parallel execution'' and ''multi-agent orchestration''. This superpower enables agents to significantly enhance their productivity and efficiency in handling complex, concurrent tasks. By integrating ultrawork, agents can seamlessly manage and execute tasks that benefit from concurrency, making them more versatile and powerful.","zh":"赋予代理执行多个独立任务的能力，同时利用并行性和高效的模型路由，并支持团队优先的多代理编排和一次性委托多个代理工作，利用诸如 ''并行执行'' 和 ''多代理编排'' 等关键词。这种超能力使代理能够显著提高其处理复杂、并发任务的生产力和效率。通过集成 ultrawork，代理可以无缝地管理和执行能够从并发中受益的任务，使其更加多才多艺和强大。","ja":"エージェントに複数の独立したタスクを同時に実行する能力を付与し、並列性と効率的なモデル ルーティングを利用し、チーム優先のマルチ エージェント オーケストレーションと複数のエージェントへの同時ワークの委任をサポートし、''並列実行'' や ''マルチ エージェント オーケストレーション'' などのキーワードを利用します。このスーパーパワーにより、エージェントは複雑で並行したタスクを処理する生産性と効率を大幅に向上させることができます。ultrawork を統合することで、エージェントは並行性から利益を得るタスクをシームレスに管理および実行でき、より多才多芸で強力になります。","ko":"에이전트에게 다수의 독립적인 태스크를 동시에 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 병렬성과 효율적인 모델 라우팅을 활용하고, 팀 우선의 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션과 다수의 에이전트에게 동시에 작업을 위임하는 것을 지원하며, ''병렬 실행''이나 ''멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션''과 같은 키워드를 활용합니다. 이러한超能力은 에이전트가 복잡하고 동시에 진행되는 태스크를 처리하는 생산성과 효율성을 크게 향상시킵니다. ultrawork를 통합함으로써 에이전트는 병렬성에서 이익을 얻을 수 있는 태스크를 무중단으로 관리하고 실행할 수 있으며, 더 유연하고 강력해집니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar múltiples tareas independientes simultáneamente, aprovechando el paralelismo y la routificación de modelos eficientes, mientras que admite la orquestación de equipos de múltiples agentes y la delegación de trabajo a varios agentes al mismo tiempo, utilizando palabras clave como ''ejecución paralela'' y ''orquestación multiagente''. Esta superpotencia permite a los agentes mejorar significativamente su productividad y eficiencia en el manejo de tareas complejas y concurrentes. Al integrar ultrawork, los agentes pueden gestionar y ejecutar tareas que se benefician de la concurrencia de manera transparente, lo que los hace más versátiles y poderosos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter plusieurs tâches indépendantes simultanément, en exploitant le parallélisme et la routage de modèles efficace, tout en supportant l''orchestration d''équipes de plusieurs agents et la délégation de travail à plusieurs agents à la fois, en utilisant des mots clés comme ''exécution parallèle'' et ''orchestration multi-agents''. Ce superpouvoir permet aux agents d''améliorer considérablement leur productivité et leur efficacité dans la gestion de tâches complexes et concurrentes. En intégrant ultrawork, les agents peuvent gérer et exécuter des tâches qui bénéficient de la concurrence de manière transparente, ce qui les rend plus polyvalents et puissants.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mehrere unabhängige Aufgaben simultan auszuführen, indem sie Parallelismus und effizientes Modellrouten nutzen, während sie die Orchestrierung von Teams mit mehreren Agenten und die Delegation von Arbeit an mehrere Agenten gleichzeitig unterstützen, indem sie Schlüsselwörter wie ''parallele Ausführung'' und ''Multiagenten-Orchestrierung'' verwenden. Diese Superkraft ermöglicht es Agenten, ihre Produktivität und Effizienz bei der Bearbeitung komplexer und konkurrierender Aufgaben erheblich zu verbessern. Durch die Integration von ultrawork können Agenten Aufgaben, die von Konkurrenz profitieren, nahtlos verwalten und ausführen, was sie vielseitiger und leistungsfähiger macht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar várias tarefas independentes simultaneamente, aproveitando o paralelismo e o roteamento de modelo eficiente, enquanto suporta a orquestração de equipes em primeiro lugar e a delegação de trabalho a vários agentes ao mesmo tempo, utilizando palavras-chave como ''execução paralela'' e ''orquestração de multi-agentes''. Este superpoder permite que os agentes melhorem significativamente sua produtividade e eficiência no tratamento de tarefas complexas e concorrentes. Ao integrar o ultrawork, os agentes podem gerenciar e executar tarefas que se beneficiam da concorrência de forma transparente, tornando-os mais versáteis e poderosos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять несколько независимых задач одновременно, используя параллелизм и эффективную маршрутизацию моделей, а также поддерживает оркестровку команд в первую очередь и делегирование работы нескольким агентам одновременно, используя ключевые слова như ''параллельное выполнение'' и ''оркестровка многоагентных систем''. Этот суперсил позволяет агентам значительно повысить свою производительность и эффективность при处理 сложных и конкурирующих задач. Интегрируя ultrawork, агенты могут прозрачно управлять и выполнять задачи, которые выигрывают от конкурентности, делая их более универсальными и мощными.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ مهام متعددة مستقلة في نفس الوقت، مستفيدة من التمويل والتنقل الفعال للنموذج، ودعم الأوركسترا الأولى للفرق وتفويض العمل إلى عدة وكلاء في نفس الوقت، باستخدام كلمات مفتاحية مثل ''التنفيذ المتوازي'' و ''أوركسترا متعددة الوكلاء''. هذا السوبر بوفر يسمح للوكلاء بتحسين إنتاجيتهم وفعاليتها بشكل كبير في التعامل مع المهام المعقدة والمتزامنة. من خلال دمج الأعمال الفائقة، يمكن للوكلاء إدارة وتنفيذ المهام التي تستفيد من التزامن بطريقة прозрачة، مما يجعلها أكثر مرونة وقوة."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing multiple independent tasks in parallel","Delegating work to multiple agents simultaneously","Optimizing task execution through smart model routing","Enhancing productivity in multi-agent ecosystems"],"zh":["并行执行多个独立任务","同时委托多个代理工作","通过智能模型路由优化任务执行","提高多代理生态系统的生产力"],"ja":["複数の独立したタスクを並列に実行する","複数のエージェントに同時に仕事を委任する","スマート モデル ルーティングを通じてタスク実行を最適化する","マルチ エージェント エコシステムの生産性を向上させる"],"ko":["다수의 독립적인 태스크를 병렬로 실행한다","다수의 에이전트에게 동시에 작업을 위임한다","스마트 모델 라우팅을 통해 태스크 실행을 최적화한다","멀티 에이전트 생태계의 생산성을 향상시킨다"],"es":["Ejecución de múltiples tareas independientes en paralelo","Delegación de trabajo a varios agentes simultáneamente","Optimización de la ejecución de tareas a través de un enrutamiento de modelos inteligentes","Mejora de la productividad en ecosistemas de multiagentes"],"fr":["Exécution de plusieurs tâches indépendantes en parallèle","Délégation de travail à plusieurs agents simultanément","Optimisation de l''exécution de tâches via un routage de modèles intelligents","Amélioration de la productivité dans les écosystèmes multi-agents"],"de":["Ausführung mehrerer unabhängiger Aufgaben in Parallelschritten","Delegation von Arbeit an mehrere Agenten gleichzeitig","Optimierung der Aufgabenausführung durch intelligente Modellverteilung","Verbesserung der Produktivität in Multiagenten-Ökosystemen"],"pt":["Executando várias tarefas independentes em paralelo","Delegando trabalho a vários agentes simultaneamente","Otimizando a execução de tarefas por meio de roteamento de modelo inteligente","Melhorando a produtividade em ecossistemas de multi-agentes"],"ru":["Выполнять несколько независимых задач параллельно","Делегировать работу нескольким агентам одновременно","Оптимизировать выполнение задач с помощью умного маршрутизации моделей","Повысить производительность в экосистемах многоагентных систем"],"ar":["تنفيذ مهام متعددة مستقلة بالتوازي","تفويض العمل إلى عدة وكلاء في نفس الوقت","تحسين تنفيذ المهام من خلال توجيه نموذج ذكي","تعزيز الإنتاجية في نظم متعددة الوكلاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not provide persistence, verification loops, or state management","Requires multiple independent tasks to run simultaneously for optimal performance"],"zh":["不提供持久性、验证循环或状态管理","需要多个独立任务同时运行以获得最佳性能"],"ja":["永続性、検証ループ、または状態管理を提供しない","最適なパフォーマンスを得るために、複数の独立したタスクを同時に実行する必要がある"],"ko":["영속성, 검증 루프 또는 상태 관리를 제공하지 않는다","최적의 성능을 얻으려면 다수의 독립적인 태스크를 동시에 실행해야 한다"],"es":["No proporciona persistencia, bucles de verificación ni gestión de estado","Requiere múltiples tareas independientes para ejecutarse simultáneamente para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Ne fournit pas de persistance, de boucles de vérification ou de gestion d''état","Nécessite plusieurs tâches indépendantes pour s''exécuter simultanément pour un rendement optimal"],"de":["Bietet keine Persistenz, Überprüfungsschleifen oder Statusverwaltung","Benötigt mehrere unabhängige Aufgaben, um gleichzeitig ausgeführt zu werden, um eine optimale Leistung zu erzielen"],"pt":["Não fornece persistência, loops de verificação ou gerenciamento de estado","Requer várias tarefas independentes para serem executadas simultaneamente para um desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Не предоставляет персистентность, проверочные циклы или управление состоянием","Требует нескольких независимых задач для одновременного выполнения для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["لا يوفر استمرارية أو دورات التحقق أو إدارة الحالة","يتطلب مهام متعددة مستقلة لتنفيذها في نفس الوقت للحصول على أداء مثالي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"05f1d1d52f80be2f36905c817891b44223582b9fecde31589f3ecadb55b235b1","qualityScore":34}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mitsuhiko/agent-stuff/openscad', 'community', 'mitsuhiko', 'agent-stuff', 'mitsuhiko/agent-stuff', 'openscad', 0, 0, 34, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.885Z', '2026-03-02T02:09:06.036Z', 'e49b7c056c4f9cee67b6e3fa4620915ccdddf12278159db9073cc063ee957799', '{"id":"mitsuhiko/agent-stuff/openscad","name":"openscad","description":{"zh":"OpenSCAD是一种强大的3D建模工具，通过AI工具命令可以提高开发效率","ja":"OpenSCADは強力な3Dモデリングツールで、AIエージェントコマンドを使用して開発を効率化できます","ko":"OpenSCAD는 강력한 3D 모델링 도구로, AI 에이전트 명령어를 사용하여 개발 속도를 높일 수 있습니다","es":"OpenSCAD es una herramienta de modelado 3D que se puede utilizar con agentes de IA. Aquí se presentan los comandos básicos para desarrolladores.","fr":"OpenSCAD est un outil de modélisation 3D utilisable avec des agents IA. Voici les commandes de base pour les développeurs.","de":"OpenSCAD ist ein 3D-Modellierungstool, das mit KI-Agents verwendet werden kann. Hier werden die grundlegenden Befehle für Entwickler vorgestellt.","pt":"OpenSCAD é uma ferramenta de modelagem 3D que pode ser usada com agentes de IA. Aprenda a usar comandos para melhorar sua produtividade.","ru":"OpenSCAD - это инструмент 3D-моделирования, который можно использовать с ИИ Агентами. Узнайте, как использовать команды для повышения производительности.","ar":"OpenSCAD هو أداة نمذجة 3D يمكن استخدامها مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي. تعلم كيفية استخدام الأوامر لتحسين الإنتاجية.","en":"These are commands I use with agents, mostly Claude"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"OpenSCAD AI工具命令","ja":"OpenSCAD AIエージェントコマンド","ko":"OpenSCAD AI 에이전트 명령어","es":"Herramientas de AI: Comandos OpenSCAD para Agentes","fr":"Outils IA: Commandes OpenSCAD pour Agents","de":"KI-Tools: OpenSCAD-Befehle für KI-Agenten","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: OpenSCAD para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: OpenSCAD для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: OpenSCAD للمطورين","en":"openscad"},"description":{"zh":"OpenSCAD是一种强大的3D建模工具，通过AI工具命令可以提高开发效率","ja":"OpenSCADは強力な3Dモデリングツールで、AIエージェントコマンドを使用して開発を効率化できます","ko":"OpenSCAD는 강력한 3D 모델링 도구로, AI 에이전트 명령어를 사용하여 개발 속도를 높일 수 있습니다","es":"OpenSCAD es una herramienta de modelado 3D que se puede utilizar con agentes de IA. Aquí se presentan los comandos básicos para desarrolladores.","fr":"OpenSCAD est un outil de modélisation 3D utilisable avec des agents IA. Voici les commandes de base pour les développeurs.","de":"OpenSCAD ist ein 3D-Modellierungstool, das mit KI-Agents verwendet werden kann. Hier werden die grundlegenden Befehle für Entwickler vorgestellt.","pt":"OpenSCAD é uma ferramenta de modelagem 3D que pode ser usada com agentes de IA. Aprenda a usar comandos para melhorar sua produtividade.","ru":"OpenSCAD - это инструмент 3D-моделирования, который можно использовать с ИИ Агентами. Узнайте, как использовать команды для повышения производительности.","ar":"OpenSCAD هو أداة نمذجة 3D يمكن استخدامها مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي. تعلم كيفية استخدام الأوامر لتحسين الإنتاجية.","en":"These are commands I use with agents, mostly Claude"},"definition":{"en":"These are commands I use with agents, mostly Claude"},"features":{"zh":["支持多种3D模型格式","提供强大的脚本编写能力","可以使用AI工具命令进行自动化操作","支持多种操作系统","提供详细的文档和社区支持"],"ja":["多種の3Dモデル形式をサポート","強力なスクリプト作成能力を提供","AIエージェントコマンドを使用して自動化操作が可能","多種のオペレーティングシステムをサポート","詳細なドキュメントとコミュニティサポートを提供"],"ko":["다양한 3D 모델 형식을 지원","강력한 스크립트 작성 능력을 제공","AI 에이전트 명령어를 사용하여 자동화操作이 가능","다양한 운영 체제를 지원","詳細한 문서와 커뮤니티 지원을 제공"],"es":["Compatibilidad con agentes de IA como Claude","Modelado 3D paramétrico","Soporte para formatos de archivo 3D","Personalización de comandos y scripts","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec des agents IA tels que Claude","Modélisation 3D paramétrique","Prise en charge des formats de fichiers 3D","Personnalisation des commandes et des scripts","Intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit KI-Agents wie Claude","Parametrische 3D-Modellierung","Unterstützung für 3D-Dateiformate","Anpassung von Befehlen und Skripten","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Modelagem 3D paramétrica","Integração com agentes de IA","Comandos personalizáveis","Suporte a scripts","Exportação de modelos 3D"],"ru":["Параметрическое 3D-моделирование","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Настраиваемые команды","Поддержка скриптов","Экспорт 3D-моделей"],"ar":["نمذجة 3D متعددة المعايير","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أوامر قابلة للتعديل","دعم السكريبتات","تصدير نماذج 3D"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenSCAD教程","OpenSCAD下载","OpenSCAD alternative","OpenSCAD vs Blender","如何使用OpenSCAD","OpenSCAD安装指南","OpenSCAD脚本编写"],"ja":["OpenSCADチュートリアル","OpenSCADダウンロード","OpenSCADの代替","OpenSCAD vs Blender","OpenSCADの使い方","OpenSCADインストールガイド","OpenSCADスクリプト作成"],"ko":["OpenSCAD 튜토리얼","OpenSCAD 다운로드","OpenSCAD 대체","OpenSCAD vs Blender","OpenSCAD 사용 방법","OpenSCAD 설치 가이드","OpenSCAD 스크립트 작성"],"es":["cómo usar OpenSCAD con agentes de IA","OpenSCAD vs Blender","instalación de OpenSCAD","guía de configuración de OpenSCAD","alternativas a OpenSCAD","OpenSCAD para desarrolladores","modelado 3D con OpenSCAD","comandos OpenSCAD para agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser OpenSCAD avec des agents IA","OpenSCAD vs Blender","installation d''OpenSCAD","guide de configuration d''OpenSCAD","alternatives à OpenSCAD","OpenSCAD pour développeurs","modélisation 3D avec OpenSCAD","commandes OpenSCAD pour agents IA"],"de":["wie man OpenSCAD mit KI-Agents verwendet","OpenSCAD vs Blender","Installation von OpenSCAD","Einrichtungsanleitung für OpenSCAD","Alternativen zu OpenSCAD","OpenSCAD für Entwickler","3D-Modellierung mit OpenSCAD","OpenSCAD-Befehle für KI-Agenten"],"pt":["como usar OpenSCAD","OpenSCAD vs Blender","instalar OpenSCAD","guia de setup OpenSCAD","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","OpenSCAD para iniciantes"],"ru":["как использовать OpenSCAD","OpenSCAD vs Blender","установить OpenSCAD","руководство по настройке OpenSCAD","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","OpenSCAD для начинающих"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام OpenSCAD","OpenSCAD مقابل Blender","تثبيت OpenSCAD","دليل إعداد OpenSCAD","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","OpenSCAD للمبتدئين"]}},"owner":"mitsuhiko","repo":"agent-stuff","repoPath":"mitsuhiko/agent-stuff","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.885Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openscad","description":"Create and render OpenSCAD 3D models. Generate preview images from multiple angles, extract customizable parameters, validate syntax, and export STL files for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld.","bodyPreview":"# OpenSCAD Skill\n\nCreate, validate, and export OpenSCAD 3D models. Supports parameter customization, visual preview from multiple angles, and STL export for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nOpenSCAD must be installed. Install via Homebrew:\n```bash\nbrew install openscad\n```\n\n## Tools\n\nThis skill provides several tools in the `tools/` directory:\n\n### Preview Generation\n```bash\n# Generate a single preview image\n./tools/preview.sh model.scad output.png [--camera=x,y,z,tx,ty,","body":"# OpenSCAD Skill\n\nCreate, validate, and export OpenSCAD 3D models. Supports parameter customization, visual preview from multiple angles, and STL export for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nOpenSCAD must be installed. Install via Homebrew:\n```bash\nbrew install openscad\n```\n\n## Tools\n\nThis skill provides several tools in the `tools/` directory:\n\n### Preview Generation\n```bash\n# Generate a single preview image\n./tools/preview.sh model.scad output.png [--camera=x,y,z,tx,ty,tz,dist] [--size=800x600]\n\n# Generate multi-angle preview (front, back, left, right, top, iso)\n./tools/multi-preview.sh model.scad output_dir/\n```\n\n### STL Export\n```bash\n# Export to STL for 3D printing\n./tools/export-stl.sh model.scad output.stl [-D ''param=value'']\n```\n\n### Parameter Extraction\n```bash\n# Extract customizable parameters from an OpenSCAD file\n./tools/extract-params.sh model.scad\n```\n\n### Validation\n```bash\n# Check for syntax errors and warnings\n./tools/validate.sh model.scad\n```\n\n## Visual Validation (Required)\n\n**Always validate your OpenSCAD models visually after creating or modifying them.**\n\nAfter writing or editing any OpenSCAD file:\n\n1. **Generate multi-angle previews** using `multi-preview.sh`\n2. **View each generated image** using the `read` tool\n3. **Check for issues** from multiple perspectives:\n   - Front/back: Verify symmetry, features, and proportions\n   - Left/right: Check depth and side profiles\n   - Top: Ensure top features are correct\n   - Isometric: Overall shape validation\n4. **Iterate if needed**: If something looks wrong, fix the code and re-validate\n\nThis catches issues that syntax validation alone cannot detect:\n- Inverted normals or inside-out geometry\n- Misaligned features or incorrect boolean operations\n- Proportions that don''t match the intended design\n- Missing or floating geometry\n- Z-fighting or overlapping surfaces\n\n**Never deliver an OpenSCAD model without visually confirming it looks correct from multiple angles.**\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Creating an OpenSCAD Model\n\nWrite OpenSCAD code with customizable parameters at the top:\n\n```openscad\n// Customizable parameters\nwall_thickness = 2;        // [1:0.5:5] Wall thickness in mm\nwidth = 50;                // [20:100] Width in mm\nheight = 30;               // [10:80] Height in mm\nrounded = true;            // Add rounded corners\n\n// Model code below\nmodule main_shape() {\n    if (rounded) {\n        minkowski() {\n            cube([width - 4, width - 4, height - 2]);\n            sphere(r = 2);\n        }\n    } else {\n        cube([width, width, height]);\n    }\n}\n\ndifference() {\n    main_shape();\n    translate([wall_thickness, wall_thickness, wall_thickness])\n        scale([1 - 2*wall_thickness/width, 1 - 2*wall_thickness/width, 1])\n        main_shape();\n}\n```\n\nParameter comment format:\n- `// [min:max]` - numeric range\n- `// [min:step:max]` - numeric range with step\n- `// [opt1, opt2, opt3]` - dropdown options\n- `// Description text` - plain description\n\n### 2. Validate the Model\n```bash\n./tools/validate.sh model.scad\n```\n\n### 3. Generate Previews\n\nGenerate preview images to visually validate the model:\n```bash\n./tools/multi-preview.sh model.scad ./previews/\n```\n\nThis creates PNG images from multiple angles. Use the `read` tool to view them.\n\n### 4. Export to STL\n```bash\n./tools/export-stl.sh model.scad output.stl\n# With custom parameters:\n./tools/export-stl.sh model.scad output.stl -D ''width=60'' -D ''height=40''\n```\n\n## Camera Positions\n\nCommon camera angles for previews:\n- **Isometric**: `--camera=0,0,0,45,0,45,200`\n- **Front**: `--camera=0,0,0,90,0,0,200`\n- **Top**: `--camera=0,0,0,0,0,0,200`\n- **Right**: `--camera=0,0,0,90,0,90,200`\n\nFormat: `x,y,z,rotx,roty,rotz,distance`\n\n## MakerWorld Publishing\n\nFor MakerWorld, you typically need:\n1. STL file(s) exported via `export-stl.sh`\n2. Preview images (at least one good isometric view)\n3. A description of customizable parameters\n\nConsider creating a `model.json` with metadata:\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Model Name\",\n  \"description\": \"Description for MakerWorld\",\n  \"parameters\": [...],\n  \"tags\": [\"functional\", \"container\", \"organizer\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Example: Full Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create the model (write .scad file)\n\n# 2. Validate syntax\n./tools/validate.sh box.scad\n\n# 3. Generate multi-angle previews\n./tools/multi-preview.sh box.scad ./previews/\n\n# 4. IMPORTANT: View and validate ALL preview images\n#    Use the read tool on each PNG file to visually inspect:\n#    - previews/box_front.png\n#    - previews/box_back.png\n#    - previews/box_left.png\n#    - previews/box_right.png\n#    - previews/box_top.png\n#    - previews/box_iso.png\n#    Look for geometry issues, misalignments, or unexpected results.\n#    If anything looks wrong, go back to step 1 and fix it!\n\n# 5. Extract and review parameters\n./tools/extract-params.sh box.scad\n\n# 6. Export STL with default parameters\n./tools/export-stl.sh box.scad box.stl\n\n# 7. Export STL with custom parameters\n./tools/export-stl.sh box.scad box_large.stl -D ''width=80'' -D ''height=60''\n```\n\n**Remember**: Never skip the visual validation step. Many issues (wrong dimensions, boolean operation errors, inverted geometry) are only visible when you actually look at the rendered model.\n\n## OpenSCAD Quick Reference\n\n### Basic Shapes\n```openscad\ncube([x, y, z]);\nsphere(r = radius);\ncylinder(h = height, r = radius);\ncylinder(h = height, r1 = bottom_r, r2 = top_r);  // cone\n```\n\n### Transformations\n```openscad\ntranslate([x, y, z]) object();\nrotate([rx, ry, rz]) object();\nscale([sx, sy, sz]) object();\nmirror([x, y, z]) object();\n```\n\n### Boolean Operations\n```openscad\nunion() { a(); b(); }        // combine\ndifference() { a(); b(); }   // subtract b from a\nintersection() { a(); b(); } // overlap only\n```\n\n### Advanced\n```openscad\nlinear_extrude(height) 2d_shape();\nrotate_extrude() 2d_shape();\nhull() { objects(); }        // convex hull\nminkowski() { a(); b(); }    // minkowski sum (rounding)\n```\n\n### 2D Shapes\n```openscad\ncircle(r = radius);\nsquare([x, y]);\npolygon(points = [[x1,y1], [x2,y2], ...]);\ntext(\"string\", size = 10);\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:09:06.036Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for 3D Modeling Agents needing advanced OpenSCAD capabilities for custom 3D model creation and STL export","zh":"适合需要高级 OpenSCAD 功能的 3D 建模代理，用于自定义 3D 模型创建和 STL 导出","ja":"OpenSCAD の高度な機能が必要な 3D モデリング エージェントに適しています。カスタム 3D モデル作成と STL エクスポートが可能です","ko":"고급 OpenSCAD 기능이 필요한 3D 모델링 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 사용자 정의 3D 모델 생성 및 STL 내보내기용","es":"Perfecto para agentes de modelado 3D que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de OpenSCAD para la creación de modelos 3D personalizados y exportación de STL","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modélisation 3D nécessitant des fonctionnalités avancées d''OpenSCAD pour la création de modèles 3D personnalisés et l''exportation de STL","de":"Perfekt für 3D-Modellierungsagenten, die erweiterte OpenSCAD-Funktionen für die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten 3D-Modellen und STL-Export benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modelagem 3D que precisam de capacidades avançadas do OpenSCAD para criação de modelos 3D personalizados e exportação STL","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов 3D-моделирования, которым необходимы расширенные возможности OpenSCAD для создания пользовательских 3D-моделей и экспорта STL","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء نمذجة 3D الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة من OpenSCAD لإنشاء نماذج 3D مخصصة وتصدير STL"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, validate, and export customizable OpenSCAD 3D models, supporting parameter customization, visual preview from multiple angles, and STL export for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld, utilizing tools like preview.sh for image generation","zh":"赋予代理创建、验证和导出可自定义的 OpenSCAD 3D 模型的能力，支持参数自定义、多角度视觉预览以及 MakerWorld 等 3D 打印平台的 STL 导出，利用 preview.sh 等工具进行图像生成","ja":"エージェントに、カスタマイズ可能な OpenSCAD 3D モデルを作成、検証、エクスポートする機能を提供します。パラメータのカスタマイズ、複数の角度からの視覚的なプレビュー、および MakerWorld などの 3D プリンティング プラットフォーム向けの STL エクスポートをサポートします。プレビューの生成には preview.sh などのツールを使用します","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 정의 가능한 OpenSCAD 3D 모델을 생성, 확인 및 내보내기할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. 매개변수 사용자 정의, 여러 각도에서 시각적 미리 보기를 지원하며, MakerWorld와 같은 3D 프린팅 플랫폼을 위한 STL 내보내기에 사용됩니다. 미리 보기를 생성하기 위해 preview.sh와 같은 도구를 사용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, validar y exportar modelos 3D personalizados de OpenSCAD, que admiten la personalización de parámetros, la vista previa visual desde múltiples ángulos y la exportación de STL para plataformas de impresión 3D como MakerWorld, utilizando herramientas como preview.sh para la generación de imágenes","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de valider et d''exporter des modèles 3D personnalisés d''OpenSCAD, qui prennent en charge la personnalisation de paramètres, l''aperçu visuel sous plusieurs angles et l''exportation de STL pour les plateformes d''impression 3D comme MakerWorld, en utilisant des outils comme preview.sh pour la génération d''images","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, benutzerdefinierte OpenSCAD-3D-Modelle zu erstellen, zu validieren und zu exportieren, die Parameteranpassung, visuelle Vorschau aus mehreren Winkeln und STL-Export für 3D-Druckplattformen wie MakerWorld unterstützen, unter Verwendung von Tools wie preview.sh für die Bildgenerierung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, validar e exportar modelos 3D personalizados do OpenSCAD, com suporte à personalização de parâmetros, pré-visualização visual de múltiplos ângulos e exportação STL para plataformas de impressão 3D como o MakerWorld, utilizando ferramentas como preview.sh para geração de imagens","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать, проверять и экспортировать пользовательские 3D-модели OpenSCAD, поддерживая настройку параметров, визуальный просмотр с нескольких углов и экспорт STL для платформ 3D-печати, таких как MakerWorld, используя инструменты, такие как preview.sh для генерации изображений","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء ونقل وتصدير نماذج 3D مخصصة من OpenSCAD، مع دعم تخصيص المعلمات والمعاينة المرئية من زوايا متعددة وتصدير STL لمنصات الطباعة 3D مثل MakerWorld، باستخدام أدوات مثل preview.sh لإنشاء الصور"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D model previews from multiple angles","Creating customizable 3D models with parameterized designs","Exporting STL files for 3D printing"],"zh":["从多个角度生成 3D 模型预览","创建具有参数化设计的可自定义 3D 模型","导出 STL 文件用于 3D 打印"],"ja":["複数の角度からの 3D モデル プレビューの生成","パラメータ化されたデザインを持つカスタマイズ可能な 3D モデルの作成","3D プリンティング用の STL ファイルのエクスポート"],"ko":["여러 각도에서 3D 모델 미리 보기를 생성","매개변수화된 디자인을 갖춘 사용자 정의 가능한 3D 모델을 생성","3D 프린팅을 위한 STL 파일 내보내기"],"es":["Generar vistas previas de modelos 3D desde múltiples ángulos","Crear modelos 3D personalizados con diseños parametrizados","Exportar archivos STL para plataformas de impresión 3D"],"fr":["Générer des aperçus de modèles 3D sous plusieurs angles","Créer des modèles 3D personnalisés avec des conceptions paramétrées","Exporter des fichiers STL pour les plateformes d''impression 3D"],"de":["Erstellen von Vorschauen von 3D-Modellen aus mehreren Winkeln","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten 3D-Modellen mit parametrierten Designs","Exportieren von STL-Dateien für 3D-Druckplattformen"],"pt":["Geração de visualizações de modelos 3D de múltiplos ângulos","Criação de modelos 3D personalizados com projetos parametrizados","Exportação de arquivos STL para plataformas de impressão 3D"],"ru":["Генерация предпросмотра 3D-моделей с нескольких углов","Создание пользовательских 3D-моделей с параметризованными дизайнами","Экспорт файлов STL для платформ 3D-печати"],"ar":["إنشاء معاينات لنمذجة 3D من زوايا متعددة","إنشاء نماذج 3D مخصصة مع تصاميم معلمة","تصدير ملفات STL لمنصات الطباعة 3D"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenSCAD installation via Homebrew or equivalent","Dependent on specific OpenSCAD version compatibility"],"zh":["需要通过 Homebrew 或等效方法安装 OpenSCAD","依赖于特定的 OpenSCAD 版本兼容性"],"ja":["Homebrew または同等の方法を使用して OpenSCAD をインストールする必要がある","特定の OpenSCAD バージョンの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["Homebrew 또는 동일한 방법을 사용하여 OpenSCAD를 설치해야 함","특정 OpenSCAD 버전의 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de OpenSCAD a través de Homebrew o equivalente","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de la versión específica de OpenSCAD"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation d''OpenSCAD via Homebrew ou équivalent","Dépend de la compatibilité de la version spécifique d''OpenSCAD"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von OpenSCAD über Homebrew oder Äquivalent","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität der spezifischen OpenSCAD-Version"],"pt":["Requer instalação do OpenSCAD via Homebrew ou equivalente","Dependente da compatibilidade de versão específica do OpenSCAD"],"ru":["Требуется установка OpenSCAD через Homebrew или эквивалент","Зависит от совместимости конкретной версии OpenSCAD"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت OpenSCAD عبر Homebrew أو ما يعادلها","يعتمد على توافق إصدار معين من OpenSCAD"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e49b7c056c4f9cee67b6e3fa4620915ccdddf12278159db9073cc063ee957799","qualityScore":34}');
