],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"karpathy-guidelines","description":"Behavioral guidelines to reduce common LLM coding mistakes. Use when writing, reviewing, or refactoring code to avoid overcomplication, make surgical changes, surface assumptions, and define verifiable success criteria.","bodyPreview":"# Karpathy Guidelines\n\nBehavioral guidelines to reduce common LLM coding mistakes, derived from [Andrej Karpathy''s observations](https://x.com/karpathy/status/2015883857489522876) on LLM coding pitfalls.\n\n**Tradeoff:** These guidelines bias toward caution over speed. For trivial tasks, use judgment.\n\n## 1. Think Before Coding\n\n**Don''t assume. Don''t hide confusion. Surface tradeoffs.**\n\nBefore implementing:\n\n- State your assumptions explicitly. If uncertain, ask.\n- If multiple interpretations exi","body":"# Karpathy Guidelines\n\nBehavioral guidelines to reduce common LLM coding mistakes, derived from [Andrej Karpathy''s observations](https://x.com/karpathy/status/2015883857489522876) on LLM coding pitfalls.\n\n**Tradeoff:** These guidelines bias toward caution over speed. For trivial tasks, use judgment.\n\n## 1. Think Before Coding\n\n**Don''t assume. Don''t hide confusion. Surface tradeoffs.**\n\nBefore implementing:\n\n- State your assumptions explicitly. If uncertain, ask.\n- If multiple interpretations exist, present them - don''t pick silently.\n- If a simpler approach exists, say so. Push back when warranted.\n- If something is unclear, stop. Name what''s confusing. Ask.\n\n## 2. Simplicity First\n\n**Minimum code that solves the problem. Nothing speculative.**\n\n- No features beyond what was asked.\n- No abstractions for single-use code.\n- No \"flexibility\" or \"configurability\" that wasn''t requested.\n- No error handling for impossible scenarios.\n- If you write 200 lines and it could be 50, rewrite it.\n\nAsk yourself: \"Would a senior engineer say this is overcomplicated?\" If yes, simplify.\n\n## 3. Surgical Changes\n\n**Touch only what you must. Clean up only your own mess.**\n\nWhen editing existing code:\n\n- Don''t \"improve\" adjacent code, comments, or formatting.\n- Don''t refactor things that aren''t broken.\n- Match existing style, even if you''d do it differently.\n- If you notice unrelated dead code, mention it - don''t delete it.\n\nWhen your changes create orphans:\n\n- Remove imports/variables/functions that YOUR changes made unused.\n- Don''t remove pre-existing dead code unless asked.\n\nThe test: Every changed line should trace directly to the user''s request.\n\n## 4. Goal-Driven Execution\n\n**Define success criteria. Loop until verified.**\n\nTransform tasks into verifiable goals:\n\n- \"Add validation\" → \"Write tests for invalid inputs, then make them pass\"\n- \"Fix the bug\" → \"Write a test that reproduces it, then make it pass\"\n- \"Refactor X\" → \"Ensure tests pass before and after\"\n\nFor multi-step tasks, state a brief plan:\n\n```\n1. [Step] → verify: [check]\n2. [Step] → verify: [check]\n3. [Step] → verify: [check]\n```\n\nStrong success criteria let you loop independently. Weak criteria (\"make it work\") require constant clarification.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:20:21.542Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for LLM Agents needing guidelines to reduce common coding mistakes and improve smart contract interactions on VeChain networks","zh":"适合需要指南以减少常见编码错误并改进 VeChain 网络上智能合约交互的 LLM Agents","ja":"LLM エージェントが一般的なコーディングミスを減らし、VeChain ネットワークでのスマートコントラクトの相互作用を改善するためのガイドラインが必要な場合に最適","ko":"VeChain 네트워크에서 일반적인 코딩 오류를 줄이고 스마트 계약 상호작용을 개선하기 위한 지침이 필요한 LLM 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de LLM que necesitan directrices para reducir errores de codificación comunes y mejorar las interacciones de contratos inteligentes en redes VeChain","fr":"Parfait pour les agents LLM ayant besoin de lignes directrices pour réduire les erreurs de codage courantes et améliorer les interactions de contrats intelligents sur les réseaux VeChain","de":"Perfekt für LLM-Agents, die Richtlinien benötigen, um häufige Codierfehler zu reduzieren und die Interaktionen von Smart Contracts in VeChain-Netzwerken zu verbessern","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes LLM que precisam de diretrizes para reduzir erros de codificação comuns e melhorar as interações de contrato inteligente nas redes VeChain","ru":"Идеально для агентов LLM, которым необходимы рекомендации для снижения общих ошибок кодирования и улучшения взаимодействия смарт-контрактов в сетях VeChain","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء LLM الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات لتقليل الأخطاء الشائعة في كتابة الشيفرة وتحسين تفاعلات العقد الذكية على شبكات VeChain"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to surface tradeoffs, state assumptions explicitly, and avoid confusion by following behavioral guidelines derived from Andrej Karpathy''s observations, utilizing protocols like smart contract explorers on VeChain networks","zh":"赋予代理能力以表面权衡，明确状态假设，并通过遵循来自 Andrej Karpathy 的观察结果的行为指南避免混淆，利用 VeChain 网络上的协议，如智能合约探索器","ja":"エージェントにトレードオフを浮き彫りする、状態の仮定を明示する、Andrej Karpathy の観察に基づく行動ガイドラインに従うことで混乱を避ける能力を付与する。VeChain ネットワークでのスマートコントラクトエクスプローラーなどのプロトコルを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 트레이드 오프를 표면화하고 상태 가정들을 명시적으로 만들며 Andrej Karpathy의 관찰 결과에서 파생된 행동 지침을 따름으로써 혼란을 피할 수 있는 능력을 부여한다. VeChain 네트워크에서 스마트 계약 탐색기와 같은 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a exponer compromisos, establecer suposiciones explícitamente y evitar confusiones siguiendo pautas de comportamiento derivadas de las observaciones de Andrej Karpathy, utilizando protocolos como exploradores de contratos inteligentes en redes VeChain","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en évidence les compromis, d''établir explicitement des hypothèses et d''éviter les confusions en suivant des lignes directrices de comportement dérivées des observations d''Andrej Karpathy, en utilisant des protocoles tels que des explorateurs de contrats intelligents sur les réseaux VeChain","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Kompromisse zu offenbaren, Annahmen explizit zu machen und Verwirrung zu vermeiden, indem sie Verhaltensrichtlinien befolgen, die aus den Beobachtungen von Andrej Karpathy abgeleitet sind, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Smart-Contract-Explorern in VeChain-Netzwerken","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revelar compromissos, declarar suposições explicitamente e evitar confusão, seguindo diretrizes comportamentais derivadas das observações de Andrej Karpathy, utilizando protocolos como exploradores de contrato inteligente nas redes VeChain","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять компромиссы, явно заявлять предположения и избегать путаницы, следуя поведенческим рекомендациям, полученным из наблюдений Андрея Карпати, используя протоколы, такие как исследователи смарт-контрактов в сетях VeChain","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية الكشف عن التبادل، وإعلان الفرضيات صراحة، وتجنب الارتباك، باتباع إرشادات سلوكية مستمدة من ملاحظات Andrej Karpathy، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل مستكشفي العقد الذكي على شبكات VeChain"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging LLM coding pitfalls","Generating contract interactions on VeChain","Analyzing tradeoffs in smart contract development"],"zh":["调试 LLM 编码陷阱","在 VeChain 上生成合约交互","分析智能合约开发中的权衡"],"ja":["LLM コーディングの落とし穴のデバッグ","VeChain 上でのコントラクトの相互作用の生成","スマートコントラクト開発におけるトレードオフの分析"],"ko":["LLM 코딩의 함정 디버깅","VeChain에서 계약 상호작용 생성","스마트 계약 개발에서의 트레이드 오프 분석"],"es":["Depuración de errores de codificación de LLM","Generación de interacciones de contrato en VeChain","Análisis de compromisos en el desarrollo de contratos inteligentes"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs de codage LLM","Génération d''interactions de contrat sur VeChain","Analyse des compromis dans le développement de contrats intelligents"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei der LLM-Codierung","Generierung von Contract-Interaktionen in VeChain","Analyse von Kompromissen bei der Entwicklung von Smart Contracts"],"pt":["Depuração de armadilhas de codificação LLM","Geração de interações de contrato nas redes VeChain","Análise de compromissos no desenvolvimento de contrato inteligente"],"ru":["Отладка ловушек кодирования LLM","Генерация взаимодействий контракта в сетях VeChain","Анализ компромиссов при разработке смарт-контрактов"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء برمجة LLM","توليد تفاعلات العقد على شبكات VeChain","تحليل التبادل في تطوير العقد الذكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Biases toward caution over speed, requiring judgment for trivial tasks"],"zh":["偏向谨慎而非速度，需要对琐碎任务进行判断"],"ja":["速度よりも慎重さに偏向するため、些細なタスクには判断が必要"],"ko":["속도보다慎重함으로 기울기 때문에 사소한 작업에는 판단이 필요"],"es":["Sesgos hacia la precaución sobre la velocidad, requiriendo juicio para tareas triviales"],"fr":["Biais en faveur de la prudence plutôt que de la vitesse, nécessitant un jugement pour les tâches triviales"],"de":["Voreingenommenheit gegenüber Vorsicht anstelle von Geschwindigkeit, die ein Urteil für triviale Aufgaben erfordert"],"pt":["Sesgos em direção à prudência em vez de velocidade, requerendo julgamento para tarefas triviais"],"ru":["Предвзятость в сторону осторожности, а не скорости, требующая суждения для тривиальных задач"],"ar":["انحياز تجاه الحذر بدلاً من السرعة، يتطلب الحكم في المهام التافهة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ada2bbcebc34310151b3ec66d6d2f9368f2a210edf95d60318fcb1fd6bfd9459","qualityScore":34}');
